<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremiah</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin rama Anathoth khuaa puithiamte zînga mi Hilkia fapa Jeremia thute;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda lal, Amona fapa Josia hun lai, a lal kum sâwm leh kum thumnaah chuan a hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal lai pawhin a lo thleng a; Juda lal Josia fapa Zedekia kum sâwm leh kum khatna tâwp, Jerusalem sala hruai thla ngana thleng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pum chhûnga ka siam hma chein ka hria che a, Chhûl ata i chhuah hma pawhin ka serh hrang che a, Hnamte hnêna zâwlneiah ka ruat tawh a che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “E, Lalpa Pathian, ngai teh, thu ka sawi thiam lo, ka naupang si,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti a: “ ‘Ka naupang,’ ti suh, Ka tirhna che apiang hnênah i kal ang a, Thu ka pêk che apiang i sawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmahni avângin hlau suh la, Chhan chhuak tûr chein i hnênah ka awm e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan a han ban a, ka kâ a khawih a; tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah: “Ngai rawh, i kâah ka thute ka dah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En teh, hnamte leh lalram chungah te, Pawt chhuak tûr te, ṭhiat tûr te, tichhe tûr te, Paih thla tûr te, siam ṭha tûr leh din tûrin Hemi nîah hian ka dah che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu lo pawh Lalpa thu ka hnênah a lo thleng a, “Jeremia, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Tin, kei chuan, “Vaiumkhal thing ṭang ka hmu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “I hmu fuh hle mai; ka thu hlen tûrin ka inrâlring reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu a vawi hnihnaah ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a, “Eng nge i hmuh?” tiin. Tin, kei chuan, “Bêl so bawrh bawrh, a rawng hmâr lam hawi ka hmu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti a: “Rama chêng zawng zawngte chungah hmâr lam ata thil ṭha lo a lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, hmâr lam lalram hnam zawng zawng ka ko dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; “An lo kal ang a, Jerusalem kawngka luhnaah te, a vêl kulh bang zawng zawng bulah te leh, Juda khawpui zawng zawngah te an lalṭhutthlêng an hûng ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi kalsan a, pathian dangte hnênah rimtui an hâl a, anmahni kutchhuak ngei an bia a; hêng an suahsualna zawng zawng chungchânga ka thurêlte chu ka puang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, puan veng la, tho la, thu ka pêk zawng zawng che chu an hnênah va sawi rawh. An hmaah zâm suh ang che; chuti lo chuan, an hmaah ka tizâm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai rawh, hemi nîah hian a ram pum puite, Juda lalte, a hotute, a puithiamte leh chumi rama mi lakah chuan, khawpui kulh nei leh thîr ban leh ngên bangah ka siam che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An bei ang chia; mahse, an hneh lo vang che. Chhan chhuak tûr chein i hnênah ka awm si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a, heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kal la, Jerusalem beng hriatah au rawh, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I tleirâwl laia i ngilneihzia te, Inhual laia mi hmangaihziate kha ka hre reng e; Tuk loh ram, thlalêra mi zuizia kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel chu Lalpa tâna serh hran, a rah pung hmasa a ni, Amah ei raltu apiangin thiam loh an chang ang a, An chungah chhiatna a lo thleng ang,’ ” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Jakoba chhûngte leh Israel chhûng zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In thlahtuten keimahah fel lohna eng nge an hmuh, Ka laka hla takah an lên bova, Eng mah lo mai an ûma, an lo uanthuan tâk ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘ Lalpa - Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuaka, Thlalêr, ram ro, khuarkhurum hmun, Thihna hlim leh ram ro hmun, Tu ma kal tlang ngai lohna, Tu ma awm lohna hmuna min hruai tlangtu kha khawiah nge?’ an ti hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram ṭha takah, a rah leh ṭhatna ei tûrin, Ka hruai lût che u a; Mahse, in han luh chuan Ka ram in tibawlhhlawh a, Ka rochan chu thil tenawmah in siam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiamte pawhin, ‘ Lalpa chu khawiah nge?’ an ti lo va, Dân hmangtuten mi hre hek lo; Rorêltute ka lakah an hel a; Zâwlneiten Baala hmingin thu an sawi a, Thil sâwt lo tûrte an ûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, ka khing ang che u a, In fate fa lehte pawh ka la khing fo vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kittim thliarkârah va kal ula, en rawh u, Kedar-ah mî tîr ula, ngun takin ngaihtuah rawh u, Hetiang thil a awm ngai emaw hriat nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnam dangte chuan an pathian an thlâk ngai em ni, Pathian tak ni hlei lo pawh? Ka mite erawh chuan an ropuina chu, Thil sâwt lo takin an thlâk ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw vânte u, mak ti ula, Râp che u sela, ṭiau vek rawh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka miten thil pahnih an tisual si: Kei, nunna tuikhur hi mi kalsan a, Tuikhuah an ker a, tuikhuah khi, tui tling thei lo tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel chu chhiahhlawh em ni? Vânlunga piang em ni? Engati nge hnehchhiaha a awm tâk ni
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sakeibaknei vânglaite chuan rûm khumin, A chungah aw an chhuah a; A ram chu an tichhe zo ta; A khawpuite pawh luahtu nei lovin a kâng fai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noph mi leh Tahpanes mite pawhin, I chhîp an tikawlh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian chuan kawnga a hruai lai chea I tlân bosan avângin, Chu chu i chunga i thlentîr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nile tuite in tûra Aigupta kawng i zawh hi, Eng nge i tân hlâwk dâwn ni? Luipui tui in tûra Assuria kawng i zawh pawh hi, Eng nge i tân hlâwk dâwn ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I suahsualna chuan a tuartîr ang chia, I hnungtawlh ṭhinna chuan a zilhhau vang che; Mi ṭihna nei lova Lalpa i Pathian i kalsan hi, Thil sual tak leh kha tak a ni tih hi lo hre chhuak la, Hmu fiah tawh rawh,” tih hi Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hmân ata tawh i nghâwngkawl titliakin, I hruite pawh i tichat tawh si a, ‘I rawng ka bâwl tawh lo vang,’ i ti a, Tlâng sâng tinahte, thing buk hnuai apiangahte, Kûnin i hur thil i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chi dik tak hmangin grêp ṭha tak ka phun che a, Engtiziaa inleta, ka tân grêp suaka lo chang ta nge i nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chingalin insilin sahbawn tam tak hmang mah la, I khawlohna chu ka mit hmuhah a lang tho a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“ ‘Ka intibawlhhlawh hlei nêm, Baala-te pawh ka zui hek lo,’ Engtin nge i tih theih le? Kawr ruama i awm dânte en la, I thiltih tâkte chu hre rawh; Sanghâwngseilâ hur lai ang riai i nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram sabengtung thlalêra awm ṭhîn, a hur laia hnâr lên ruai ang; A châkna chu tuin nge dâl zo vang? A zawngtu chu intihah duh suh se, A hunah chuan an hmu mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I kêah pheikhawk bun lovin awm suh la, I dang pawh ro suh se; Nang erawh chuan, ‘Beisei a bo zo ta, Awze mite ka ngai a, anmahni ka ûm ang,’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rûkru an phâwka a zak angin, Israel chhûngte chu an zak ta. Anmahnite, an lalte, an hotute, An puithiamte, an zâwlneite pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thing bul hnênah, ‘Ka pa i ni,’ tia, Lung bul hnêna, ‘Mi hringtu i ni,’ titute chu. Hmachhawn lovin an tukkhum chhah mi chhawn ta zâwk a. An mangan hunah erawh chuan, ‘Tho la, min chhandam ta che,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I pathian, i siamte kha khawiah nge an awm tâk ni? Anni chu tho zâwk sela, i mangan laiin an chhandam thei mahna che; Aw Juda, i pathiante chu i khawpuite zât lai an ni alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Engah nge ka chungah in vui fo le? In zain ka chungah thil in tisual si,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“In fate ka vua, a sâwt lo, An ṭhat phah chuang hek lo.” Sakeibaknei koham ang maiin, Nangmahni khandaih chuan in zâwlneite a ei ral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw ṭhangtharte u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u! “Israel tân thlaler ram ang ka ni em ni? Thim chhah mup ram ka ni em ni? Ka mite chuan engah nge, ‘Kan chhuak fel ta, I hnênah kan lêt leh lo vang,’ an tih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nula chuan a incheimawinate a theihnghilh theiin, Mo thar chuan a inthuamna a theihnghilh thei em ni? Ka mite erawh chuan ni chhiar sên loh chhûng Min theihnghilh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngaizâwngtu hmuh theihna tûrin i awm dân i va uluk ve! Hmeichhe sual hnênahte pawh i awm dân i zirtîr tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I pawnfênahte pawh mi rethei pawi khawih lote Nunna thisen a kai a. Mi in an rawk lai kut man pawh ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu achhapah nangmah chuan, ‘Thiam ka chang e, ka lakah a thinurna a dai,’ I la ti leh ta lai a, Ngai rawh, ‘Ka sual lo ve,’ i tih avângin, I chung thu ka rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I awm dân thlâk zung zungin, Engah nge i vah vêl ṭhin? Assuria i zahpui ang bawk khân, Aigupta pawh i la zahpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I kutte khumin an hnên ata i la chhuak leh ang, Lalpan i rinnate chu a paih thla si a, Anmahniah chuan i hmuingîl lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miin nupui ma sela, Amah kalsanin pasal dang pawm se, Ani chuan a lo pawm leh ang em? A ram chuan a bawlhhlawh phah hial dâwn lâwm ni? Nang erawh chu tlangvâl tam tak hnênah i hur bo va, Chuti chung chuan ka hnênah i lo kîr leh ang maw?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tlâng kawlh vul lamah i mitte lên chho la, en rawh, An mutpui lohna hmun che khawiah nge? Thlalêra Arabia mi ang maiin Anmahni nghâkin kawng sîrahte i ṭhu reng ṭhîn; I hurnate leh i suahsualnatein Ram chu i tibawlhhlawh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan ruah chu sûrtîr a ni lo va, Ruah hnuhnûng pawh a sûr hek lo. Mi hur chal putin i pu a, I zak duh hauh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ka Pa, ka tleirâwl laia mi hruaitu i ni,’ tiin, Mi au hlim hlawl a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘A thin a ur kumkhua dâwn em ni? A tâwp thlengin em ni a ur dâwn?’ Ngai rawh, chutiang chuan i ṭawng ngei a; Mahse, a sual thei ang berin thil i ti a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Josia lal laiin Lalpan ka hnênah heti hian a ti a: “Hnungtawlh hmang Israel thiltih kha i hmu em? Tlâng sâng tinahte chhova, thing buk tin hnuaiahte a hurna thil a tihte kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan hêng thil zawng zawng a tih hnuah hian ka hnênah a la kîr leh êm ang chu, ka ti a; mahse, a lo kîr chuang lo va. Tin, a laizâwnnu, bum hmang Juda chuan a hmu ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan hnungtawlh hmang Israel chu a uire avâng ngeia ka mâka, mâkna lehkha ka pêk a hmuh pawhin a laizâwnnu, bum hmang Juda chuan a hlau chuang lo va, chutih ahnêkin a va kal a, hurna thil a va ti ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a hur nawmnah mai mai avângin ram chu a tibawlhhlawh zo ta a; thing bul, lung bul hnênah a uire ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin a laizâwnnu, bum hmang Juda chu thinlung taka lo kîr lovin a der maiin a lo kîr a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan ka hnênah heti hian a ti a: “Hnungtawlh ṭhîn Israel chu a laizâwnnu, bum hmang Juda ai chuan fel zâwkin a intilang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kal la, hêng thu hi hmâr lamah va puang rawh: ‘Hnungtawlh hmang Israel, lo kîr rawh,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; ‘Thinrim hmêl puin ka en lo vang che u, Zahngai thei tak ka ni si a,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, ‘Ka thinur kumkhua lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian chunga i helna te, Thing buk hnuaia awze mite hnêna i inphalraina te, Ka ṭawngka chhuak i âwih lohnatea I khawlohnaah chuan thupha chawi rawh,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw hnungtawlh hmang fate u, lo kîr rawh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Kîlkawitu che u ka ni si a, In zîng ata khawpuia mi pakhat, Chhûngkuaa mi pahnih ka la ang che u a, Zion-ah ka hruai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungdum zâwng tak berâmpute ka pe ang che u a, annin hriatna leh hriat thiamnatein an châwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, in lo tama, rama in lo pun hunah, chûng nîahte chuan annin, ‘ Lalpa thuthlung bâwm,’ an ti tawh ngai lo vang; an rilruah a lût lo vang a, hriat pawh an hre reng hek lo vang; an thlahlel tawh lo vang a, an siam leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Jerusalem chu Lalpa Lalṭhutthlêng an vuah ang a, chutah chuan hnam zawng zawngte chu Lalpa hmingin Jerusalem-ah an lo kal khâwm ang. An thinlung sual khauhna ang chuan an kal tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng nîahte chuan Juda chhûngte chu Israel chhûngte nên an awm ho vang a, hmâr lam ram aṭangin, in thlahtute hnêna ro luah tûra ka pêk ramah chuan an lo chhuak ho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan, ‘Hnam tam takte zînga roluah tûr ṭha ber, Ram nuam tak mai pe chein, Fanaute zînga dah che ka duhzia mai chu! “Ka Pa,” tia mi lama, Mi zuina ata i pên bo loh ka lo ring a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nupui bum hmangin a pasal a uiresan angin, Aw Israel chhûngte u, mi bum ta a nih hi,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tlâng kawlh vul chungah thâwm a awm e, Israel fate ṭap leh thil ngên thâwm chu, Lalpa Pathian an theihnghilha, An awm dân an tihkhawloh zawh tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Aw hnungtawlh hmang fate u, lo kîr ula, In hnungtawlh ṭhinnate chu ka tidam ang e.” “En teh, i hnênah kan lo kal a nih hi, Nang chu Lalpa kan Pathian i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tlângte hi a sâwt lo va, Tlâng chunga thâwm ri hum hum te hi; Israel chhandamna chu Lalpa kan Pathian ngeiah hian a ni a awm ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, chu thil tenawm tak chuan kan tleirâwl lai ata kan thlahtuten tha an sênna chu a ei ral ta; an berâm rualte, an ran rualte, an fanute, an fapate chenin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zakin i mu ang u khai, kan mualphonain min khuh rawh se; Lalpa kan Pathian chungah thil kan tisual a, keini leh kan thlahtuten kan tleirâwl lai ata, vawiin ni thlengin Lalpa kan Pathian ṭawngka kan âwih loh avângin.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw Israel, i inlamlêt chuan, ka hnênah ngei i lo lêt tûr a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “I tenawmnate ka mit hmuh loh va i dah bova,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tihtak zeta, thurêl dik tak hmanga, fel taka, ‘ Lalpa a nuna a nun chhûng chu,’ tia chhia i chham chuan, Hnamte chu amahah chuan engthâwl an inti ang a, Amah chu an chhuang tawh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda mite leh Jerusalem hnênah Lalpa in Pathian chuan heti hian a ti e: “In lei khêk chu let ula, Hlîng zîngahte chi theh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni Judai rama mi leh Jerusalem-a chêngte u, Lalpa tân in serhtan ula, in thinlung serhtan rawh u; Chuti lo chu, in thil sual tihte avângin, Ka thinurna chu mei angin a chhuak ang a, Tu ma ṭhelh theih lohvin a kâng dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai ramah hril ula, Jerusalem-ah puang rawh u: Ram pumah chuan tawtawrâwt hâm ula, Ring takin au rawh u; ‘Rawn inkhâwm ula, kulh nei khawpuiahte i lût ang u,’ ti ru.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion lamah puanzâr khai ula, Himna zawngin tlân ula, muang suh u, Hmâr ata thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen dâwn, Chhiatna nasa tak mai chu.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngaw hnuai pik ata sakeibaknei a chhuak e, Hnamte tichhetu tûr chu; A hmun ata a chhuak ta, a lo kal mêk e, I ram tiṭiau tûr leh, I khawpuite luahtu nei lo khawpa tiram tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan saiip puan sin ula, ṭap ula, chiau vawng vawng rawh u; Kan laka Lalpa thinurna nasa tak mai chu A la kiang si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a lo ni ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Lal thinlung a zâm zo vang a, Hotute thinlung pawh; Puithiamte chu an hrilhhai ang a; Zâwlneite chuan mak an ti êm êm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “A, Lalpa Pathian, He mite leh Jerusalem hi nasa takin i bum a nih hi, ‘Muanna in nei ang,’ i ti a, Khandaihin nunna a chhun tâk zâwk si hi,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan he mite leh Jerusalem hnênah, “Thlalêr tlâng kawlh vul ata thli lum tak, ka fanu, ka mite zâp fai tûr ni lo, thliar fai tûr ni hek lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />thli na lutuk ka thuin a lo thleng dâwn a ni; tûnah pawh an chung thu rêltu hi keimah ka ni,” tih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai teh, a lo chho vang, chhûmpui angin, A tawlailîr ṭhâwngaleivir ang maite chu; A sakawrte chu mupui aiin an chak zâwk, Kan chung a va pik êm! Kan ral thûm a nih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, suahsualna ata i thinlung tlêng fai la, Chhandama i awm theihna tûrin; Eng chen nge i ngaihtuahna sual chu i pai dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan ram ata aw a lo chhuak a, Ephraim tlâng aṭangin thil ṭha lo a puang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hnamte chu hrilh ula, Jerusalem-ah puang rawh u, Ngai teh, ram hla tak ata beitute an lo thleng, Judai khawpuite chungah an chhuah e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlawhhma vêngtute ang maiin a vêlin an hual a, Ka chunga a hel avângin,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“I awm dân leh i thiltihte chuan, Hêng hi i chungah a thlen a nih hi, Hei hi i chhiatna tûr chu a ni, A na êm êm a, i thinlung a chhun a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thin a nâ, ka thin a nâ, Ka thinlung ngeiah a nâ, Ka chhûngah ka thinlung a buai zo ta, Ka awm hle hle thei lo, Aw ka nunna, tawtawrâwt ri, Indona hawhaw i hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chhiatna chungah chhiatna a thleng ta, Ram pum pui chu rawkin a awm ta, Ka puan inte chu an tichhe phut a, Ka puanzârte pawh mit khap kâr lovah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eng chen nge indona puanzâr ka hmuh anga, Tawtawrâwt ri ka hriat ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka mite chu an â êm a, mi hre si lo va, Naupang â tak, hriatna nei lo ang mai an ni, Thil sual tih an thiam a, Thil ṭha tih dân erawh chu an thiam si lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilung hi ka han en a, ngai teh, Eng mah awm lo leh ruakin a awm; Vânte pawhin êng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlângte ka en a, ngai teh, a nghîng a, Mual zawng zawng pawh an phe hlawk hlawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka han en a, ngai teh, mihring an awm lo va, Chunglêng sava zawng zawng pawh an thlâwk bo zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka han en a, ngai teh, Thlawhhma ṭhate chu thlalêr a chang ta, Khawpui zawng zawng pawh a chim zo ta, Lalpa leh a thinurna nasa tak hmaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ram pum pui a ṭiau ang a; mahse, ka titâwp hlen lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan lei chuan a sûn ang a, Chung lam vânte pawh a thim a. Thu ka sawi tawh a, ka tum tawh a, Ka inchhîr lo va, ka inlamlêt dâwn hek lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sakawr chunga chuang leh thal ngul hmangtute thâwmah, Khawpui pum pui chu an tlânchhia a. Ngawah an lût a, lungpui hmunahte an lâwn a. Khaw tin mai an rauhsan a, Luahtu pakhat mah awm lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, nang, rawka i awm hun chuan engtin nge i tih ang? Puan sen lâra inthuamin, Incheina rangkachaka incheiin, I mitte hnawih dur mah la, I intimawi thlâwn mai mai a ni; I tlangvâlte chuan an hmusit tho chia, I nun lâk an tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hmeichhe nau vei au thâwm ang ka hria a, Fa tîr hringtu na tuar lai, Zion fanu thaw huam huam ri chu; A kutte phara, “Ka chung a va pik êm! Tualthattute vângin ka nun a chau zo ta,” ti chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Jerusalem khawlaiahte tlân vêl ula, En ula, chhinchhiah ula, a mualzâwlte zawng ula, Mi pakhat tal fel taka tia, thutak zawng reng in hmuh theih chuan, Jerusalem chu ka ngaidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘ Lalpa a nuna a nun chhûng chu,’ ti mah sela, Dâwtin chhia an chham mai a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , thutak chu i hmuh duh zâwng a ni lâwm ni? Anni chu i vua a; mahse, an lungngai chuang lo; Anni chu i tiral a, i thununna chu an pawm duh chuang lo. Lungpui aia changin an hmêl an tichang ta, An inlamlêt duh miau lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “Hêng hi mi chhia an ni a, an â bawk a. Lalpa dân, an Pathian thurêl chu an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi liante hnênah ka va kal ang a, Ka va bia ang a, Anni chuan Lalpa dân leh an Pathian thurêlte chu an hriat kha,” ka ti a. Mahse, hêng mite hian thu khat vuain, Nghâwngkawl an titliak a, phuarna hruite chu an tichat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngaw hnuaia sakeibakneiin anmahni a seh ang a, Thlalêr chinghniain anmahni a ei ral ang; Keitê chuan an khawpuite a châng a. Chuta lo chhuak apiang chu a pawt sawm ang, An bawhchhiatnate a tama, An hnungtawlhnate a nasat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engtin nge ka ngaihdam theih ang che? I fate chuan mi kalsan a, Pathian ni hlei lote chhâlin chhia an chham a, Tlai deuhva ka hrai hnuah an uire a, Nawhchizuar inahte an vir huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zîng lama sakawr hrai puar ang mai an ni a, Mi tin mahni ṭhenawmpa nupui îtin an hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng thilte avâng hian ka hrem lo vang maw?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Hetiang hnam chungah hian, Phuba ka inlâksak lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A palahte chuan lâwn lût ula, tichhe rawh u; Amaherawhchu, tichhe zo vek suh u, A zârte chu la bo ula, Lalpa ta a ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte chuan, Ka chungah vervêk takin an ti si a,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chu dawtheia ngaiin, “Eng mah a ti thei hlei lâwng e. Chhiatna kan chungah a lo thleng lo vang, Ṭâm emaw, khandaih emaw kan tuar hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlneite pawh puarpawlêng mai an ni ang a, Anmahniah thu chu a awm si lo; An chungah chutiang chu tih a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Chutiang thu chu in sawi avângin, ngai rawh, I kâa ka thute chu meiah ka chantîr ang a, Hêng mipuite hi thingah; tin, a kâng zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai rawh u aw Israel chhûngte u, Hla tak ata hnam i hnênah ka rawn hruai ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Hnam chak tak mai, hnam upa tawh tak, An ṭawng i hriat loh, an thusawi i hriat theih loh hnamte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An thal bâwm chu thlân inhawng a ni a, An zain mi chak tak an ni vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I buh seng sa leh i ei tûr an ei zo vek ang; I fanute, i fapate ei tûr ngei chu. I ran rualte, i berâm rualte an ei ang a, I grêp hruite, i theipui kûngte an ei ang a, I kulh nei khawpui, i rinpui ber ṭhinte ngei kha. Khandaihin an tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mahse, chûng nîahte pawh chuan ka tichimit hlen lo vang che u,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, ‘Engah nge Lalpa kan Pathianin hêng thil zawng zawng hi kan chungah a tih ni?’ i miten an tih hunah chuan, ‘Mi kalsana, in ramah pathian dangte rawng an bâwl angin, in ram lovah, awze mite rawng in bâwl ang,’ an hnênah i ti tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakoba chhûngte zîngah hei hi sawi chhuak ula, Judai ramah puang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Aw hriat thiamna nei lo, mi âte u, Mit neia hmu si lote u, beng neia hre si lote u, Hei hi ngaithla rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi ṭih lo maw, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Ka hmaah hian in khûr lo vang maw? Kei hi tuipui kuam chin atâna ṭiaupho, Kumkhuaa a liam lohna tûra daidanna, Tuipui fâwn invawrh vêl mah se, a liam chuan theih lohva, Ri hum hum mah se, a pelh theih loh tûr siamtu chu ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, he mite hian thinlung luhlul leh hel hmang an pu a, An hel a, an tlân bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An thinlung pawhin, ‘ Lalpa kan Pathian, a hun taka Ruah hmasa leh ruah hnuhnûng sûrtîrtu, Buh seng hun bi min ruatsaktu chu i ṭih ang u,’ an ti hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng thilte hi in khawlohnate chuan a tibo va, In sualnate chuan thil ṭha a chântîr che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Ka mite zîngah mi suaksual an awm si a, Sava vehtuin a chân angin an châng reng a, Thang an kam a, mite an âwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bâwm savaa khat ang maiin, An inte chu bumnain a khat a; Chuvângin, an lo lian a, an hausak phah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An lo thau va, an lo hnûm a; A ni, an suahsualna thiltihte chuan chin tâwk a nei lo; Pa nei lote hmuingîlna tûrin an lamah an ṭang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng thil avângte hian ka hrem lo vang em ni?’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Hetiang hnam chungah hian ka nunna chuan Phuba a la dâwn lo vem ni?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan thilmak tak leh râpthlâk tak a lo awm ta:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zâwlneite chuan dâwt thu an hril a, Puithiamte chuan an thû thûin ro an rêl a; Ka mite chuan chutiang tih chu an duh a ni. A tâwpah chuan engtin nge in tih tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Benjamina fate u, Jerusalem chhûng ata In himna tûrin tlân bo ula; Tekoa-ah tawtawrâwt hâm ula, Beth-hakkerem-ah hriattîrna chhuah rawh u. Hmâr lam ata chhiatna a lo thawk e, Tihchhiatna nasa tak mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion fanu hmelṭha tak leh no tak chu Ka tibo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Berâmpute, an berâm rualte nên a hnên an lo thleng ang a, A vêlah an puan inte an kaih ang a, Mahni hmun ṭheuhvah an tla ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Amah do tûrin inpuahchah rawh u, Tho ula, chhûn laiah i bei ang u, Kan tân a va pawi em! Ni a lo her ta a, Tlai lam hlim a lo sâng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tho ula, zânah i bei mai ang u khai! A in ṭha ṭhate i tichhia ang u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “A thingte kit ula, Jerusalem beih nân mual pâwng siam rawh u, Khawpui hrem tûr chu hei hi a ni. A chhûngah chuan hnehchhiahna hlîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuichhunchhuahin tui a tichhuak ang maiin A suahsualna chu a tichhuak ṭhîn, A chhûngah chuan pâwngnêkna leh inrawkna a awm tih hriat a ni a, Ka hmaah chuan natna leh inhliamnate a awm reng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka rilruin a hransan daih hma che hian Aw Jerusalem, fîmkhur hle rawh, Chuti lo chuan, luahtu nei lo rama siam chein, Ka tiṭiau hlauh dah ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel awm chhunte chu grêp angin lo fai vek ula, Grêp lotu angin a zârte chu vai nawn rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ngaihthlâk theih nân tu nge ka biak anga, Tu nge ka hriattîr ang? Ngai teh, beng lam serhtan loh an ni a, an ngaithla thei lo; Ngai teh, Lalpa thu chu an tân thil hmuhsitawm a ni a, Lâwmna rêng an nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Lalpa thinurnain ka khat a, Insûm hi ka ning ta. “Khawlaia naupang chungah hrithla la, Tlangvâl awm khâwmte chungah pawh, A nupui rualin pasal pawh lâk a ni ang a, Upate leh tarchhiate pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An inte chu mi dang hnênah pêk a ni ang a, An thlawhhmate leh an nupuite nên; Chumi rama chêngte chungah chuan ka kut ka lek dâwn si a,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A tê ber aṭangin a lian ber thleng pawhin, Mi tin duhâmnain an khat si a; Zâwlneite leh puithiamte meuh pawh, Mi tin hlemhle takin an che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite hliamte chu ngaihsam takin, ‘A ṭha alâwm, a ṭha alâwm!’ tiin an thawi a, A ṭha hauh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil tenawm an tih pawhin an zak em ni? Hnai lo ve! An zak tawp lo va, an hmai pawh a sen hek lo. Chuvângin, tlute zîngah chuan an tlu ve ang; Anni ka hrem hunah chuan paihthlâkin an awm ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kalkawngahte ding ula, en rawh u, Kawng ṭha awmna kawng hlunte chu zâwt rawh u, Tah chuan kal ula, In thlarau tân chawlhna in hmu ang. Anni erawh chuan, ‘Tah chuan kan kal lo vang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, in tân râlvêngtute ka ruat a, ‘Tawtawrâwt ri chu ngaithla rawh u,’ tiin. Anni erawh chuan, ‘Kan ngaithla lo vang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw, hnamte u, ngaithla ula, Aw, pung khâwmhote u, an chunga lo thleng tûr chu hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, leilung, ngaithla rawh! Ngai teh, he mite chungah hian chhiatna ka rawn thlen dâwn - An ngaihtuahna rahte ngei chu; Ka thute an ngaihthlâk loh avângin; Ka dânte lah chu an paih thla dêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eng atân nge Seba ata beraw te, Ram hla tak ata fu te ka hnên a lo thlen ṭhin le? In hâlral inthawinate chu lawm tlâk a ni lo va, In inthawinate chuan mi tilâwm hek lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Hêng mite hnênah hian tlûknate ka dah ang a, Tah chuan pate chu an fapate nên an tlu za ang a, Ṭhenawm leh a ṭhian pawh an boral ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, hmâr lam ram ata mite an lo kal e, Lei hmun tâwp ata hnam ropui tak mai an lo thawk chhuak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thal ngul leh fei an keng a, Nunrâwng tak, zahngaihna rêng rêng nei lo an ni, An thâwm chu tuipui ri hum hum ang a ni a; Sakawr chungahte an chuang a, Mi tin râl tu mi anga inthuamin, Aw, Zion fanu, an rawn bei dâwn a che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An thangva kan hria a, kan kutte a zâwi zo ta, Nâ chuan min man ta, Hmeichhe nau vei nâ ang mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ramah kal chhuak suh ula, Kalkawngah pawh kal hek suh u, Tah chuan hmêlma khandaih a awm si a, Kil tinah râl a ṭi e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw, ka mi, ka fanu, saiip puan fêng la, Vut zîngah tâl rawh; Fapa mal sûn angin sûn la, ṭap vak vak teh, Tichhetu kan chungah a lo thleng thut dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka mite zîngah chhintuah leh fiahtuah ka siam chia, An awm dân i hriata, i fiah theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An zain hel hmang, luhlul tak, Sawichhiat hmanga vâk vêl, Dâr leh thîr ang an ni a, Chhe takin an che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pûmin a chhêm huau huau va, Meiah chuan suan chu a tui ral a, Tihthianghlim tumna chu a thlâwn mai a ni, Mi sualte paih bo an ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mite chuan tangkaraw êkchhia an vuah ang, Lalpan anmahni a hnâwl avângin.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa hnên ata Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa in kawngkâah chuan ding la, chutah chuan he thu hi puang la, heti hian ti rawh: ‘Nangni Juda mi zawng zawng, Lalpa be tûra hêng kawngkâa lûtte chuan Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u!’”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “In awm dân leh in thiltihte chu siam ṭha ula, he hmunah hian ka chêntîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Hei hi Lalpa in, Lalpa in, Lalpa in a nih hi,’ tih dâwt thute hi ring suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In awm dân leh in thiltihte chu in siam ṭhat takmeuhva, mi leh a ṭhenawm kâra thu dik taka in rêlsaka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hnam dang mite, pa nei lote, hmeithaite in hnehchhiah lohva, he hmunah hian mi fel thisen in chhuah lohva, in ṭhat lohna tûra pathian dangte in zui hek loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />he ram, hmasâng ata in thlahtute hnêna ka pêkah hian kumkhuain ka chêntîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, dâwt thu, sâwtna awm hlei lo chu in ring zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rûkruin, tualthatin, uirêin, dâwta chhia chhamin Baala hnênah rimtui hâlin, pathian dang, in hriat ngai lohte zuiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />he in, keima hming ngei vuahah hian ka hmaah lo dingin, hêng thil tenawm zawng zawngte hi ti zêl chungin, ‘Chhan chhuah ka ni ta,’ in ti dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He in, ka hming ngei vuah hi, in mit hmuhah suamhmangte pûk ang em ni? Ngai teh u, kei, keimah ngei hian ka hmu alâwm,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A tîra ka hming ka chêntîrna, ka hmun Silo-ah chuan kal teh u, ka mi Israel-te suahsualna avânga ka thiltih chu va en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûnah hian hêng thil zawng zawngte hi in tiha, zîng tak taka thova in hnêna thu ka sawi ka sawite hi in ngaihthlâk lohva, ka lam che ua in chhân loh avâng hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Silo chunga ka tih ang khân he in, ka hming vuah, nangmahni leh in thlahtute hnêna ka hmun pêk, in rin ṭhin chungah hian ka ti dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In unau zawng zawng, Ephraim chi pum pui meuh pawh ka paih chhuak ang khân, ka mit hmuh ata ka paih chhuak ang che u,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chuvângin, hêng mite tân hian ṭawngṭai suh la, au chhuakin ṭawngṭai suh la, ka hnênah dîlsak hek suh; ka ngaithla dâwn si lo che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem kawtlaiahte an thiltih chu i hmu lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangten thing an fawm a, an paten mei an chhêm a, hmeichhiaten vân lalnu hnêna hlan tûr chhang an hmet a, pathian dangte tân in tûr thilhlan an hûng chhuak a, mi tihthinrimna mai tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keimah em ni mi tihthinrim? Anmahni zahna tûrin anmahni a ni zâwk lâwm ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, he hmun chungah te, mi leh sa chungah te, rama thing leh lei rah chungah te ka thinrimna leh thinurna chu ka hrithla ang; a kâng ang a, a mit lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “In inthawinaahte chuan hâlral inthawinate belh ula, sa ei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlante emaw, inthawinate emaw chungchângah chuan in thlahtute hnênah thu ka sawi lo va, Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah lai pawh khân thu ka pe hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Ka aw ngaithla ula, in Pathian ka ni ang a, nangni pawh ka mite in ni ang; in ṭhat theihna tûrin in awm dân tûr ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi zâwm rawh u,’ tiin thu ka pe zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, an ngaithla lo va, beng an dawh hek lo; an thinlung sual chhu chhêtin anmahni thû thûin an awm ta zâwk a, hma lam pan aiin an hnungtawlh ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In thlahtute Aigupta ram ata an chhuah ni aṭanga vawiin ni thleng hian ka rawngbâwltu, zâwlnei zawng zawngte zîng tak taka thovin in hnênah ka tîr ni tin ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mahse, mi ngaithla chuang lo va, beng an dawh hek lo. An rilru an tikhauh va, an thlahtute aiin an sual ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hêng thu zawng zawngte hi an hnênah i sawi tûr a ni; mahse, an ngaithla lo vang che. Anmahni i ko vang a, an chhâng lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hnênah, ‘He hnam hi Lalpa an Pathian aw ngaithla lova, thununna dawng lo hnam an nih hi,’ i ti ang a. Thu dik a boral ta, an kâ ata paih bo a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘I sam tan la, paih bo la, hmun sâng kawlhahte ṭap chhuak rawh; Lalpan a thinurna dawngtu chhuanhote chu paih thlain a hnuchhawn ta si a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Juda fate chuan ka mit hmuhah thil sual an ti si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Ka hming vuah inah chuan tibawlhhlawh tûrin an thil tenawmte chu an dah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An fanute, an fapate hâl tûrin Ben-hinom ruamah chuan Topheth bâwlhmunte an siam a; chûng chu ka thupêk a ni lo va, ka rilruah pawh a lût ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh u, nite chu a lo thleng dâwn,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Chu ruam chu ‘Topheth’ vuah a ni tawh lo vang a, ‘Ben-hinom ruam’ vuah a ni hek lo vang; ‘Insâmna ruam’ vuah a ni tawh zâwk ang; Topheth-ah chuan an phûm ang a, phûmna tûr hmun dang a awm tawh loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mite ruang chu chunglêng savate leh ramsate chaw a ni ang. Tu mân an hnawt bo lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Juda khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem khawlaiahte chuan hlim thâwmte leh lâwm rite, moneitu awte, mo awte pawh ka tireh ang. Ram chu tihchhiat a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan Juda lalho ruhte, a hotute ruhte, puithiamho ruhte, zâwlneiho ruhte, Jerusalem-a chêngho ruhte chu an thlân ata an la chhuak ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ni te, thla te, vâna awm zawng zawng - an hmangaiha, a rawng an bâwla, an zuia, an zawna, chibai an bûkate hmaah chuan an pho chhuak ang. Lâk khâwm an ni tawh lo vang a, phûm an ni hek lo vang; lei chunga êkdûr mai tûr an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hemi chhûngkaw sual tak la awm chhun zawng zawng, ka hnawh darhna hmuna la châmbângte chuan nun aiin thih an thlang zâwk ang,” tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Chu lo pawh chu an hnênah heti hian i sawi tûr a ni: Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Mi an tlûkin an tho leh lo vang em ni? Mi a pên bovin a lo kîr leh lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engati nge he Jerusalem mite hi, Kumkhuaa hnungtawlh tûra an tawlhthlûk tâk le? Bumna an vuan tlat, kîr leh an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka beng chhiin ka ngaithla a, Tu mân thu dik an sawi lo. Tu mân, ‘Eng nge ka tih tâk?’ tiin an suahsualna an sim hek lo; Mi tinin mahni kawng an hawi ta ṭheuh va, Indona hmuna sakawr lîm buan buan ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ni, vâna vacha chuan a hunbite a hria a, ṭhuro te, vamûr te, kânghlai te chu a hun takah an lo thleng ṭhîn a. Ka mite erawh chuan Lalpa thuruat an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engtin nge, ‘Mi fing kan ni, Lalpa dân chu kan hnênah a awm,’ in tih ni? Ngai teh u, lehkhaziaktute kawlawm dawthei chuan, Dâwtah an chantîr zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi fingte chu an zakin an zâm ang a, Manin an awm ang. Ngai teh u, Lalpa thu chu an paih thla a, Anmahniah eng finna nge awm le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, an nupuite chu mi dangte hnênah ka pe ang a, An lote pawh a la neitu tûrte hnênah; Mi tin, a tê ber aṭanga a ropui ber thlengin awh hmang an ni a. Zâwlnei aṭanga puithiam thleng pawhin, Mi tinin bum an hmang si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka fanu, ka mite hliam chu ngaihsam takin, ‘A ṭha alâwm, a ṭha alâwm!’ tiin an thawi a, A ṭha hauh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil tenawm an tih hi an zak em le? Hnai lo ve! An zak hauh lo va, an hmêl pawh a sen hek lo. Chuvangin, tlute zîngah an tlu ve ang a, Anmahni hrem hunah chuan paihthlâkin an awm ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Anmahni ka tiboral vek ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Grêp hruite a rah lo vang a, Theipui kûngte a rah hek lo vang; A hnah pawh a vuai ang a, Anmahni chîm botu tûrte ka ruat tawh a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Engati nge kan la ṭhut reng le? Pung khâwm ula, khawpui kulh neiahte lût ula, Chutah chuan i boral dial ang u. Lalpa chunga kan sual tâk avângin Lalpa kan Pathian chuan tûr tui min intîrin, Boralnaah min dah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muanna kan zawng a, ṭhatna eng mah a lo thleng lo; Tihdamna hun tûr pawh, ngai teh, thlaphânna mai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An sakawr hnâr tum ri chu Dan aṭangin hriat a ni a, An sakawr chak hrâm thâwmah chuan ram pum pui chu a khûr a; An lo thleng a, a chhûnga awm zawng, An ei zo vek ta, khawpui leh a chhûnga chêngte nên.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, in zîngah rûlpui ka tîr ang a, Rûl tûr nei, khawi ngam rual lohte chu, Chûng chuan a chû ang che u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw lungngaihnaah hian inthlamuan thei tak ila aw! Chhûngrilah chuan ka thinlung a chau zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ram hla tak ata, Ka fanu, ka mite ṭap thâwm chu: “Zion-ah chuan Lalpa a awm lâwm ni? A chhûngah a Lalpa a awm na nge?” “A milim siam chawpte leh hnam dang milemtein, Engah nge mi tihthinur ni?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Buh seng hun a liam ta, Nipui a tâwp ta, chhandamin kan la awm lo!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite, ka fanu natnaah chuan ka na ve si, Ka sûn a, thlaphânnain mi vuan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead-ah thinghnai damdawi a awm lâwm ni le? Chutah chuan tidamtu a awm na nge? Engati nge ka mite, ka fanu a hrisêl theih loh?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lû hi tui ni se, ka mit hi mittui hnâr ni teh se aw! Ka mi, ka fanu thahte tân chhûn zânin ka ṭap tûr!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlalêrah khual bûk nei thei ila aw! Ka mite kalsanin, awm bosan teh ila; Uire hmang mi an ni vek si a, Bum hmang awm khâwm mai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“An lei chu thal ngul angin dâwtah an hmang a. Ramah an ṭhang lian, thutakah ṭhang lovin. Sual lamah an ṭhang zêl a, kei mi hre lovin,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mahni ṭhenawm lakah fîmkhur ṭheuh ula, In unaute rêng ring suh u; Unaute chu bum hmang an ni si; Ṭhenawmte pawh rêl hmang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahni ṭhenawm ṭheuh an bum ang, Thu dik lah an sawi lo vang; An lei dâwt sawi an zirtîr a, Khawlohna thawkin an hah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bum hmang zîngah i chêng a, An bumna avângin kei min hre duh lo,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Sipaihote Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, anni chu ka titui ang a, ka fiah ang; Ka mi, ka fanu avâng chuan eng dang nge ka tih tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An lei chu thihna thal a ni a, bum thu a sawi ṭhîn; Miin kâin a ṭhenawm hnênah rem thu sawi mah se, A thinlungah amah chu a châng khiau ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng thiltihte avâng hian ka hrem lo vang em ni?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Hnam hetiang lakah hian phuba ka la lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlângte tân ka ṭap ang a, ka chiau vawng vawng ang, Thlalêr hlobet hmunte ka sûn ang a, Tu ma kal tawh lohna tûra a kan zawh tâk avângin, Ran thâwm miten an hre tawh lo vang a, Chunglêng savate leh ramsate pawh an tlânchhia a, an kal bo tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem chu thil chhe awm khâwm maiah ka siam dâwn, Sihalte chênna hmun a ni ang; Juda khawpuite chu luahtu awm lovin ka tiram ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei hi hre thiam tûr mi fing chu tu nge ni? Puang tûra Lalpa thusawi lo dawngtu chu tu nge ni? Eng vângin nge ram chu a chhiat zawha, tu ma kal lohna tûra thlalêr anga a kan tâk ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Ka dân, an hmaa ka dah, an kalsan a, ka ṭawngka chhuak an âwih lo va, an zâwm hek lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an thinlung khauh zâwma, an thlahtuten an zirtîr Baala-te chu an zui tâk zâwk avângin,” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, anni, hêng mite ngei hi saiin ka hrai ang a, tui khâ ka intîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnam, anmahni leh an thlahtute pawhin an hriat ngai lohte zîngah ka tidarh ang. Ka tihboral vek hma chu khandaih ka ûmtîr ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngaihtuah ula, hmeichhe ṭap mite lo kal tûrin ko rawh u; Hmeichhe themthiamte chu lo kal tûrin ko bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rawn hmanhmawh sela, min rawn ṭah khum teh se, Kan mittui a luana, kan mitahte tui a puh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion ata ṭap thâwm hriat a ni si a: ‘Kan chhiat nasatzia tak chu! Kan hrilhhai êm êm a, Kan ram kan kalsan avâng leh, Kan chênnate an paihthlâk tâk avângin.’”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw nangni hmeichhiate u, Lalpa thu chu ngaithla ula, A kamchhuak thu in bengah lût sela; In fanute ṭah zirtîr ula, Mi tinin a ṭhenawmnu hnênah sûnna hla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kan tukverhahte thihna lâwn lûtin, Kan lal inahte a lût tawh si a; Pâwn aṭangin naupang tibo tûr leh, Khawlai ata tlangvâl tibo tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Mi ruangte chu tâmlakah êkdûr angin an tlu ang a, Buh sengtu buh hmaih ang maiin; Tu mân an khâwm tawh lo vang,’” ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Mi fing chuan a finna chhuang suh sela, mi chak chuan a chakna chhuang hek suh sela, mi hausa chuan a sum leh pai chhuang hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A chhuang apiang erawh chuan hei hi chhuang rawh se, kei Lalpa hi, ngilneihna te, rêl dikna te, felna te he leia hmang ṭhîntu chu ka ni tih mi hriata, a hriat thiamna chu. Hêng thilte hi ka lâwm zâwng a ni si,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, nite chu a lo thleng e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Serh tan ni si, tan loh ang maite chu ka hrem ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta te, Juda te, Edom te, Amon fate leh Moab te leh thlalêra chêng, baksam ziat kâwnghote; hnam zawng zawng chu serh tan lohte an ni si a, Israel chhûngte zawng zawng pawh thinlunga serh tan loh an ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Israel chhûngte u, in hnêna Lalpa thusawi hi ngaithla rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hnamte awm dân zir suh la, Vâna chhinchhiahnate vângin zâm hek suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite dânte chu eng mah lo mai a ni si a; Ramhnuaiah thing an kit a, Hreipuia mi themthiam kutin an chei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangkarua leh rangkachakin an chei a, A chêt loh nân thîr kilhna leh tubohvin an kilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leipuia sava hlauh tûr milim mai an ni a, An ṭawng thei lo; Mahniin an kal theih loh avângin, Put sawn an ngai ṭhîn; Anni chu hlau suh u, Thil chhia an ti thei lo va, Thil ṭha an ti thei hek lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang ang tu mah an awm lo ve, I ropui a, i hming chaknain a thang lian e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw hnamte lal, tuin nge ṭih lo vang che? Chu chu i phu rêng si a. Hnamte mi fing zawng zawng zingah te, An ram rêng rêng zîngah pawh, Nang ang rêng an awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni zawng mi mâwl leh mi â an ni a; Milim zirtîrna chu thing mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tarsis ata tangkaraw chher an rawn la a, Uphaz ata rangkachak pawh, Mi themthiam siam, rangkachak chhertu kutchhuak; An silhfênan dumpâwl leh sen duk, Mi themthiam kutchhuak vek an ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chu Pathian tak a ni; Pathian nung leh chatuana Lal a ni e. A thinurin lei a nghîng a, Hnamten a thinrimna an tuar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hnênah hetiang hian in ti tûr a ni: “Pathiante, lei leh vân siamtu ni hlei lote chu lei ata an boral ang a, vân hnuai aṭangin an bo vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thiltihtheihnain lei a siam a, A finnain khawvêl a din a, A remhriatnain vân a tipharh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A aw a chhuah chuan vânah tui a ri hum hum a: “Kâwlkil ata chhûm a chhohtîr a, Ruah sûr nân kâwl a phêttîr a, A ro bâwm ata thli a tlehtîr a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tin an mâwl a, hriatna an nei lo; Rangkachak chhertu pawhin a lem chher chu a zahpui a; A milim chhûn chu dâwt mai a ni si, Anmahniah thaw pawh a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eng mah lo mai an ni, bumna hna mai, An hremna hunah an bo mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoba chanvo zawng hetiang a ni lo, Thil zawng zawng bul a ni si; Israel hi a roluah hnam a ni a, A hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw nang, huala awm mêk chuan, I puanthuah lei ata la khâwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, tûnah rama chêngte ka thing chhuak ang, An hriat thamin ka tihrehawm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka nâ avângin ka chung a pik e, Ka hliam hi a nâ a ni. Mahse, “Hei zet hi hrehawmna chu a ni, Ka tuar mai tûr a ni,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka puan in a chhe ta, ka hrui zawng zawng a chat vek a; Ka hnên ata ka fate an chhuak a, an awm ta lo. Ka puan in zâr tûr an awm tawh lo, Ka puanzâr tungding tûrte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Berâm vêngtute chu an mâwl a, Lalpa râwn nachâng an hre lo; Chuvâng chuan an hmuingîl lo va, An berâm rualte an darh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, thâwm chu a lo thleng, Hmâr lam ata buaina nasa tak mai, Juda khawpuite tiṭiauva, Sihal chênna hmuna chantîr tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mihring awm dân chu, Mahni thu mai a ni lo tih ka hre ta; Tungchhova kal mihringah hian, A pheikhai hruai tûr a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi thunun la, a tâwk chauhvin, Thinur lovin; chuti lo chu, mi tibo dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Awze mi, nang hre ngai lote chungah leh, I hming lam ngai lote chungah I thinurna hrithla ang che; Jakoba chu an ei zo va, A ni, an ei zo va, an ei ral a, A chênna ram pawh an tiṭiau va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“He thuthlung thute hi ngaithla ula, Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte hnênah sawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, nang chuan an hnênah, Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He thuthlung thute ngaithla lotu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chu chu in thlahtute, Aigupta ram, thîr rawh tuina ata ka hruai chhuah nia, “Ka ṭawngka chhuak âwih ula, thu ka pêk zawng zawngte chu ti rawh u,” tia ka thupêk chu a ni; “Tichuan, ka mite in ni ang a, kei chu in Pathian ka ni ang,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />in thlahtute hnêna khawizû leh hnute tuia luang ram, chhechhama pêk ka tiam kha ka hlen theih nân, vawiina a awm ang hian,’ ti rawh,” a ti a. Tin, kei chuan, “Amen, aw Lalpa ,” tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Juda khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem khawlaiahte hêng thu zawng zawng hi puang la, ‘He thuthlung thute hi ngaithla ula, zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In thlahtute Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah ni ata tûn thlengin, “Ka ṭawngka chhuak âwih rawh u,” tiin ka hriattîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, an âwih lo va, beng an dawh hek lo, mi tin mahni thinlung sual ang zêlin an awm ta zâwk a. Chuvângin, hêng thuthlung thu, ti tûra thu ka pêk, an tih loh zawng zawng hi an chungah ka rawn thlen ta a ni,’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte zîngah phiarrûkna a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An thlahtu, ka thu ngaithla duh lotute khawlohna lamah chuan an lêt leh a; pathian dangte rawng bâwl tûrin an kal a; Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte chuan an thlahtute hnêna ka thuthlung siam chu an bawhchhe ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, an chungah thil ṭha lo, an pumpelh tawp loh tûr chu ka rawn thlen ang; mi au vang a; mahse, ka chhâng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Juda khawpuite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte chuan pathian, an hnêna rimtui an hâl ṭhinnate chu an au vang a; mahse, an buai hunah chuan chûng chuan an chhan him tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Juda, i pathiante chu i khawpui zât an ni si; thil zahthlâk tak, Baala hnêna rimtui hâlna tûr maichâm meuh pawh Jerusalem kawtthlêr zât ngawtin in lo din ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, hêng mite hi ṭawngṭaisak suh la, an tân dîlna emaw, aw emaw chhuah hek suh; an buai huna mi auh chu ka ngaithla dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thil tenawm tak ti chungin, Ka duh tak chuan ka inah pual eng nge a neih? Thu intiam te leh sa serh chuan Chhiatna a pumpelhtîr thei dâwn che u em ni? In sualnaa awm reng chungin in hlim thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan i hmingah, Olive thing hring, rah ṭha mawi pui, a ti chia, Ri huau huauvin a chungah mei a chhêm a, A zârte pawh a tliak zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa , nangmah phuntu che chuan, Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte sualna, Baala hnêna rimtui hlâna, mi tihthinrimna thil anmahni tâna an thawh chhuah chunga thil ṭha lo tûr thu chu i chungah a puang chhuak ta.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi hriattîr a, ka hre ta: Tichuan, nang ngeiin an thiltihte mi kawhhmuh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei erawh chu berâmno nunnêm tak, Talh tûra hruai ang mai ka ni; “Thing chu a rah chawpin i tichhia ang u khai, Mi nung ram ata ani chu i tibo daih ang u, A hming rêng rêng hriat a nih tawh loh nân,” Tia ka chunga an thil phiar chu ka lo hre hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, aw Sipaihote Lalpa , dik taka rêl ṭhîntu, Chhûngril lam leh thinlung fiah ṭhîntu, An chunga i phuba lâk chu mi hmuhtîr ang che, Ka chungchâng thu hi i hnênah ka kawltîr si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chuvâng chuan Sipaihote Lalpa chuan Anathoth mi, i nunna zawngtu, ‘Kan kuta i thih loh nân Lalpa hmingin thu sawi suh,’ titute chungchângah chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Ngai rawh u, anmahni ka hrem ang a, tlangvâlte chu khandaihin an thi ang a, an fanute, an fapate chu ṭâmin an thi ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thi bâng rêng an awm lo vang; Anathoth mite chungah chuan thil ṭha lo ka thlen dâwn si a, an hremna kum tûr ngei chu.’”
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i hnênah ka phunnawi pawhin, Nang zawng i dik ṭhîn; Mahse, ka vuina thu chu ka sawi tho dâwn. Engati nge mi suaksualte kawng chu a hmuingîl ṭhin ni? Engati nge bum hmang tawh phawtte chu nuamsa taka an awm ṭhin le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chu i phun a, a ni, zung an kai ta a; An ṭhang a, a ni, rah an chhuah ta. An hmuiah chuan i hnai a, An chhûngrilah zawng i hla si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kei erawh chu mi hria a; Mi hmu a, i lamah ka thinlung i fiah ṭhîn. Anni chu berâm talh tûr ang maiin hnûk chhuak la, An talhna ni tûr chu ruat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram chuan eng chen nge a sûn anga, Ram pum pui thlaite chu an vuai ang? A chêngate suahsualna avângin Ramsate chu an ral zo va, savate pawh; “Kan hun hnuhnûng chu a hmu lo vang,” an tih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kea kal mite chu i tlânsiakpuia, an tihchauh tawh che chuan, Engtin nge sakawrt i tlânsiakpui theih ang? Muanna ramah him takin awm mah la, Jordan ram ngawah chuan engtin nge i tih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I unaute, i pa chhûngkua ngeite chuan, Anni ngei chuan an bum tawh si chia; Anni chuan ûm chein ring takin an au chia, Thu ṭha tak sawi mah se, âwih rêng rêng suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka in leh lo kalsanin ka roluah tûr ka paih bo ta; Ka nunnain a ngaih taki chu, A hmêlmate hnênah ka pe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka roluah tûr chu ramhnuaia sakeibaknei ang a lo ni ta; Ka lakah a râwl a chhuah a; Chuvângin, ka hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka roluah tûr chu ka tân sa hel ei sava ṭial a ni em ni? Sa hel ei vaten a vêlin an bei em ni? Ramsa zawng va khâwm ula, Ei tûrin rawn hruai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Berâmpu tam takte chuan ka grêp huan an tichhia a, Ka chan chu an rap bet a, Ka chanvo nuam tak mai chu Thlalêr ram ṭiau an chantîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram ṭiauvah an siam ta a, A ṭiau va, ka hnênah a vui a ni, A ram pum pui a ṭiau va; Mahse, tu mân an ngaihsak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlalêra tlâng kawlh zawng zawngahte, Tichhetute an lo thleng ta a; Ram tâwp lehlam aṭanga lehlam thlengin Lalpa khandaih chuan a ei zo ta si a; Muanna nei rêng an awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Buh chi an tuh a, hlîng an seng a; An intihah hnêp a, hlâwkna awm si lovin. Lalpa thinur nasa tak avângin In rah chhuahte chu in zahpui ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ka mi Israel-te hnêna roluah tûra ka pêk khawih chhetu, ka ṭhenawm sualte zawng zawng chungchângah chuan Lalpa chuan hetiangin a ti: ngai rawh u, an ram ata ka pawt chhuak ang a, an zîng ata Juda chhûngte ka pawt chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, ka pawh chhuah hnuah anmahni ka khawngaih leh ang a, mi tin anmahni roluah tûr leh mi tin anmahni ram ngeia awm tûrin ka rawn hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Baala hnêna ka mite chhechham an zirtîr ang bawka, ka hminga, ‘ Lalpa a nuna a nun chhûng chu,’ tia chhe chham an zira, ka mite awm dân ngun taka an zir chuan ka mite zîngah ka din ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, an ngaihthlâk loh chuan chumi hnam chu a pawhin ka pawt chhuak ang a, ka tichhe zo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti a: “Hrênpuan zai sîn lei la, tihuh lovin hrêng rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu ang zêlin hrên chu ka lei a, ka hrêng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hrênpuan i lei, i hrên kha la la, tho la, Euphrates lui pan la, chuta lung keh kârah chuan thukru rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu mi pêk angin ka kal a, Euphrates lui bulah chuan ka thukru ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ni tam tak hnuah chuan Lalpan ka hnênah, “Tho la, Euphrates lui pan la, hrênpuan ka thuhrûktîr che kha la chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Euphrates lui lamah chuan ka kal ta a, ka han hai a, hrênpuan chu ka thuhrûkna ata ka han phawrh chhuak a. Ngai teh, hrênpuan chu a lo mawih vek a; eng atân mah a tlâktlai ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Hetiang bawk hian Juda chapopui leh Jerusalem chhuantawlawl chu ka tichhe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He hnam sual, ka thute ngaithla duh lova, anmahni rilru ngawltâwt zai zuia, pathian dangte rawng bâwl leh be tûra ûm zâwktute hi he hrênpuan, eng atân maha tlâktlâi lo ang hi an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hrênpuan chu mi kâwnga a bet reng ang hian, Israel chhûngkaw pum pui leh Juda chhûngkaw pum pui hi, ka mite leh ka hmingthanna leh ka mawina leh ka ropuina an lo nih theih nân, ka hnêna bet reng tûra ka siam an ni si a; mahse, an bengkhawn lo.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, he thu hi an hnênah i sawi tûr a ni: ‘ Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Peng tinrêng mai uainin a khat ang,’ tiin. Tin, annin i hnênah, ‘Peng tinrêng mai uainin a khat ang tih chu kan hre lo vem ni?’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, nangin an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai rawh u, he rama chêng zawng zawng, Davida ṭhutthlênga thu lalte, puithiamte, zâwlneite leh Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawngte chu zu ruihnain ka tikhat ang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anmahni chu ka insuttîr ang a, pate an fate nên,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: ‘Anmahni ka tihboral lohna khawp zawngin anni chu ka khawngaihin ka zuahin ka lainat lo vang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaithla ula, beng dawh rawh u; Chapo suh u, Lalpa chuan thu a thlah tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu chawimawi ula, Thimna a thlentîr hma leh, Thimin tlângte a tuama in kete a phêt hma hian. Eng in beisei lai takin thimah a chantîr a, Thim chhah takah a siam dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, in ngaihthlâk loh chuan In chapona avângin fianrialah ka ṭap ka ṭap ang; Ka mittui pawh nasa takin a luang reng ang, Lalpa berâm rual chu sala kaih an nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal leh a nu hnênah te chuan, “Ṭhu hniam rawh u, in lukhumte a tla ta si, In lallukhum ropui ngei chu,” ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim khawpuite chu a ping zo ve, tû ma hawn rual lohvin; Juda zawng zawng salah an tâng, A pum puiin an tâng zo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In mit lên ula, en rawh u, hmâr lam ata lo thawkte saw. Berâm rual i neih kha khawnge, I berâm rual duhawm tak kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangman ṭhiana i siamte kha i chunga an dah hun chuan Engtin nge i tih ang? Hmeichhe nau vei ang mai hian Nâ i ti hle dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Eng vângin nge hêng hi ka chungah a lo thlen?” I ti rilru a nih chuan, i khawlohna avâng asin ni, I fênfual hlîm a niha i saruak a lan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ethiopia mi hângin a vun a tidanglamin, Keitêin a zia a thup thei em ni? Chuti a nih chuan nangni thil sual tih chîng ṭhînte pawhin Thil ṭha in ti thei ang chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thlalêr thlîin buhsî a lên ang maiin Anmahni ka tidarh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hei hi i chanvo, i puala ka ruatsak che chu a ni, Mi theihnghilha, dâwt i rinchhan avângin,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tichuan, keimah ngeiin i fenfual chu I hmai khuh hialin ka hlîmsak ang chia, I zahmawh a lang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tâmlaka tlângah te i uirena te, i hur au thâwm te, i inphalrai nasatzia te, Chûng i thiltih tenawmte chu ka hmu ta. Aw Jerusalem, i chung a pik e! Tihthianghlim i nih hma chu eng chen nge ni dâwn?”
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawkhêng chungchânga Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Juda chuan a sûn a, a kulh kawngkate a ngui; Leiah an puan dur khumin an kûn e, Jerusalem ṭap thâwm a chho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mi ṭhaten an chhiahhlawhte tui an chawitîr a, Tuikhuah an pan a, tui an hmu lo, An tuibêl ruakin an kîr a; An zâm a, an hrilhhai a, an lû an khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei lah a khî, ram puma ruah tui awm loh vângin. Leilettute chu an zâm a, an lû an khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni, zukpui pawhin phulah no a hring a, A tlânsan e, hnim hring a awm loh vângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram sabengtungte chu mual pâwng chârah an ding a, Lei thlâk hlawiin an thaw hlawp hlawp a: Peh tûr awm loh vângin an mit a thim rum rum.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan khawlohna chuan min hêk mah se, I hming vângin aw Lalpa , rawn thawk ang che; Kan tlûknate a tam si a, I chungah ngei thil kan tisual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw nang Israel-ho Nghahfâk, mangan laia Chhandamtu, Engati nge he ramah hian mikhual ang maia, Zan khat riaka zin ang leka i awm le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engati nge mi chi-ai ang mai leh pasalṭha, chhandam thei si lo ang maia i awm le? Mahse, nang chu, aw Lalpa , kan zîngah i la awm a, I hming kan pu a; min kalsan suh ang che!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan he mite chungchângah hian heti hian a ti: “Vah bo hi an duh ṭhîn a, an ke pên an sûmkâr lo; Tichuan, Lalpan anni chu a pawm lo va, An khawlohna chu a hre reng tawh ang a, An sualte avângin a hrem ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “He mite ṭhatna tûr hi dîlsak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chaw nghei mah sela, an au chu ka ngaithla lo vang a, hâlral leh buhbâl thilhlan hlân mah sela, ka pawm lo vang; khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui tein anmahni ka tiboral zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin kei chuan, “E, Lalpa Pathian, ngai teh, an hnênah zâwlneiten, ‘Khandaih in tâwk lo vang a, ṭâm in tuar hek lo vang, he hmunah hian muan chiahna ka pe zâwk dâwn che u a ni,’ an ti ṭhîn asin,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Zâwlneite chuan ka hmingin dâwt an hril ṭhîn a nih chu; anni chu ka tîr lo va, thu ka chah lo va, ka be bawk hek lo. An thil hmuh hleih lohte, ṭhumvâwr tlâktlai lo te leh an rilru dawhâna te an hrilh che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka tirh hleih lohva, ka hming chhâla, ‘He ramah hian ṭâm leh khandaih a thleng lo vang,’ tia hriltu zâwlneite chu khandaih leh ṭâmin an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, an thuhril lo dawngsawngtu hnam pawh hi ṭâm leh khandaih avângin, Jerusalem kawtthlêrah chuan paih chhuah an ni ang a, anmahni leh an nupuite, an fanute, an fapate nên, phûmtu rêng an nei lo vang. An suahsualna chu an chungah ka leih dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah he thu hi i sawi tûr a ni: ‘A chhûn a zânin ka mittui luang rawh se, Hul rêng rêng suh se; Ka mi, ka fanu nula thianghlim chuan hliampui a tuar e, Kut thlâk na tak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Daia ka chhuah leh, eheu, khandaiha thahte! Khawpuia ka luh leh, eheu, ṭâmpui mitthi! Ram tinah zâwlneite leh puithiamte an vâkvai hlawm a, A ngaihna rêng rêng an hre lo,’ tiin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda chu i paih thla dêr em ni? Zion chu i lungten ta elo? Kan tân tihdamna awm lo lêkin eng tizia nge min tuartîr le? Muanna kan zawng a, ṭhatna eng mah a lo thleng lo; Tihdamna hun tûr pawh, ngai teh, thlaphânna mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan suahsualzia kan pha lo ve, Kan pute khawlohna nên, i chungah kan tisual ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hming avângin min hmusit suh la, I lalṭhutthlêng ropui tihminghliau suh la; Kan hnêna i thuthlung hre reng la, bawh bo suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnam dang pathiante zîngah ruah sûrtîr thei an awm em? A nih leh, vânin ruahpui a thlen thei em ni? Aw Lalpa kan Pathian, chu mi chu nang i ni lâwm ni? Hêng thil zawng zawng hi i tih a ni si a, Kan nghahfâk ber nang i ni e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti a: “Mosia leh Samuela chu ka hmaah lo ding mah se, ka thinlungin he mite lam hi a hawi chuang lo vang. Ka hmuh phâk lohvah hnawt chhuak la, kal bo rawh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ‘Khawiah nge kan kal ang?’ tia an zawh che chuan an hnênah heti hian i ti tûr a ni: ‘Heti hian Lalpa chuan a ti: “Thihna pual chu thihnaah; khandaih pual chu khandaihah; ṭâmpui pual chu ṭampuiah; sal tânna pual chu sal tânnaah.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thil chi li ka ruatsak ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “tihlum tûrin khandaih, pet sawm tûrin ui, ei zo leh tiral tûrin chunglêng sava leh ramsa kawlhte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda lal, Hezekia fapa Manasean Jerusalem-a a thiltih avângin, lei lalram zawng zawngte zînga vawrh lân vawrh lânah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuin nge khawngaih ang che, aw Jerusalem? Tuin nge lungngaihpui ang che? I awm dân zâwt tûrin tu nge lo pêng ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangin mi paih thla a, i hnungtawlh zêl a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Chutichuan, dimdawi che hi ka ning a, I chungah ka kut ka lek a, ka tiboral che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram puma kulh kawngkâahte chuan ṭawm thennain anmahni ka thian a. Fa lû hlohvin ka siam a, ka mite ka tiboral a; An awm dân an lamlêt loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipui ṭiau aia tamin an hmeithaite ka tipung a, Chhûn laiah râlkai tawhte chungah tichhetu ka thlen a, Manganna leh thil râpthlâk ka tlâktîr thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lu sarih hringtu chu a chau va, a zal dêr a; Chhûn a nih laiin a ni a liam ta a, A mualphovin a hming a chhia a. Tin, a la awmte chu an hmêlmate kutah Khandaiha thah tûrin ka pe ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu, ram pum puia nghirnghotu leh hnialkalhtua mi lo hring hi ka chung a va pik êm! Ka pûktîr lo va, ka pûksak hek lo; mahse, an zain ânchhia mi lawh tho si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Tihtak meuhvah chuan thil ṭha atân ka tinghet ang che; tihtakmeuhvah chuan chhiatna ni leh hrehawm nîah hmêlma chu i hnênah kut ka dawhtîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Miin thîr, hmâr lama thîr leh ngên chu a titliak thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I sualna zawng zawng avâng hian i sum leh pai leh i ro thilte chu, man lovin râllâk atân ka pe ang, i ram tluanin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram i hriat ngai lohvah chuan i hmêlmate rawng ka bâwltîr ang che. Ka thinrim avângin mei i chunga mût tûr chu a alh chhuak ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangin i hria e, aw Lalpa ; Mi hre reng la, mi kan ang che, Mi tiduhdahtute chungah phuba mi lâksak ang che. I dimdawina hi keiin boral phah lo ila; Nangmah avânga hmingchhiat hlawh ka ni tih hria ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I thute chu tihlan a ni a, ka ei a, I thute chu ka tân lâwmna leh ka thinlung hlimna a ni; Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, i hming kan pu ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nuamsip bâwltuteho zîngah ka tel lo va, ka hlimpui hek lo; Nangma kut vângin a fâlin ka ṭhu a, Lungnih lohnain mi tikhat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Engati nge ka nâ a reh theih lohva, Ka hliam a dam theih loh, tihdam duh lo ang mai hian? Ka lakah kawrte bum hmang tui kang ṭhîn ang hi a ni dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “I inlamlêt chuan ngai ka awhtîr ang chia, Ka hmaah i ding leh ang; Thil tlâktlai lo ata thil hlû hlîr i sawi chhuah chuan, Keima kam châng i ni ang. Anni chuan i lam lo hawi sela, Nang erawh chuan an lam i hawi tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />He mite lakah hi chuan ngên kulh bangah ka siam ang chia; An bei ang chia; mahse, an hneh lo vang che, Chhandam tûr leh chhan chhuak tûr chein I hnênah ka awm si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mi suaksualte kut ata ka chhan chhuak ang chia, Mi nunrâwngte hûm beh ata ka tichhuak ang che.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nupui i nei tûr a ni lo va, he hmunah hian fanu fapate pawh i nei tûr a ni hek lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fanu fapa he hmuna piangte leh he rama nu leh pa anmahni hringtute chungchângah chuan Lalpan heti hian a ti a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hripuiin an thi ang a, tu ma phûm loh leh tu ma sûn lohvin an awm ang; lei chung êkdûr ang mai an ni ang. Khandaih te, ṭâm tein an boral ang a, an ruangte chu chunglêng savate leh ramsate chaw a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Khawhar inah lût suh la, sûn tûrin kal suh la, anmahni ṭah suh; he mite lak ata hi ka thlamuanna ka hlîp tawh si a, ngilneihna leh lainatnate nên,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“He ramah hian mi lian leh mi tête an thi ang a; phûm an ni lo vang a, tu mân an sûn lo vang a, an inzaiin an inziah kâwn phah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lusûnte chu an mitthi ngai thlamuan tûrin tu mân ei tûr an hlui lo vang a, an nu emaw an pa emaw avâng pawhin hnemna no in tûr tu mân an hûn lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ei leh ina an zînga ṭhu tûrin ruaiṭhehna inah i lût tûr a ni lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Ngai teh u, in mit hmuhah, in dam chhûng hian mo aw te, moneitu aw te, hlim thâwm te, lâwm ri te he hmunah hian ka tireh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng thu zawng zawng hi he mite hnêna i hrilh hunah annin, ‘Eng vângin nge Lalpan kan chungah heti taka thil ṭha lo a rawn sawi chhuah ni? Eng nge kan khawlohna? Lalpa kan Pathian chunga kan thil tihsual chu eng nge ni?’ an tih che chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />heti hian i ti dâwn nia: ‘In paten min kalsan vâng a ni, pathian dangte an zui a, an rawng an bâwl a, an bia a, min kalsan a, ka dân an zâwm lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, nangnin in pute aia hleihluakin in ti a, ngai rawh u, mi tinin mahni rilru ngawltâwt chhuahin sual in zui a, kei mi ngaithla lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chuvângin, he ram ata hi nangni leh in pute pawhin in hriat ngai loh ramah chuan ka hnawt chhuak ang che u; tah chuan a chhûn a zânin pathian dangte rawng in bâwl ang, ka khawngaih dâwn si lo che u a,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, ngai teh u, nite a lo thleng dâwn e,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti; “ ‘Israel fate Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu a nuna a nun chhûng chu,’ ti tawh lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Hmâr lam ram leh a ûm darhna ram zawng zawng ata Israel fate hruai chhuaktu, Lalpa a nuna a nun chhûng chu’ an ti tawh zâwk ang. An pute hnêna ka pêk, anmahni ram ngeiah chuan ka hruai kîr leh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh u, sangha man mi tam tak ka chah ang a, anmahni an man ang a; chumi hnuah chuan ram vâk mi tam tak ka chah chhuak ang a, an pêl chhuak ang a, tlâng lian leh te leh lungpui keh kâra mite pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An awm dân zawng zawngahte chuan ka mit a fu reng si a; ka lakah thupin an awm lo va, an khawlohna te pawh ka mit lakah thuhrûk a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, an thil tenawm ruangtein ka ram an tihbawlhhlawh leh, an tenawmnaa ka rochun ram an tihkhah avângin, an khawlohna leh an sualna chu a lêt hnihin ka thungrûl ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka chakna leh ka kulhpui, Mangan nia ka inhumhimna, Kâwlkil aṭangin hnamte an lo kal ang a, “Kan pute chuan dâwt te, thil tlâktlâi lo te, Hlâwkna nei hlei lote chauh lo chu eng mah an rochung lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miin pathiante a insiamsak thei em ni? Chûng chu pathian an ni hlei nêm,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ngai teh u, tûn ṭum hian anni chu ka hriattîr teh phawt ang; ka kut leh ka thiltihtheihna ka hriattîr ang a, ka hming hi Lalpa a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda sualna chu thîr kawlawm leh lunghlu hriam hmâwr zumin ziak a ni; an thinlung phêkah kerin a awm a, an maichâm kîah te pawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thing hring bul leh mual pâwngahte chuan, an faten an maichâmte leh an Aseri-te chu an hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw nang ka tlâng, rama mi, ram dung tluana i sualna avâng hian i sum leh i ro zawng zawngte, i bâwlhmunte nên râllâkah ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I chanpual ka pêk che kha i chân ang a, i ram hriat ngai lohvah chuan i hmêlmate rawng ka bâwltîr ang che, ka thinurna mei, kumkhuaa kâng tûr chu in chhêm alh ta si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Mihring rinchhana, mihring bân chakna ringa, Lalpa hawisanna thinlung neitu chu Anchhe dawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlalêra hnim buk ro ri re ang an ni a, Thil ṭha chhuak tûr rêng a hmu lo vang. Thlalêr ram ro, chi leilung, tu ma luah lohvah chuan a chêng zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa ringtu, a rinchhan Lalpa ni erawh chu a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tui kianga thing phun, lui kama zung kai, Khaw lum lo thleng pawh hlau lo, A hnahte hring reng si, Khawkhen kum pawisa lo, Rah chhuah ṭhulh chuang si lo ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thinlung hi thil zawng zawng aiin bum hmang ber, Chhe lailet dêr a ni a; Tuin nge hre thiam thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi mi tin an awm dân ang zêl leh An thiltih rah ang zêla pe tûra Rilru en chhuaktu, thinlung fiahtu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi, kut tling lova lo hausa chu Varung, mahni tui ni lote awp keu ang a ni a, A la dam laiin amah an hransan ang a, A tâwpah chuan mi â a lo ni mai ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan hmun thianghlim awmna chu Lalṭhutphah ropui tak, a tîr ata chawisâna awm chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Israel nghahfâk, Nangmah kalsantu zawng zawng chu an mualpho vang. “Kei mi hawisantute chu lei vaivuta ziak ang lek an ni ang; Lalpa , nunna tuikhur chu, an kalsan ta si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi tidam la; tichuan, ka dam ang a; Mi chhan him la; tichuan, ka him ang, Ka fak fo ṭhin chu i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka hnênah, “ Lalpa thu chu khawiah nge? Lo thleng ang hmiang!” an ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo thlen tûrin ka nawr lo chia, Chhiatna ni lah ka duh hek lo tih i hria; Ka kâa thuchhuak chu i hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tân ṭihbaiawm ni suh ang che; Mangan nia ka inhumhimna i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tiduhdahtute chu mualpho sela, Kei erawh chu mualpho lo ila; Anni chu zâm sela, kei erawh chu zâm lo ila; Mangan ni an chungah thlen la, Nasa takin tiboral ang che!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Kulh kawngka lûn ber, Juda lalte luh leh chhuahna leh, Jerusalem kulh kawngkâ zawng zawngahte chuan va ding la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, an hnênah, ‘Nangni Juda lalte, Juda zawng zawngte, Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawng hêng kawngkâa lût ṭhînte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti e: In nun hi fîmkhurpui hle teh u, Chawlhniin phurh nei suh ula, Jerusalem kulh kawngkâah luhpui hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhniah in in ata eng mah in phur chhuak tûr a ni lo va, hna rêng rêng in thawk tûr a ni hek lo; in pute hnêna ka thupêk angin Chawlhni chu in serh thianghlim zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni zawngin an ngaithla lo va, beng an dawh lo va; thununna chu an hriata an dawn loh nân an intiluhlul ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: Pawisa taka mi ngaihthlâka, Chawlhnia he khawpui kawngkâa thil in phurh luh lohva, hna rêng thawk lova Chawlhni in serh thianghlim zâwk chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />he khawpui kulh kawngkâah hian lalte leh hotute, Davida ṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûrte chu tawlailîrte leh sakawrahte chuangin an lo lût ang a, anmahni leh an mi liante, Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte nên; tichuan, he khawpuiah hian mi an chêng hlen tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Juda khawpui leh Jerusalem chheh vêl aṭang te, Benjamin ram aṭang te, Sefela ram aṭang te, tlâng ram aṭang leh Chhim ram aṭang tein an lo kal ang a, hâlral thilhlan leh inthawinate, buhbâl thilhlan leh rimtuite, lâwmna inthawinate Lalpa inah chuan an rawn la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mahse, Chawlhni serh thianghlim tûr leh, Chawlhnia phurh neih loh leh Jerusalem kulh kawngkâa luhpui loh tûr thûa mi ngaihthlâk loh chuan, a kulh kawngkâahte chuan mei ka chhuah ang a, Jerusalem lal inte chu a kâng zo vang a, a mit lo vang.’ ”
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa lak ata Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho la, bêlvawtu inah chuan zuk kal la, chutah chuan ka thute ka hriattîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, bêlvawtu inah chuan ka zuk kal ta a, a bêl siamna khâwlah chuan a lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hluma bêl a siam lai chu a lo ṭhat loh chuan, bêlvawtu chuan ṭha a tih angin bêl dangah a din leh mai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw Israel chhûngte u, he bêlvawtu tih ang hian ka ti thei lo che u em ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Ngai teh u, bêlvawtu kuta hlum ang mai hian ka kutah in awm a ni, aw Israel chhûngte u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eng tikah pawh hnam emaw ram emaw chungchâng thûah, “Ka pawt chhuak ang a, ka ṭhiat ang a, ka tichhia ang,” tiin lo sawi pawh ni ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />chu hnam chuan a chung thu ka sawi avânga a thil ṭha lo a hawisan chuan a chunga thil ṭha lo tih ka tum chu ka lamlêt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, eng tikah pawh hnam emaw ram emaw chungchâng thûah, “Ka siam ang a, ka din ang,” tiin lo sawi pawh ni ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka ṭawngka chhuak ngaithla lova ka mit hmuha thil tha lo a tih chuan a tâna thil ṭha tih ka tum chu ka lamlêt bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Juda mite leh Jerusalem-a chêngte hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh u, in chungah thil ṭha lo ka suangtuah a, ka phiar mêk che u a ni, mi tinin an awm dân ṭha lo hawisan sela, in awm dân leh in thiltihte siam ṭha rawh u, va ti phawt rawh.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni zawngin, ‘A âwm lo ve! Mahni remruat ang angin kan awm ang a, mi tin mahni rilru ngawltâwt sual ang zêlin kan che ang,’ ” an ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hnam dangte zâwt teh mah u, hetiang rêng tu nge hre ngai? Nula Israel chuan thil ṭihbaiawm tak a tih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon vûr chuan a tlâng chhîp a kiansan ngai em ni? Kâwlvalênchham tui dai a luang kang ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite erawh chuan mi theihnghilh a, Eng mah lo mai hnênah rimtui an hâl a; Chûng chuan an hmasâng kawngah a petektîr, Kawngpui ni lo ṭumkawng lam an zawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An tiṭiau zo ta e - a ram chu, Kumkhuaa chek khum tûrin. Veivâk apiangin mak tiin an lû an thing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawchhak thlipui angin hmêlma hmaah ka theh darh ang, An vânduai nîah chuan ka hmêl ni lo, Ka tukkhum ka entîr ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Hawh u, Jeremia hi i phiar ang u, puithiam lak ata dân a reh dâwn si lo va, mi fing lak ata thurâwn a reh hek lo vang a, zâwlnei lak ata thu a reh bawk hek lo vang. Hawh u, i sawi chhe bawrh bawrh ang u khai, a thu rêng rêng i ngaihsak miah lo vang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ngaihsak la, aw Lalpa , Mi dodâltute thu hi bengvâr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sual hi thil ṭha rulhna em ni ngai? Anni zawngin ka nunna atân hum an hiat si. An laka i thinurna tikiang tûr leh An tâna thil ṭha sawi tûra I hmaa ka din ṭhin kha hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, an fate chu ṭâmpui mitthi tawhtîr la, Khandaih chakna tawntîr rawh; An nupuite fa lû hlohvin hmeithai rawh se. An mipate hripuiin thi sela, An tlangvâlte pawh indonaah khandaihin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rûntute an hnên i thlentîr phutin, An in ata ṭap thâwm thang rawh se. Mi man tûrin hum an hiat si a, Ka ke awh nân thang an kam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, nangin aw Lalpa , Mi that tûra an mi phiarna zawng zawng i hria e. An khawlohna ngaidam suh la, I mit hmuhan an sualna thai bo hek suh ang che. I hmaah chuan tlu hlawm sela, I thinur nîah chuan ti nek ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kal la, bêlvawtu hlum bêl va lei rawh; tin, mipuiho upate leh puithiam zînga upate hruai la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harsith kawngkhâr luhna bula Ben-hinom ruamah chuan kal la, chutah chuan i hnêna thu ka hrilh tûr che hi puang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heti hian ti ang che: ‘Juda lalte leh Jerusalem-a chêngte u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u. Israel-te Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, he hmunah hian a hria apiang beng tikhawrh hial khawpa thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite chuan mi kalsan a, he hmun hi an tibawlhhlawh a, anmahni leh an pate leh Juda lalte pawhin an la hriat ngai hleih loh, pathian dangte hnênah rimtui an hâl avâng leh, he hmun hi mi thiam thisena an tihkhah avâng leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baala hnêna hâlral thilhlan atâna an fate an hâlna tûr, Baala hmun sângte an din avângin; chu chu ka thupêk a ni lo va, ka sawi hek lo va, ka rilruah pawh a awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, “Ngai teh, nîte chu a lo thleng dâwn,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti, “Chûng nîahte chuan he hmun hi Topheth vuah a ni tawh lo vang a, Ben-hinom ruam vuah a ni tawh hek lo vang; Insâmna Ruam tih a ni tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hemi hmunah hian Juda leh Jerusalem thiltumte chu ka tilothlâwn ang a; tin, anni chu khandaihin an hmêlmate hmaah leh an nunna lâk tumtute kutah ka titlu ang; an ruangte chu chunglêng savate leh leia ramsate chaw atân ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, he khawpui hi mak tihah leh chek khuman ka siam ang a, a kal apiangin a chhiat tawhte avâng chuan mak an ti ang a, an chek khum bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An fanute leh an fapate sa ka eitîr ang a; tin, an hmêlmate leh an nunna lâk tumtuten an huala an tihmangan hunah chuan tu pawhin an ṭhenawmte sa an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, i kalpuite mit hmuhah bêl chu i tikeh ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />an hnênah heti hian ti ang che, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Hetiang bawk hian he mite leh he khua hi ka tikeh ang; bêlvawtu bêl miin a tihkeha, siam ṭhat leh rual a ni lo ang hian; tin, Topheth-ah an phûm ang, phûmna tûr hmun dang a awm loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuti tak chuan he hmun hi ka ti ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Tin, chutiang bawkin he khua hi Topheth anga siam hialin a chhûnga chêngte chungah pawh ka ti ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem inte leh Juda lalho inte, in tin mai a chunga vân lam thilte hnêna rimtui hâl tawhna zawng zawng leh pathian dangte hnêna in tûr thilhlan leih chhuah tawhna zawng zawngte chu, Topheth hmun ang maia tihbawlhhlawh a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chu, Lalpan thu sawi tûra a tirhna hmun Topheth aṭang chuan a lo kal a; tin, Lalpa in hung chhûngah chuan a ding a, mipui zawng zawng hnênah chuan heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai teh u, thil ṭha lo ka sawi zawng zawng kha he khawpui leh a khaw dang zawng zawngah hian ka rawn thlen dâwn a ni, ka thu ngaithla lo tûra an thinlung an tihkhauh avângin.’ ”
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Imera fapa, Lalpa ina hotupa ber, puithiam Pasura chuan Jeremian chûng thûte chu a sawi tih a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Pasura chuan zâwlnei Jeremia chu a vua a, Lalpa ina Benjamina Kawngkhâr chhaktaa kawlah chuan a tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Pasuran Jeremia chu a phelhin, Jeremia chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan i hmingah Pasura a vuah lo ve, Magor-Misabiba a vuah zâwk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a: ‘Ngai rawh, nangma tân leh i ṭhiante zawng zawng tân ṭihkhaiah ka siam ang che; anni chu an hmêlmate khandaihin an tlu ang a, nang lah chuan i mitin i en ngawt ang. Juda-ho zawng zawng chu Babulon lal kutah ka pe vek ang a, ani chuan Babulon-ah salah a hruai ang a, khandaihin a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu achhapah, khawpui hausakna zawng zawng te, a thawh chhuah zawng zawng te, a thil roh zawng zawng te leh Juda lalte ro zawng zawng chu an hmêlmate kutah ka pe ang a, anni chuan an rawk ang a, an man ang a, Babulon-ah an hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, nang Pasur, i in chhûnga awm zawng zawngte nên salah in tâng ang a; Babulon-ah chuan i kal ve ang a, chutah chuan i thi ang a, chutah chuan phûmin i awm ang a, nang leh i ṭhian, dâwt thu i lo hrilh ṭhinte zawng zawng nên hian,’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin mi lo bum a, bumin ka awm ta a nih hi; Nang chu kei aiin i chak a mi hneh a. Nilêngin nuihzabûr ka ni ta, mi tu pawhin mi nuihzat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu ka sawi apiangin ka au chhuak a, “Inpâwngnêkna leh inramna!” tiin ka au va; Lalpa thu chu ka tân chuan, nilênga dem leh hmuhsit hlawhna chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ani chu ka lam lo vang a, A hmingin thu ka sawi tawh hek lo vang,” ti mah ila, Ka ruh chhûnga mei kâng inkhung ta ang mai hian Ka thinlung chhûngah chuan a awm si ṭhîn; Ka pai hle hle zo lo va, ka chelh ngang lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tam takte phun ru ka hria: “Kil tinah hlauhawm a awm! Hêk ula, i hêk tlâng ang u,” tiin. Ka ṭhenrual, ka tlûk châng rengtute chuan, “Bumin a awm ang a, kan hneh ang; A chungah kan phuba kan la ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa chu mi huaisen hlauhawm tak angin ka hnênah a awm a. Mi tiduhdahtute chu an tlu ang a, mi hneh lo vang. Mualpho takin an awm ang a, an hlawhtlin dâwn loh avângin. An kumkhaw hmingchhiatna chu theihnghilhin a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw, Sipaihote Lalpa , mi felte fiahtu, Thinlung leh rilru hmu tlang ṭhîntu, An chunga i phuba lâk chu mi hmuhtîr teh; Ka chungchâng thu hi ka kawltîr ta si che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah chuan hla sa ula, Lalpa chu fak rawh u; Thil sual titute kut ata ṭanpui ngaite nunna chu a hum si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pian chhuah ni chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se! Ka nuin mi hrin ni chu malsâwmin awm suh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa hnêna, “Fapa i nei ta e!” Tih thu rawn thlena, Rawn tilâwmtu chu Anchhe dawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu mi chu, Lalpan khawngaih hlek lova A tihram khuate angin awm rawh se. Zîng lamah chuan au thâwm hria sela, Chhûn a lo nih chuan râlkhêl thâwm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhûl chhûnga mi tihhlum loh avâng khân; Chuti ni se, ka nu chu ka thlân a ni mai tûr a, A chhûl chuan mi pai kumkhua mai tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Engah kher nge chhûl ata ka lo chhuah le, Thawk rim leh lungngaia awm tûra, Mualpho rêng rênga ka dam chhûng nite hmang tûr hian?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Zedekian Malkiza fapa Pasura leh Maaseia fapa puithiam Zephania-te chu Jeremia hnênah a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Babulon lal, Nebukadnezzara chuan min do ta si a, Lalpa chuan a thiltih ropui tak a tih ṭhin ang khân min pui duh mialin, a kîrtîr leh mai law maw tih Lalpa min lo zawh sak teh se,” tia sawi tûrin. Chuta Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu hei hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan an hnênah, “Zedekia hnênah chuan hetiangin va sawi rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, Babulon lal leh Kaldai mi, kulh pâwna hualtu che i dona râlthuam hriamhrei chu ka tikir dawn a ni; tin, he khawpui chhûngah hian anni chu ka hruai khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimah ngei pawhin thinrim leh lungni lo tak leh thinur takin, bân pharin bân tha chak hmangin ka do vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hemi khuaa chêng mihringte leh rante hi ka tihlum ang a, hripuiin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti, “Juda lal Zedekia leh a ṭhuihruaite leh mi dang he khuaa hri leh khandaih leh ṭâma thi lote chu, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutah leh an hmêlmate kutah leh anmahni thah tumtute kutah chuan ka pe ang. Khandaih hriamin a that ang a, a khawngaih hauh lo vang a, a zuah hek lo vang, a lainat bawk hek lo vang.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hêng mipuite hnênah hian heti hian va sawi rawh, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, thihna kawng leh nunna kawng ka dahsak che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He khawpui chhûnga awm chu khandaihin emaw, ṭâmin emaw, hrîin emaw an thi ang; Kaldai a hualtu che u hnêna chhuaka inpete erawh chu an nung ang, an nunna chu indo lâwmman atân a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He khawpui ṭhatna tûr ni lo, a chhiatna tûr ka tum tlat tawh a ni; Babulon lal kutah pêk a ni ang a, ani chuan meiin a hâl ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Juda lal chhûngte chungchâng thûah chuan, ‘ Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Davida chhûngte u! Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Zîngah chuan dik takin ro rêl ula, Tiduhdahtu kut ata rawk tuara chu chhan chhuak ula; Chuti lo chu, ka thinurna mei angin a chhuak ang a, Tu ma ṭhelh rual lohvin a kâng ang e, In thil sual tih avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ruam zâwla chêngte u, Nangni ruam zâwl lungpuia chênga, “Tute nge kan awmnaah lo lût ang?” titute u, Ka khing dâwn che u a ni, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In thiltih rah ang zêlin ka hrem ang che u a, A ram ngawah chuan mei ka chhuah ang a, A vêl zawng zawng chu a kâng ral ang,’ ” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti; “Juda lal inah zu kal la, he thu hi zu sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Aw Juda lal, Davida ṭhutphah chunga ṭhu, nang leh i ṭhuihruaite leh i mi, hêng kawngkhâra lûtte nên hian, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u, ti la:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Dik tak leh fel takin rorêl ula, tiduhdahtu kut ata rawk tuara chu chhan chhuak ula; tin, mikhual te, pa nei lo te leh hmeithai chungah te dik lohna emaw, pâwngnêkna emaw chîng suh u; he hmunah hian mi thiam thisen pawh chhuah hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />He thu hi zâwm ngei ni ula chuan, Davida ṭhutphah chunga lalte chu tawlailîrte leh sakawrte chunga chuangin, anmahni leh an ṭhuihruaite leh an mite chu he in kawngkhârahte hian an lût ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hêng thute hi in ngaihthlâk loh chuan he in hi a ram ang, tiin, mahni inchhâlin chhia ka chham a ni,” ’ ” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Juda lal chhûngkaw chungchâng thu hetiangin a sawi a: “Nang chu ka tân Gilead ang, Lebanon tlâng chhîp ang i ni; Mahsela, thlalêr ka chantîr ang chia, Luahtu awm lo khawpui ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah tiboral tûrte, hriamhrei nei ṭheuhvin, Ka buatsaih ang a; I sidar thing thlante an kit ang a, Meiah an tuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tin, hnam dang tam takten he khawpui hi an pal tlang ang a, mi tinin mahni ṭhenawmte hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chuan he khawpui ropui tak hi eng vânga heti taka ti ta nge maw ni chu le?’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘An Pathian, Lalpa thuthlung chu an hawisana, pathian dangte an biaka, an rawng an bâwl vâng a ni,’ ” tiin an chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thi ta chu ṭah suh ula, sûn hek suh u; Kal bo taa erawh chu nasa takin ṭah rawh u, A lo kîr leh dâwn tawh si lo va, A pianna ram hi a hmuh leh dâwn tawh loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda lal Salluma, Josia fapa, a pa Josia aia rorêltu, he hmun ata kal chhuak ta chungchâng thu chu Lalpan heti hian a sawi: “Hetah hian a lo kîr leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sala an hruaina hmunah, chutah ngei chuan a thi ang a, he ram hi a hmu leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Fel lohnaa in saa, Dik lohnaa a pindan chungnungte siamtu, A thlâwna mahni ṭhenawmte tha chhawra, Hlawh pe duh lotu chung chu a pik e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘In ropui tak ka insak ang a, Pindan chungnung zau takte neiin, Tukverhte ka hawng ang a, Sidar thingin ka thuah chhuak ang a, Rawng sen ka hnawih ang,’ titu chung chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sidar thinga rual i khûm avângin, Lalah i inngai maw? I pa khân a eiin a in a, Dik takin ro a rêl a ni lo vem ni? Chu chu a tân a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi rethei leh tlachhamte chu a rêlsak a, Chu chu a ṭha a ni. Hei hi mi hriat dân tûr chu a ni lo vem ni?” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nimahsela, i duhâmna atân te, Mi thiam thisen chhuah nân te, Hnehchhiah nân leh pâwngnêk nân chauh I mit leh i rilru i pu a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Juda-te lal Jehoiakima, Josia fapa chung thu chu Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a: “ ‘Aw ka unaupa!’ tiin emaw, ‘Aw ka farnu!’ tiin emaw An ṭah hek lo vang a. ‘Aw lalpa!’ tiin emaw, ‘Aw ropui ber!’ tiin emaw An sûn hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem kulh pâwn lama theh chhuaha, paihin, Sabengtung phûma phûmi a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lebanon-ah chho la, au rawh, Basan-ah i aw chhuah la, Abarim aṭangin au rawh, I hmangaitu zawng zawng an boral ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hlawhtlinin i hnênah thu ka sawi a, Nang lah chuan, ‘Ka ngaithla lo vang,’ i ti a, Ka âwkâ i ngaihthlâk loh hi, I tleirâwl aṭangin hei hi i awm dân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlîin i berâmpute zawng zawng a châwm ang a, I hmangaitute salah an tâng a, Nang pawh i sualna zawng zawng avângin, Mualpho tak leh mangang takin i la awm ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lebanon tlânga chêng, Sidar thing zînga bu khuartu, Natna i chunga a lo thlena i han khawngaihthlâk tûrzia mai chu! Hmeichhe nau vei na ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“A nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Juda lal Konia, Jehoiakima fapa chu ka kut ding lama nemna zungbun ni mah la, chuta ta chu ka phawi ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, thah tûra zawngtu che kutah, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutah leh Kaldai-ho kutah ngei chuan ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I pianna ni lo ram dangah nang leh i nu a hringtu che hi ka paih chhuak ang che u a, chutah chuan in thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A rilrua kîr leh an châk êm êmna ramah chuan an kîr leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />He Konia hi bêl keh sawm, hmuhsitawm a ni lâwm ni? Bêl a chhûnga duh zâwng awm lohna chu a ni lâwm ni? Engah nge amah leh a thlahte chu theh chhuaha, Ram an hriat ngai lohvah chuan paih chhuaha an awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, leilung, leilung, leilung, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He mi hi fa nei lo, A dam chhûnga hlawhtling lo tûr mi a ni, A thlahte tu mah hlawhtlinga, Davida ṭhutphah chunga ṭhu tûr leh Judai rama rorêl leh tûr an awm dâwn si lo,’ ” Tiin ziak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka ran tlatna hmuna berâm tiborala tidarhtuho berâmpute chu an chung a pik e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan ka mite vêngtu berâmpuho chungchâng thûah chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka ran rualte chu in tidarh a, in ûm bo va, in kan lo va. Ngai rawh u, in thil tihsual avâng hian ka rawn kan dâwn che u a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tin, ka ran rual la awm chhunte chu, ka ûm darhna ram zawng zawng ata ka hruai khâwm leh ang a, an huang chhûngah ka khalh khâwm ang a, rah duh tak an ni ang a, an pung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmahni ngaihsak tûr an tân berâmpu ka dah ang a, an hlau tawh lo vang a, an mangang tawh hek lo vang a, a tua mah bo an awm tawh bawk hek lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, Davida tân zâr fel ka chhuahsak hun tûr chu a lo thleng dâwn,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; “Ani chu lalah a ṭhu ang a, fing takin a ti ang a, ram pumah dikna leh felna a hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hun chhûngin Juda chu chhandam a ni ang a, Israel chu him takin a awm ang. Tin, hei hi a hming an la vuah tûr chu a ni, ‘ Lalpa chu kan felna a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tichuan, ngai teh u, a hun a thleng dâwn,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “ ‘Israel mite Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu Lalpa chu a nuna a nun chhûng chu,’ ti tawh lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Hmâr lam ram leh a ûm darhna ram zawng zawng ata Israel chhûngte thlahho hruai chhuaka, hruai kîr lehtu Lalpa chu a nuna a nun chhûng chu,’ an ti tawh zâwk ang. Tin, anmahni ram ngeiah an chêng ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zâwlneite chungchâng thu chu, Lungrilah ka lung a va chhe êm! Ka ruh zawng zawngte chu a khûr a, Zu rui ang mai ka ni, Zuin a fan hneh mi ang mai hian, Lalpa vâng leh a thu thianghlim vângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram chu uirehovin a khat a, Anchhia avângin ram chuan a sûn a, Thlalêr hnim hring hmunte chu a ro zo ta. An kawng chu a sual a, An chakna chu a dik lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Zâwlneite leh puithiamte chuan Pathian an pawisa lo va; Ka in chhûng ngeiah pawh an sualna ka hmu,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chuvângin, an tân an kalna kawng chu, Zân thim kawng nâl ang hi a ni ang a, Tah chuan ûmin an awm ang a, an tawlhthlu ang, An chungah thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen dâwn si a, Anmahni hremna hun chu,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Samari zâwlneite chungah tenawm ka hmu, Baala chhâlin thu an sawi a, Israel-te an hruai bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem zâwlneiho chungah pawh Thil râpthlâk tak ka hmu, An uire a, dâwtin an khawsa a, Thil sual titute kut chu an tichak a, Tu mahin an sual sim an tum loh phah a; Ka tân chuan Sodom khuaa mite ang an lo ni vek a, A khaw chhûnga mite zawng zawng pawh Gomorra khuaa mite ang mai.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, zâwlneiho chungchâng thûah chuan Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, saiin ka châwm ang a, Thil khâ ka intîr ang a; Jerusalem-a zâwlneite hnên aṭang chuan Ram pumah Pathian pawisak lohna a chhuak si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Zâwlnei in hnêna thu sawitute thu chu ngaithla suh u; eng mah lo an zirtîr che u a, Lalpa kâ ata ni lo anmahni rilru suangtuahte an sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa thu hmusittute hnênah chuan, ‘I tân a ṭha ang,’ an ti châmchî a; tin, mahni duh zâwng ti lui tlattute hnênah chuan, ‘Thil ṭha lo eng mah i chungah a lo thleng lo vang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa remruatnaah tu nge tel ngaia, A thu dawnga hre tûr tu nge awm? A nih leh a thu chu tu nge ngaihvena ngaithla awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa thlipui chu, Thinurna chu a chhuak ta, A ni, ṭhâwngaleivir thlipui chu; Mi sualte lû chu a nuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa thinrimna chu a kîr mai lo vang, A rilrua a tum tlat tawhte chu A hlena, a tih zawh zet hma chuan; Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan in la hre fiah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zâwlneite chu ka tirh lohvin an tlân a, An hnêna thu ka sawi loh pawhin thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka remruatnaah chuan awm ve ni sela, Ka thu hi ka mite hnênah an puang tûr a, An thiltih dik loh ata an hawi kîrtîr tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hla taka awm Pathian ni lovin, hnai tea awm Pathian em ni ka nih?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hmun biruah ka hmuh theih loh tûra biru thei an awm dâwn em ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Lei leh vânah hian ka khat a ni lâwm ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ ‘Mumangah ka mang e, mumangah ka mang e,’ tia ka hminga dâwt sawitu zâwlneiho thusawi chu ka hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zâwlnei dâwt sawi ṭhîn, mahni thinlung inbum chawpa thusawi ṭhînte thinlungah chuan hei hi eng chen nge a awm dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anni chuan an vêngte hnênah an mumang hrilhin ka mite ka hming theihnghilhtîr an tum a, an paten Baala avânga ka hming an theihnghilh ta ang khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />zâwlnei mumang nei chuan a mang chu sawi rawh se, ka thu neitu chuan ka thu chu dik takin sawi rawh se. Buhpâwl leh buhfang chuan eng nge inanna an neih?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka thu chu mei ang, tuboh, lung chhut sawmna ang a ni lo vem ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ngai rawh u, zâwlneiho, ka thu inrûksak tawn ṭhînte chu ka do a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, zâwlnei mahni dang tinâla, ‘ Lalpan a ti,’ ti ṭhînte chu ka do a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, mumang dâwt mai mai sawia, hrila, an dâwt thute leh an uanthuanna thu lawilote avânga ka mite hruai botu zâwlneite chu ka do a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Ka tîr si lo va, thu ka pe hek lo va, he mipuite hi an tihnemhnâng hek lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Hêng mipuite zînga mi tuin emaw, zâwlnei tuin emaw, puithiam tuin emaw, ‘ Lalpa phurrit chu eng nge ni?’ tia an zawh che chuan heti hian i chhâng dâwn nia, ‘Nangmahni hi phurrit chu in ni, ka paih bo dâwn che u,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zâwlnei emaw, puithiam emaw, mi tuin emaw ‘ Lalpa phurrit’ ti an awm chuan, chu mi leh a chhûngte chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tu pawhin a ṭhenawmpa hnênah leh tu pawhin a unaupa hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chuan engtin nge a chhân? Lalpa chuan eng nge a sawi?’ tiin in inzâwt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa phurrit chu in lam tawh lo vang a, mi tu pawh ama thu sawi chu a tân phurrit a ni dâwn si a. Pathian nung, Sipaihote Lalpa , kan Pathian thu chu in kailek zo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zâwlnei hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa chuan engtin nge a chhân che? Lalpa chuan eng nge a sawi?’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ‘ Lalpa phurrit chu’ in tih vaih chuan, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘ “ Lalpa phurrit chu!” in ti tûr a ni lo,’ tia ka tirh chea, ‘ Lalpa phurrit chu!’ tia thu in sawi avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tichuan, ngai rawh u, ka pawt dâwk ngei ang che u, ka kiang hnai ata ka paih bo vang che u, nangni leh he khawpui, in hnênah leh in pate hnêna ka lo pêk tawh nên hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, kumkhaw dem chhiatna leh mualpho rengna, theihnghilh rual loh chu, in chungah ka rawn thlen ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan mi entîr a, ngai teh, theipui bâwm hnih Lalpa biak in hmaah a lo inhûng a, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran Juda-te lal Jekonia, Jehoiakima fapa leh Juda hotute, mi themthiamte leh thîrdêngte nêna Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon sala a hruai hnu khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bâwm khatah chuan theipui ṭha tak, theipui hmin hmasa ang mai a awm a; bâwm dangah erawh chuan theipui chhe tak, ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Eng nge i hmuh, Jeremia?” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Theipui, theipui ṭha, ṭha tak mai leh a chhia, ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Juda sal tângte, Kaldai-ho rama an ṭhatna tûra ka tirh chhuahte chu, hêng theipui ṭha ang hian ka en dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ṭhat nân an chungah ka mit ka fûktîr ang a, he ramah hian ka hruai kîr leh ang; anmahni ka din ang a, ka ṭhiat lo vang; ka phun ang a, ka pawt lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ka ni tih min hriat nân thinlung ka pe ang; ka mite an ni ang a, an Pathian ka ni ang; an thinlung zawng zawng nên ka hnênah an lo kîr dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “ ‘Theipui chhia, ei tlâk loh khawpa chhia ang hian Juda-te lal Zedekia leh a hotute leh Jerusalem-a châmbâng, he rama la awmte leh Aigupta rama chêngte chu ka hawisan ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hrehawm taka lei chung ram zawng zawng zînga vawrh lân vawrh lân tûrin, ka hnawh bona zawng zawnga sawi chhiat leh tehkhin leh hauh leh ânchhe lawh ni tûrin ka hluihlâwn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anmahni leh an pate hnêna ka pêk ram ata hi lem zawh an nih thlengin an zîngah khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri te ka tîr ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda-te lal Jehoiakima, Josia fapa kum linaa Juda mite zawng zawng chungchânga Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu: chumi hun chu Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kum khatna a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chu thu chu zâwlnei Jeremian Juda mi zawng zawng leh, Jerusalem-a awm zawngte hnêna a sawi chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kum sawmhnih leh kum thum chhûng ngawt, Juda-te lal Josia, Amona fapa kum sâwm leh kum thumna aṭanga tûn thlengin, Lalpa thu chu a lo thleng ṭhîn a; zîng tak taka thovin in hnênah ka sawi ka sawi a; mahse, in ngaithla lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan in hnênah a rawngbâwltu zâwlneite zawng zawng a tîr a, zîng tak taka thovin a tîr a; mahse, in ngaithla lo va, hre tûrin in beng in dawh hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chûng zâwlneite chuan, ‘Mi tin mahni sual kawng ata lo kîr ula, Lalpan in hnênah leh in pate hnêna hmânlai aṭanga kumkhua atâna a pêk che u ramah hian chêng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian dangte hnêna an rawngbâwl tûr leh chibai bûk tûr leh in kut hnathawha ka thin tiur tûrin kal suh u; tichuan, ka tina lo vang che u,’ an ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, in tâna ṭha lo tûra in kut hnathawha mi tithinur tûrin mi ngaithla lo,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka thu in ngaihthlâk loh avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ngai teh u, hmâr lam hnam zawng zawng chu ka chah ang,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. ‘Ka rawngbâwltu Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara pawh ka chah ang a, anni chu he ram leh a chhûnga awmte leh hêng vêla hnam awm zawng zawngte bei tûrin ka rawn hruai ang a; ka tiboral dêr ang a, mak tihah leh chek khumah leh ṭiau reng atân ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an hnên ata hlimna thâwm leh lâwmna thâwm te, moneitu aw leh mo aw te, buh râwt thâwm ri leh khâwnvâr êng te ka la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He ram pum pui hi a chhia ang a, a ram ang; tin, hêng hnamte hian Babulon lal rawng kum sawmsarih an bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmsarih a ral hunah Babulon lal leh chu hnam chu, Kaldai-ho ram chu, an sualna avângin ka hrem ang a; kumkhuain ka tiṭiau vang,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu ram chungah chuan ka thu an chunga ka sawi zawng zawng, Jeremian hnam zawng zawng chunga a sawi, he lehkhabua ziak zawng zawng hi ka thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnam hrang hrangte leh lal ropui tak takte chuan an zînga an mi duh an thing dâwn si a; an thiltih ang zêl leh an kut hnathawh ang zêlin ka thungrûl dâwn a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Ka kuta he thinurna uain no hi la la, ka tirhna tûr che hnam zawng chu intîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An in ang a, an pai thlawk thlawk ang a, an â ang, an hnêna ka tirh tûr khandaih avâng chuan,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa kuta no chu ka la a, Lalpan mi tirhna hnam zawng chu ka intîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />chûng chu hêngte hi an ni: Jerusalem leh Judai khawpui te, chuta lalte leh hotute chu, ṭiauna te, mak tihah te, chek khumah te, ânchhiaah te chang tûrin, tûna an awm dân ang hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aigupta lal Pharaoa leh a chhiahhlawhte, a hotute leh a mi zawng zawngte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hnam dang pawlhtu zawng zawng te; Uz rama lal zawng te; Philistia rama lal zawng zawng, Askelon leh Gaza leh Ekron leh Asdod-a la awm chhun lalte chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom leh Moab leh Amon thlahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tura lal zawng zawngte leh Zidon lal zawng zawng leh tuipui kam lalte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dedan leh Tema leh Buz leh an bak sam mêt zawng zawngte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arabia lal zawng zawngte, thlalêra chêng hnam inchawhpawlhho lal zawng zawngte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zimri lal zawng zawngte, Elam lal zawng zawngte, Media lal zawng zawngte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />hmâr lam lal zawng zawngte, a hla leh a hnaia mi a indawt zêlin; lei chunga awm khawvêl lal ram zawng zawngte chu; tin, an in hnuah chuan Sesak lalin a in ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “In ula, rui ula, lua ula, tlu ula, tho leh suh u, khandaih in zînga ka tirh tûr avâng chuan,” ti ang che.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tin, i kuta no chu in tûra an lâk duh loh chuan an hnênah heti hian ti ang che: ‘Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In in ngei ang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hei, ka hming vuah khawpuiah thil ṭha lo ka ti ṭan a, nangni hrem loh tawpin in awm ang maw? Hrem lohvin in awm lo vang, leilunga chêng zawng zawngte chungah khandaih ka lek dâwn si a,” tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Chuvângin, an chungah hêng hi sawi la, an hnênah heti hian ti rawh: ‘ Lalpa chu hmun sâng aṭangin a rûm ang, A chênna thianghlim aṭangin a râwl a chhuah ang; A huang chhûngah nasa takin a rûm ang. Grêp sâwrtute angin a au vang, Leilung luah zawng zawngte chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leilung tâwp thlengin thâwm a thangkhâwk ang a, Lalpa chuan hnamte a khing a, tîsa zawng zawng chungah ro a rêl dâwn, Mi suaksual chu khandaih hnênah a pe ang,’ ” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, thil ṭha lo chuan hnam tin a rawn hrût dâwn e, Thlipui na tak mai lei hmun tâwp aṭangin a lo thawk dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chumi nia Lalpa thahte chuan lei tâwp aṭangin lei tâwp thlengin an dâp ang a; sûn loh leh khâwm loh leh phûm lohvin an awm ang a; lei chunga êkdûr mai an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Berâmpute u, chiau vak vak ula, ṭap rawh u! Nangni berâm rual zînga puipate u, tâl tawp tawp rawh u! Thaha in awm ni leh in darhsarh nite a lo thleng tak zet a nih hi; Bêl duhawm angin in tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Berâmpute chuan tlân bona kawng an nei lo vang a, Berâm rual zînga puipate pawhin pumpelhna kawng an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Berâmpute ṭap thâwm chu, Berâm rual zînga puipate chiau ri nên, Lalpan an tlat hmun a tihram mêk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huang muanawmte chu tihreh ṭhiapin an awm ta e, Lalpa thinrimna nasa tak avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A tawmna a chhuahsan ta, sakeibaknei ang maiin. An ram chu a chhe zo ta si a, Hnehchhiahna râwng tak avâng Leh a thinrimna nasa tak avângin.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal ṭan tirhin he thu hi Lalpa hnên ata a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Lalpa in hung chhûngah ding la, Juda khawpui zawng zawng, Pathian be tûra Lalpa ina lo kalte hnênah chuan, an hnêna sawi tûr thu ka pêk zawng zawng chu pakhat mah zêp lovin sawi vek rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tinin an awm dân sual kalsanin an ngaithla mial mahna, an thil tihsual avânga an chunga thil ṭha lo tih ka tum chu ka lamlêt theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, nangin an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Mi ngaihthlâk lohva, ka dân in hmaa ka dah in zawm lohva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />zîng taka thova tîrin, in hnêna ka tirh ka rawngbâwltu zâwlnei thu in bengkhawn loh chuan (in lo bengkhawn tawh si lo va),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />he in hi Siloh angin ka siam ang a, lei chunga hnam zawng zawngte ânchhia dawng tûrin ka siam ang, ’ ti ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte, zâwlneite leh mipui zawng zawngte chuan Lalpa ina Jeremian hêng thu a sawi hi an ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, mipui zawng zawngte hnêna sawi tûra Lalpan thu a pêk zawng zawng chu a sawi zawhin, puithiamte, zâwlneite leh mipui zawng zawng chuan amah chu an man ta a. “I thi mawlh ang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engah nge Lalpa hming chhâla, ‘He in hi Siloh ang a ni ang a, he khawpui hi luahtu awm lovin a ṭiau vang,’ tia i sawi ni?” an ti a. Tichuan, Lalpa inah chuan mipui zawng zawng chuan Jeremia chu an bâwr ta huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Juda hotute chuan hêng thu hi an hriatin, lal in aṭangin Lalpa in luhna kawngka tharah an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte leh zâwlneite chuan hotute leh mipui zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, “He mi hi thi tlâk a ni! Khawpui chhiat tûr thu, in benga in hriat angin a sawi lâwk si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, hotute leh mipui zawng zawngte hnênah chuan Jeremia chuan, “In thu ngaihthlâk tâk zawng zawng ang khân, he in leh he khawpui chhiat tûr thu hi sawi tûrin Lalpan mi tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah hian in awm dân leh in chêt dân siam ṭha ula, Lalpa in Pathian thu chu âwih rawh u; tichuan, Lalpa chuan in chunga thil ṭhalo, lo thleng tûr a puan tawh chu a lamlêt thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei erawh chu hei, in kuta ka awm hi. Dik leh ṭha in tih ang angin mi ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tihhlum chuan, nangmahni leh he khawpui leh khua leh tuite chungah, mi thiam thisen in thlen ngei dâwn a ni tih hre mai rawh u; dik takin in benga hêng thu zawng zawng hi sawi tûrin Lalpan in hnênah mi tîr zuk nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, hotute leh mipuite chuan puithiamte leh zâwlneite hnênah chuan, “He mi hi thi tûr a ni lo ve, Lalpa kan Pathian hminga kan hnêna thu sawi a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chumi rama upa tute emaw an lo ding a, mipui awm khâwmte hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mika, Moreseth mi chuan Juda lal Hezekia lal lai khân thu a sawi a; tin, Juda mi zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi: “Zion chu lo anga leh a ni ang a, Jerusalem chu thil chhe awm khâwm a ni ang, A in tlâng chu ram ngaw hmun sâng ang a ni ang,” a ti a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Juda lal Hezekia leh Juda-te zawng zawng khân amah an tihlum em ni? Lalpa hlauvin Lalpa duhsakna chu an ngên a, Lalpa chuan an chunga thil ṭha lo thleng tûr a puan chu a lamlêt ta a ni lo vem ni? Keini zawngin kan chungah thil ṭha lo kan thlen dâwn a nih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mi dang, Lalpa hminga thu sawi Kiriath-jearim-a mi Semaia fapa Uria kha a awm bawk a, Jeremia thu sawi zawng zawng ang bawkin he ram leh khawpui chhiat tûr thu hi a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakima leh a mi ropuite zawng zawng leh hotute zawng zawngin an hriatin, lal chuan tihhlum a tum a; mahse, Urian a hriatin a hlau va, a tlân bo va, Aigupta ramah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakima chuan Aigupta ramah mi a tîr a, Akbora fapa Elnathana leh mi dangte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭangin Uria chu an hruai chhuak a, lal Jehoiakima hnênah an rawn hruai a, ani chuan khandaihin a that a, a ruang chu vântlâng thlânah an paih lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, Saphana fapa Ahikama chuan, mipui hnêna tihhlum tûra an pêk loh nân Jeremia chu a ṭan a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa Zedekia lal ṭan tirhin, Lalpa hnên ata he thu hi a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Nghâwngkawlte leh a hruite siam la, i nghâwngah bât rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Edom lal te, Moab lal te, Amon mite lal te, Tura lal te, Zidon lal te hnênah, Juda lal Zedekia hnêna mi tirh Jerusalem-a lo kalte kutah thawn rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thu hi an pute hnênah sawitîr rawh: Heti hian Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti: ‘hetiang hian in pute hnênah in sawi tûr a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka thiltihtheihna ropui tak leh ka bân pharin lei te, mihring te leh lei chunga sa te ka siam vek a, pêk âwm ka tihte hnênah chuan ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah pawh ka rawngbâwltu Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutah he ram zawng zawng hi ka pe tawh a ni; ramsate pawh ama rawng bâwl tûrin ka pe bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭiau hun a thlen hma chuan, hnam zawng zawngin amah leh a fapate leh a fapaa fapate rawng an bâwl ang, chumi hnuah erawh chuan hnam tam takte leh lal ropui takte chuan amah chu bâwihah an siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara nghâwngkawl bât duh lo leh a rawngbâwl duh lo hnam leh lalna ram chu, khandaih leh ṭâm leh hripuiin, ama kuta ka tihboral vek hma zawng anmahni ka hrem zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan in zâwlneite, in aienthiamte, in mumangte, in chhamphual thiamte, in dawithiamte, in hnêna, “Babulon lal rawng in bâwl lo vang,” tia sawitute chu ngaithla suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ram aṭanga hla taka hruai bova in awm theih nân, in hnênah dâwt thu an sawi lâwk a ni; ka hnawh chhuah che ua in boral phahna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Babulon lal nghâwngkawl bâta, a rawng bâwl duh hnam chu an ram ngaiah ka awmtîr ang a, lei an let ang a, chutah chuan an chêng reng ang,’ ” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Zedekia hnênah hêng thu zawng zawng ang zêl hian ka sawi a: “Babulon lal nghâwngkawl bât ula, amah leh a mite rawng bâwl ula, in nung dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babulon lal rawngbâwl duh lo hnam chungchâng Lalpan a sawi tawh ang khân engah nge khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripuitea nang leh i mite chu in thih ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei, in hnêna, ‘Babulon lal rawngbâwl suh u,’ titute thu chu ngaithla suh u, in hnênah dâwt thu an sawi mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Ka tirh an ni si lo va, ka hming chhâlin dâwt thu an sawi zâwk ṭhîn, nangni leh in hnêna thusawitu zâwlneite chu ka hnawh chhuaha, in boral theih nân,’ ” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puithiamte leh hêng mipuite zawng zawng hnênah pawh hian ka sawi bawk a: “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a ni: Zâwlnei in hnêna thusawitu, ‘Ngai rawh u, Babulon aṭangin Lalpa in hlum bêlte chu rawn thlen a ni thuai dâwn e,’ titute thu chu ngaithla suh u, in hnênah dâwt an sawi a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anmahni ngaithla hauh suh u; Babulon lal rawngbâwl ula, in nung dâwn nia; engah nge he khawpui hi a ṭiau vang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahse, zâwlnei an niha, Lalpa thu an hnêna awm a nih meuh chuan, Lalpa in leh Juda lal in leh Jerusalem-a bungbêl hnutchhiaha la awmte chu, Babulon-ah thlen a nih loh nân Sipaihote Lalpa hnênah ngên ang hmiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, ban sâng te, dâr tuizêm te, a nghahchhante leh he khawpuia bungbêl hnutchhiaha awm chhunte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran Juda lal, Jehoiakima fapa, Jekonia leh Juda leh Jerusalem-a mi ṭha zawng zawng, Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon sala a hruai ṭuma a lâk bâng chungchâng thu heti hian a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a ni, Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan Lalpa in leh Juda lal in leh Jerusalem-a bungbêl hnutchhiaha la awm chungchâng thu a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Babulon-ah lâk bo an ni ang a, anmahni ka rawn kan hma loh chuan chutah chuan an awm reng ang; tin, ka la leh ang a, he hmunah hian ka dah kîr leh ang,’ ” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, chumi kum vêk, Juda lal Zedekia lal ṭan tirh lam, a kum lina, thla nganaah chuan zâwlnei Hanania, Azura fapa, Gibeon mi chuan puithiamte leh mipui zawng zawng hnenah, Lalpa inah chuan mi bia a, ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Babulon lal nghâwngkawl chu ka titliak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum hnih pumhlûm chhûngin Lalpa in bungbêl Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran hemi hmun ata a lâka, Babulon thlenga a kalpui zawng zawng kha, he hmun ngeiah hian ka rawn thlen leh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />He hmunah hian Juda lal Jehoiakima fapa, Jekonia leh Babulon-a kal Juda sal zawng zawng chu ka hruai kîr leh ang; Babulon lal nghâwngkawl chu ka titliak dâwn si a,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Jeremia chuan puithiamte leh Lalpa ina ding mipui zawng zawng hmaah chuan zâwlnei Hanania hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />zâwlnei Jeremia ngei chuan, “Amen! Lalpa chuan chutiangin ti tak rawh se; Lalpa ina bungbêlte leh sal tânnaa mi zawng zawng Babulon ata hemi hmuna rawn thlen tûra i sawi chu Lalpa chuan ti ngei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mipui zawng zawng leh nangma benga ka thu sawi hi ngaithla rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah leh nangma hmaah hmasâng zâwlneite chuan, ram tam takte chungah leh lalna ram ropui takte chungah indona te, thil ṭha lo te, leh hripui thûte an sawi ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zâwlnei, muanna thu sawitu thusawi chu a lo thlen hunah, chu zâwlnei chu Lalpa chuan a tîr ngei a ni tih a hriat mai ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Hanania chuan nghâwngkawl, zâwlnei Jeremian a bah chu a la a, a titliak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawng hmaah Hanania chuan, “Heti hian Lalpa chuan a ti: ‘Hetiang ngei hian Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara nghâwngkawl chu, kum hnih pumhlûm chhûng ngeiin hnamte zawng zawng nghâwng ata ka titliak ang,’ tiin,” a ti a. Tin, zâwlnei Jeremia chuan a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Hanania chuan zâwlnei Jeremia nghâwng ata nghâwngkawl a tihtliah hnuah chuan Jeremia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kal la, Hanania hnênah heti hian va ti rawh, ‘Heti hian Lalpa chuan a ti: “Thing nghâwngkawl chu i titliak a, a aiah thîr nghâwngkawl i siamsak zâwk a nih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Heti hian Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti si a: “Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara rawng an bâwl theih nân, hêng hnam zawng zawng hi thîr nghâwngkawl bahtîr a ni; ama rawng an bâwl ang, ramhnuaia ramsate pawh amah ka pe bawk a ni,” ’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Jeremia chuan zâwlnei Hanania hnênah, “Ngai rawh, Hanani, Lalpan a tîr awzâwng lo che; hêng mite hi dâwt i rintîr mai a nih zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, heti hian Lalpa chuan a ti: ‘Ngai teh, lei chung ata hi ka tibo daih ang che. Lalpa chunga helna thu i sawi avângin kumin ngeiah hian i thi ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi kum vêk, thla sarihnaah chuan zâwlnei Hanania chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Jeremian Jerusalem aṭanga sal tâng upate, puithiamte, zâwlneite, mi dangte, Nebukadnezzaran Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon-a a hruai tâk, la dam chhunte hnêna a lehkhathawn thu chu hêng hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Lal Jekonia te, lalnu te, mi tilreh te, Juda leh Jerusalem hotu te, mi themthiam te, thîrdêngten Jerusalem an chhuahsan hnu khân.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saphana fapa Elasa leh Hilkia fapa Gemaria-te kutah a thawn a ni (chûngte chu Juda lal Zedekian Babulon ramah Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara hnêna a tirhte chu an ni):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan sal tâng zawng zawng, Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon sala ka hruaitîr tâkteho hnênah heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Inte sa ula, chutah chuan chêng ula; huante siam ula, a rahte ei ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nupuite nei ula, fanute, fapate hring ula; in fapate tân nupui neihsak ula, in fanute pasal neihtîr ula, fanu fapa an hrin theih nân; chutah chuan lo pung ula, kiam lam pan suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sala ka tântîrna che u khawpui ṭhatna tûr zawng ula, Lalpa hnênah dîlsak rawh u; ama ṭhatna chuan nangni pawhin ṭhatna in hmu dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In zîngah zâwlneite leh aienthiamte chuan bum che u suh sela, an mumang an man pawh chu ngaithla hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hming chhâlin dâwt thu in hnênah an sawi a ni e; keima tirh an ni lo ve,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Babulon tân kum sawmsarih chu a kin veleh ka rawn kan ang che u a, in hnêna ka thutiam ṭha tak chu ka hlen ang a, he hmunah hian ka kîrtîr leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangni lama ka rilru putzia chu ka inhre si a, in hun hnuhnûng tâwpah chuan beiseina pe tûr che uin, thil ṭha lo ni lovin, ṭhatna ka ngaihtuah asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, min lam ang a, ka hnênah in rawn ṭawngṭai ang a, ka ngaithla ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min zawng ang a, in thinlung zawng zawnga mi zawn hunah chuan mi hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmahni hmuhin ka awm ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti, “In awm dân ka let ang a, hnam zawng zawng zînga ka tihdarhna che u hmun ata ka hruai khâwm leh ang che u,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Sala ka mantîrna che u hmun ngeiah khân ka rawn thlen leh ang che u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan Babulon ramah pawh hian zâwlnei min dinsak a,” in ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Davida ṭhutphaha lal chungchâng thu leh he khawpuia chêng mipui zawng zawng, sala hruai tel loh, in unaute chungchâng thûah chuan heti hian a ti si a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, an chungah chuan khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te ka rawn thlen ang a, theipui hût, a chhiat êm êm avânga ei tlâk tawp loh ang maiin ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui tein ka ûm zui ang a, lei chunga lalna ram zawng zawngte zîngah thil râpthlâk takah ka siam ang a, anmahni ka tihdarhna hnam zawng zawngte zîngah chuan ânchhe dawngah, mak tih huai huaiah, chek khum tlawk tlawka sawi chhiat ni tûrin ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zîng takah thovin ka rawngbâwltu, zâwlneite hmanga ka thu in hnêna ka rawn thlen chu an pawisak loh avângin,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti: “In ngaithla duh si lo,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni Jerusalem aṭanga Babulon-a ka tirh, sal tâng zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu chu ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan Kolaia fapa Ahaba leh Maaseia fapa Zedekia, ka hming chhâla in hnêna dâwt thu sawitute chungchâng thûah chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutah ka mantîr dâwn e; in mit hmuh ngeiah a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anmahni thûah chuan Babulon rama Juda sal tâng zawng zawng chuan, ‘Babulon lalin meia a rawh Zedekia leh Ahaba ang mai khân Lalpan i chungah ti rawh se,’ tih hi ânchhe lawh fungah an chîn phah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel ramah chuan thil âtthlâk tak an tiha, an ṭhenawm nupuite an uirea, ka hming chhâlin ka thupêk lovin dâwt thu an sawi avângin; kei a hretu leh a hriatpuitu ka ni e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nehelam mi, Semaia chungchang thûah chuan nangin heti hian i sawi tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a sawi a: Jerusalem mipui zawng zawng hnênah te, Maaseia fapa zâwlnei Zephania leh zâwlnei zawng zawng hnênah te, nangma hming ngeiin lehkha i thawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chuan puithiam Jehoiada aiah puithiamah a siam che a, Lalpa in vêngtu in ni a, mi â zâwlnei inti apiangte chu kawlte, thîr kawlte i buntîr tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, engah nge Anathoth khuaa mi Jeremia, in hnêna zâwlnei inti chu in zilh loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babulon ramah kan hnênah: Sal tân hun tûr chu a rei dâwn a, inte sa ula, chutah chuan chêng ula; huante siam ula, a rahte ei rawh u, tih thu min thawn a ni,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Puithiam Zephania chuan chumi lehkha chu zâwlnei Jeremia hriatah a chhiar a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jeremia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Sal tângho zawng zawng hnênah chuan Nehelam mi Semaia chungchâng thûah chuan Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka tirh hauh lohvin Semaian in hnênah thu a sawi a, dâwt thu a rintîr che a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />chuvângin, Lalpan heti hian a ti: Ngai rawh u, Nehelam mi Semaia leh a thlahte chu ka hrem ang a, hêng mite zîngah mi pakhat mah a nei lo vang a, ka mite tâna thil ṭha ka tih tûr chu a hmu hek lo vang; Lalpa chungah helna thu a sawi avângin, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,’ tiin thawn rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I hnêna ka thusawi tâk zawng zawng kha lehkhabuah ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai rawh, ka mi Israel leh Juda-te ka hruai kîr nite chu a lo thleng mêk e; ram, an thlahtute hnêna ka pêkah chuan ka hruai kîr ang a, an luah tawh ang,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Juda leh Israel chungchâng thûa Lalpa thusawite chu hêngte hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Thlaphâng thâwm kan hria, hlauva au thâwm, Muanna ni lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zâwt vêl ula, en vêl teh u, mipain nau an vei ngai em? Engati nge hmeichhe nau vei ang renga, Mipate hian an tai an dawm ṭheuhva, An hmêlte a lo dân zawh tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ehei! Chumi nî chu a ropui mang e, Chu ang rêng chu a awm lo. Jakoba manganna nî a ni ngei mai; Mahse, chhan chhuahin a awm tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, a nghâwngkawl bah chu ka titliak ang a, a hrui chu ka tichat ang; awze mite chuan amah chu rawngbâwltuah an hmang ngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa an Pathian leh an lal atâna ka tundin tûr Davida rawng an bâwl zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw ka rawngbâwltu Jakob, Hlau hauh suh, aw Israel, zâm hek suh,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. ‘Ngai rawh, hla tak ata ka chhan chhuak ang chia, An sal tânna ata i thlahte ngei chu. Tin, Jakoba chu a kîr leh ang a, Tu mân an tihlau tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhan tûr chein i hnênah ka awm reng si a, Ka tihdarhna che hnam zawng zawng chu, Ka titâwp ang a, nang erawh chu titâwp lovin. A tâwk lekin ka hrem ang chia, Hrem loh chuan i chhuak tawp lo vang,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a, ‘I hliam chu tihdam rual a ni lo va, I pân chu a nasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭanpui tûr che an awm lo va, I damna tûr damdawi a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ngainatu che chuan an theihnghilh tawh chia; An ngaihsak tawh lo che; Hmêlma hliamin ka hliam ta chia, Dîm lo tawpin ka hrem chia, I khawlohna a nasa a, I thil tihsualte a pun avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engah nge i hliam vânga i ṭah? I nâ chu tihdam rual a ni lo ve. I khawlohna a nasa a, I thil tihsualte a pun avângin, Hêng thil hi i chungah ka ti a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a eiraltu che zawng zawng chu, Ei ralin an awm ang a; I hmêlma zawng zawng chu mi tin mai, Sala hruaiin an awm ang; A rawktu che chu rawkin an awm ang a, Râllâka latu zawng zawng che chu râllâk atân ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tihrisêl leh ang chia, I hliam zawng zawng chu ka tidam ang,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti; ‘Hnawh chhuah an vuah chia, “Tu ma ngaihsak loh Zion a nih hi,” ’ an tih che avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai rawh, Jakoba puan in, sala tângte chu, ka hruai kîr ang, A chênna hmunte ka khawngaih ang; A khawpui chu a awmna mual ngaiah chuan sak a ni ang a, A lal in chu a awm dân pângngaiin a ding leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lâwm thu sawina leh hlim thâwmte chu, Chûng aṭang chuan a lo chhuak ang. A mi chu ka tipung ang a, an tlêm tham lo vang; Anni chu ka tiropui ang a, an tênau lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An fate pawh tûn hma angin an awm ang a, Ka hmaah an pung khâwmin an nghet ang a; Anmahni hnehchhiahtute tawh phawt chu ka hrem zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hotu chu anmahni mi ngei a ni ang a, An rorêltu chu anmahni zînga lo chhuak ngei a ni ang; Amah chu mi rawn hnaih tûrin ka ti ang a, Ani chuan mi rawn hnaih ang; Mahni thuin tu nge mi rawn hnaih ngam hlei ang?’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Tin, ka mite in ni ang a, Kei in Pathian ka ni ang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, Lalpa thlipui, a thinurna thlipui na tak mai chu a chhuak ta! Mi suaksualte lû chu a nuai nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thinlung tumnate a hlena a tih zawh hma loh chuan, Lalpa thinurna hlauhawm tak mai chu a lamlêt lo vang. Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan in la hre thiam ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan kei hi Israel chhûngkua zawng zawngte Pathian ka ni ang a, anni pawh ka mite an ni ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Khandaiha thah bângte chuan, Thlalêr ramah khawngaih an hlawh; Israel-te ka chawlh hahdamtîr lai khân.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmânah ka hnêna Lalpa lo lang chuan heti hian a ti: “A ni, hmangaih tâwp lovin ka hmangaih chia; Chuvângin, lainatnain ka hruai haw che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka din thar ang che, aw nula thianghlim Israel! Din ngheh i lo ni leh ang a, Khuangte nên i inchei leh ang a, Hlim lai lâmna hmunahte chuan i tel ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grêp huante Samari tlâng dung tluanin i siam ang a, Chuta chêngten an chîng ang a, A rahte chu an chên ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ephraim tlâng ramahte chuan, Vêngtute au ni a thleng dâwn e, ‘Tho ru, Zion-ah i kal ang u, Lalpa kan Pathian hnênah chuan,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti e: “Jakoba tân hlimin zai ula, Hnam ropui ber tân au chhuak rawh u; Puang ula, chawimawi ula, ‘ Lalpa , Israel la awm chhun i mite hi, Chhandam ang che,’ ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, hmâr ram ata ka rawn hruai ang, Kâwlkil tâwp ata ka khâwm chhuak ang, Mitdel te, kebai te, hmeichhe nau pai te, vei mêk te nên, Mipui tam tak an lo thleng khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mittui nên an lo kal ang a, thlamuang takin ka hruai haw ang, Tui luang lamahte ka lêntîr ang a, An petek lohna tûr kawng tluangah te chuan; Israel tân Pa ka ni si a, Ephraima chu ka fa tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw hnamte u, Lalpa thu chu ngaithla ula, Tui kam ram hla takahte puang ula, ‘Israel tidarhtu chuan a la hruai khâwm leh ang a, Berâmpuin a berâmte a vil angin a vil ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jakoba chu Lalpan a tlan chhuak a, A aia chak lakah a chhan chhuak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion chhîpah zaiin an lo kal ang a, Lalpa ṭhatnaah chuan an lâwm ang a, Buh te, uain te, hriak te, Berâm leh ranrual note chungahte an lâwm ang; An nunna chu huan tui châwm ang a ni ang a, Kumkhuain an lungngai tawh hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, nula thianghlimte chu lâmin an hlim ang a, Tlangvâlte pawh, a tar a zûrte pawh an hlim ang. An lusûnna lâwmah ka chantîrin ka thlamuan ang a, An lungngaihna ata ka tilâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiamte nunna chu thauvin ka titlai ang a, Ka ṭhatnain ka mite pawh an tlai ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Rama khuaah thâwm an hria Mitthi ngaia ṭap tlawk tlawk, Rakilin a fate a ṭah a, A fate an awm tawh loh avângin Thlamuan theih a ni lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ṭap lo tûrin i aw chu sûm la, I mittui hul rawh se; I thiltihin lâwmman a nei dâwn e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Râl ram aṭangin an lo lêt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I hun tâwp lam chu nghahfâkawm tak a ni ang, Mahni ram ngeiah i fate chu an lo kîr leh ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ephraima inṭah chu ka hre lul mai: ‘Nangin mi hrem a, bâwngpa tuai la sâwi loh ang maiin Sâwi ka ni a; Mi lêttîr la, ka lêt ang e, Lalpa ka Pathian i ni miau si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi lêttîr hnu chuan ka inchhîr teh a, Mi thunun hnuah ka mal ka bêng a; Ka zak a, a ni, ka tleirâwl lai hmingchhiat tuarin Ka kimki a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraima chu ka fapa duh tak, Ka nau ngaihnat tak a nih vâng em ni, Amah ka thunun apianga ka thinlungah a chên tlat ṭhin hi? Tichuan, ka thinlungin a lainat ṭhîn a, A chungah zah ka ngai ngei dâwn a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kawng chhinchhiahnate insiam la, I tân kawng kawhhmuhnate phun rawh; I vah chhuahna lam kawng, Kawngpui lam ngei chu chhinchhiah tlat rawh. Aw nula thianghlim Israel, lo kîr leh rawh, Hêng i khawpui lamahte ngei hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw, nang fanu lepchiah, Eng chen nge i vah rawlaih dâwn le? Lalpa chuan leiah hian thil thar a siam tâk hi - Hmeichhiain mipa a hum ta zâwk.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “An sal tânna ata ka hruai kîr hunah chuan, Judai ram leh a khawpuiahte chuan hetiang ṭawngkam hi an hmang leh ang: ‘Aw, felna chênna hmun, aw tlâng thianghlim, Lalpa chuan malsâwm che rawh se!’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutah Juda-ho leh an khawpuia mi zawng zawngte chu an chêng za ang a, lo nei mite leh ran vulhtute nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi chaute chu ka titlai ta a, mi lungngai apiangte pawh ka tiharh tawh si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han harh a, ka han hawi vêl a, mang ṭha tak chu a lo ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nite chu a lo thleng dâwn e, Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngteah chuan mihring chi leh ran chi ka tuh ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, anmahni pawt chhuaka, tisawm leh paih thlaa, tiborala, tihrehawm tûra ka châng ang khân, anmahni din ṭha tûr leh tungding tûrin ka enthla thung ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Chûng nîahte chuan, ‘Paten grêp thûr an ei a, an fate ha a ṭim e,’ an ti tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni khawlohna an thihpui zâwk ang a, grêp thûr ei tawh phawt ha ngei chu a ṭim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai teh, nite chu a lo thleng dâwn,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Chûng nîahte chuan Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte hnênah chuan thuthlung thar ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An thlahtute Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuak tûra an kut ka chelh nia ka thuthlun ang kha ni lovin, an tân hotu ka ni chungin chu ka thuthlung chu an bawhchhia a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Chûng ni hnua Israel chhûngte hnêna thu ka thlun tûr erawh chu hei hi a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “An chhûngrilahte ka thupêk ka dah ang a, an thinlungah ka ziak bawk ang a, kei hi an Pathian ka ni ang a, anni chu ka mite an ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tu mahin, ‘ Lalpa hre rawh,’ tiin mahni ṭhenawm leh mahni unau an zirtîr dâwn tawh lo va; a tê ber aṭangin a lian ber thlengin an zain mi hre ṭheuh dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “An bawhchhiatna chu ka ngaidam ang a, an sualna pawh ka hre reng dâwn tawh si lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa , chhûn tiêng tûra ni petu, thla leh arsite tâna dânte ruatsaka, zân tiêng tûra petu, tui fâwnte ri hum hum tûra tuipui chawk thotu chuan a ti a ni: a hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Hêng dân ruatte hi ka hma ata a bo chauhvin Israel thlahte chu ka hma ata hnam nih an bâng hlen ve ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chung lam vân khi teh theih a niha, lei nghahchhante hi zawn chhuah theih a nih chauhvin, Israel thlahte chu an thiltih tâkte avângin ka paih bo ve ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Ngai rawh, nite chu a lo thleng mêk e, Hananela kulhbîng sâng aṭangin kulh kil kawngka thlengin Lalpa tân khawpui chu din a ni a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“A tehna hrui chu Gareb tlâng thlengin ngîl takin a kal riah ang a, Goah lamah a kawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mitthi ruang leh vut paihna ruam pum pui leh tâmlak zawng zawng, Kidron luikawr thlengin, chhak lampanga sakawr kawngka kil thleng chu Lalpa tân serh tûr a ni; chu chu eng tikah mah tihdarh leh ṭhiat chhiat a ni tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia kum sâwmna, Nebukadnezzara kum sâwm leh kum riatnaa Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Babulon lal sipai rual chuan Jerusalem an hual a; tin, zâwlnei Jeremia chu Juda lal in vêngtu hung chhûngah a tâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia chuan, “Engah nge, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, hemi khawpui hi Babulon lal kutah ka pe ang a, a la ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia pawh Kaldai mite kut ata a chhuak lo vang a, Babulon lal kuta mantîrin a awm ngei zawk ang a, inhmachhawnin an inbia ang a, a mit ngeiin a hmêl a hmu ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, Zedekia chu Babulon ramah a hruai ang a, amah ka tlawh hma loh chuan chutah chuan a awm reng ang; Kaldaite chu do mah ula in hlawhtling lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,’ tia i sawi ni?” tiin a tântîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan, “ Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai rawh, i pami Saluma fapa Hanamela chu, ‘Anathoth khuaa ka lo chu i tân lei rawh; ro khâwm thei i nih avângin mi leisak tûr a ni e,’ tiin i hnênah a lo kal ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ka pami fapa Hanamela chu Lalpa thu ang zêlin vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan ka hnênah a lo kal a, ka hnênah, “Benjamin rama Anathoth khuaa ka lo chu mi leisak ta che, ro khâwm thei i nih avângin i tlan tûr a ni, i tân lei mai rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, hei hi Lalpa thu kha a ni tih ka hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka pami fapa Hanamela, Anathoth khuaa mi lo chu ka lei ta a, tangka chu ka han bûksak a, tangkarua sekel sâwm leh pasarih zet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lehkha ka ziak a, ka châr a, hretute ka ko va, tangka chu bûknaah ka khai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, inleina lehkha, inlei dân leh a awmzia ziakna, châr leh châr lohte chu ka la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ka pami fapa Hanamela mit hmuhah leh hretu leinaa hming chuang vete mit hmuhah leh, vêngtu hung chhûnga Juda ṭhu zawng zawng hmaah chuan Maaseia fapa Neria fapa Baruka chu thu ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Baruka chu an hmaah thu ka pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Hêng lehkha, leina lehkha, châr leh châr lohte hi la la, hlum bêlah dah la, a awm rei theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a: ‘He ramah hian inte, lote, grêp huante miten an la lei leh ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Neria fapa Baruka hnêna leina lehkha ka hlan hnuah chuan Lalpa hnênah ka ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa Pathian, ngai rawh, i thiltihtheihna nasa leh i kut pharin lei leh vân i siam a; i tân thiltih harsa lutuk a awm rêng rêng lo va:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sâng tam takte hnêna khawngaihna vûr ṭhîntu leh pate khawlohna an hnua an fate chunga thungrûltu, Pathian ropui leh thiltithei, a hming Sipaihote Lalpa ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />remruat thiam tak, thiltithei tak, mihring fate awm dân zawng zawng hmu chiangtu, mi tin an awm dân leh an thiltih ang zêla rûltu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aigupta rama chhinchhiahna leh thilmak titu, vawiin thlenga Israel-ah leh mi dang zînga ti zêltu, vawiin ang renga mahni hming tilangtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />i mi Israel-te Aigupta ram ata chhinchhiahnate, thilmakte, kut chak leh bân phar leh thil râpthlâk nasa taka hruai chhuaktu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />he khawizû leh hnute tui luang ram an thlahtute hnêna chhechhama pêk tiama petu chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An lo lût a, an luah vek a; mahse, i awkâ an âwih lo va, i dân an zâwm hek lo: tih tûra i pêk rêng rêng an ti lo va; chuvângin, hêng thil ṭha lo zawng zawng hi an chungah i thlentîr a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En teh, khawpui lâkna tûr lei chhûn pâwnte a lo awm tâk hi: khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te avângin khawpui pawh chu a beitu Kaldaite kutah pêk a ni ta. I sawi tawh chu a lo thleng ta; en teh, i hmuh tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa Pathian, nangin ka hnênah, ‘Lo chu tangkain lei la, thuhretute ko rawh,’ i ti a, khawpui erawh zawng Kaldaite kutah pêk a ni ta, i ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngai rawh, kei Lalpa hi tîsa nei zawng zawngte Pathian ka ni a, ka tân harsa lutuk a awm em ni?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, he khawpui hi Kaldaite kutah leh Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutah ka pe ang a, a la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, hemi khawpui beitu Kaldaite hi an lo kal ang a, he khawpui hi an hâl ang a, a kâng ang, mi tithinur tûra Baala hnêna rimtui hlanna, pathian dangte hnêna in tûr hlan leih chhuahna in chung nei in zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel fate leh Juda fate chuan an tleirâwl têt ata ka mit hmuhah thil ṭha lo hlîr an ti si a. Israel fate chuan an kut hnathawhte chuan mi tithinur mai a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘He khawpui hi an sak tirh ata tûn thlengin mi tithinurtu leh mi tithinrimtu a ni reng si a, ka hma ata ka tihbo daihna tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel fate leh Juda fate mi tithinur tûra an thil ṭha lo tih tâkte zawng zawng avângin, anmahni, an lalte, an hotute, an puithiamte, an zâwlneite, Juda mite Jerusalem luahtu zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka lam hawi lovin an tukkhum chhah mi chhawn a, ngun taka beiin zirtîr tawh mah ila, zirtîrna chu dawngsawng tûrin an bengkhawn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka hming chuanna in chu tibawrhbâng tûrin an thil tenawmte an dah zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Ben-hinom ruama mi Baala biakna hmun sângte chu an din a, an fanute, an fapate Moleka hnêna meia an paihna tûrin Juda-ho thil sual tihtîr tûra he tenawmna an tih hi ka thupêk a ni hauh lo va, ka rilruah pawh a lût ngai hek lo.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah zawng Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan he khawpui, ‘Khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui tein Babulon lal kutah pêk a ni tawh,’ in tih ṭhin thûah chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, ka thinrimna te, ka lungnih lohna te, ka thinurna nasa tak tea anmahni ka hnawh bona ram zawng zawng ata ka hruai khâwm ang a, he hmunah hian ka rawn thlen ang a, him takin ka awmtîr tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ka mite an ni ang a, kei an Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumkhuaa mi ṭih hlen theih nân thinlung hmun khat leh awm dân hmun khat ka siamsak ang, anmahni leh an hnua an fate ṭhatna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah kumkhaw thuthlung ka siam ang a, anmahni hawisan lovin, an ṭhatna ka ti fo vang; mi hransan loh nân an thinlungahte chuan mi ṭihna ka dah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A ni, an ṭhatna tih chu ka lâwm zâwng a ni ang a, ka thinlung zawng zawngin he ramah hian ka phun nghet ngei ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘He mite chunga thil ṭha lo nasa tak ka thlen ang ngei khân, anmahni hnêna thil ṭha ka tiam zawng zawngte chu ka thlen ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Ram ṭiau, Kaldaite kuta pêk tawh, mi leh sa awm tawh lo,” in tih ramah hian lote an inlei leh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamina ramah te, Jerusalem khawpui vêl hmunah te, Judai ram khawpuiah te, tlâng ram khawpuiah te, phai ram khawpuiah te leh chhim lam khawpuiahte chuan miten tangkain lo an lei ang a, leina lehkha an ziak ang a, an châr ang a, hretute an ko vang; an awm dân ka lamlêt dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia hnênah, vêngtu hung chhûnga a la awm laiin, Lalpa thu chu vawi hnihnaah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thiltitu Lalpa , nghet tûra siamtu Lalpa (Lalpa chu a hming a ni) chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Mi au la, ka chhâng ang che, thil ropui leh inthup i hriat ngai loh chu ka entîr ang che.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Pathian Lalpa chuan he khawpui inte leh Juda lal inte, khandaih leh lei chhûn pâwnte laka vênna siam tûra an ṭhiat chhiat chungchâng thûah chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Kaldai-ho bei tûrin an lo kal a, ka thinur leh thinrimnaa ka thah ruangte chuan an tikhat zâwk dâwn, an sualna zawng zawng avângin he khawpui lakah hian ka hmêl ka lo thup tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai rawh, damna leh hrisêlna ka rawn thlen ang a, ka tidam ang a, muanna leh himna nghet tak ka hmuhtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Juda awm dân leh Israel awm dân ka lamlêt ang a, a tîra ka din ang khân ka din leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an khawlohna, ka chunga an thil tihsualna lak ata ka tlêng fai ang a, an khawlohna, ka chunga an thil tihsualna leh ka chunga an bawhchhiatnate zawng zawng chu ka ngaidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, he khawpui hi leia hnam zawng zawng, an tâna ka tihṭhat zawng zawng hmutute hmaah chuan ka tân hlimna te, chawimawina te, ropuina te a ni ang a; ṭhatna leh muanna an chunga ka thlen zawng zawng avângin hlauvin an khûr ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He hmun, “Juda khawpui meuh pawh mi leh sa awm tawh lova ṭiau, Jerusalem kawtthlêr, mi leh sa, luahtu awm lova ram tawh” an tihah hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hlimna aw te, moneitu aw te, mo aw te, “Sipaihote Lalpa hnênah chuan lâwmthu hril rawh u, Lalpa chu a ṭha si a, a ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si,” titute aw leh, Lalpa ina lâwmna inthawina rawn kengtute aw chu an la hre leh ang. A tîra a awm dân angin ram chu ka awmtîr ang,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “He hmun, mi leh sa awm lo khawpa ṭiau tawh leh a khawpui zawng zawngah hian, berâmpu an berâm rual bawhtîrtute chênna hmun a la awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlâng ram khawpuiah te, phai ram khawpuiah te, chhim lam khawpuiah te, Benjamina ramah te, Jerusalem vêl hmunah te, Juda khawpuiah te, an chhiartu kut hnuaiah chuan berâmte an kal zung zung ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ngai rawh, nite chu a lo thleng mêk e,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Israel chhûngte chungchângah leh Juda chhûngte chungchânga thu ṭha tak ka lo sawi tawh chu ka hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng nîahte leh chumi hunah chuan felna Chawrno Juda hnênah ka chhuahtîr ang, chu ramah chuan dik tak leh fel takin ro a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng nîahte chuan Juda chu chhan himin a awm ang a, Jerusalem chu him takin a awm ang: tin, a hming put tûr chu hei hi a ni ang: Lalpa chu kan felna, tih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Davida chuan Israel chhûngte lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr mi a hmai ngai lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />puithiam, Levia chite pawhin ka hmaa hâlral inthawi hlân tûr leh buhbâl thil hlân tûr leh, inthawi zêl tûrin mi an hmai hek lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka chhûn ruat leh ka zân ruat thu hi in phelh theiha, chhûn leh zân hi an hun taka awm lo tûra in tih theih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka rawngbâwltu Davida hnêna ka thuthlung pawh, a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr fapa a neih loh nân tihchhiat a ni ve chauh vang; Levia chite, puithiamte, ka rawngbâwltute hnêna mi pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vâna awmho chhiar sên loh leh tuipuia ṭiau chhiar sên loh ang maiin, ka rawngbâwltu Davida thlah leh Levia chi rawng mi bâwlsaktute chu ka tipung ang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ ‘Chhûngkaw hnih Lalpan a thlante chu a paih bo ta,’ tia he miten an sawi chu i ngaihtuah ngai lo vem ni? An mit hmuha hnam tih tham an nih loh nân hetiangin ka mite chu an hmusit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka chhûn leh zân thuruat chu a din hlen lohva, lei leh vân awm dânte hi ka ruat lo a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakoba thlahte leh ka rawngbâwltu Davida thlahte chu ka paih bo vang, Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba thlahte chunga rorêltuah a thlah ka la bo vang: an awm dânte ka lamlêtsakin, an chungah khawngaihna ka nei dâwn si a.’ ”
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara te, a sipai rual zawng zawng te, ama thu hnuaia lei lalna ram zawng zawngte leh mipui zawng zawngten Jerusalem leh a khawpui zawng zawngte an beih laia Lalpa hnên ata Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Juda lal Zedekia va bia la, heti hian hrilh rawh, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai rawh, he khawpui hi Babulon lal kutah ka pe ang a, meiin a hâl ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a kut ata i chhuak tawp lo vang; man i ni ang a, a kutah an pe ang che; i mit ngeiin Babulon lal chu i hmu ang a, ṭawngka ngeiin in inbia ang a, Babulon ramah i kal tur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, aw Juda lal Zedekia, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla zêl teh! I chungchâng thûah chuan Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Khandaihin i thi lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />muang takin a nia i thih ang; i hmaa lal hmasa, i thlahtute rimtui an hâlsak ang khân nang pawh an hâlsak ang che; an sûn ang chia, “Ehei, ka pu!” tiin. Thu ka thlah tawh hi, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Jeremia chuan hêng thu zawng zawng hi Jerusalem-a Juda lal Zedekia hnênah a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babulon lal sipai rualte chuan Jerusalem leh Juda khawpui la awm zawng zawng, Lakis leh Azeka an beih lai chuan; Juda khawpui zînga kulh neite chu hêngte chauh hi an ni tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Zedekian Jerusalem-a awm mipui zawng zawngte hnênah, “Mi tinin an chhiahhlawhnu te, an chhiahhlawhpa te, Hebrai nu emaw, Hebrai pa emaw an nih chuan, an chhuah tûr a ni; a unaupa Hebrai mi rawngbâwlsakin tu mah an awm tûr a ni lo,” tia zalênna thu a puana thuthlung a siam hnua Lalpa hnên ata Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi tinin rawngbâwltunu emaw, rawngbâwltupa emaw a chhuah tûr a ni a, anmahni rawngbâwlsakin tu mah an awm tûr a ni lo, tih thuthlung pawmtu hotu zawng zawng leh mipui zawng zawngte chuan thuthlung chu an âwih a, an chhuahtîr ta ngei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amaherawhchu, chumi hnuah chuan an inlamlêt a, an rawngbâwltunu leh an rawngbâwltupa an chhuahtîr tawhte chu an hnûk kîr a, an thu hnuaiah rawngbâwltuah an dah leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, Jeremia hnênah Lalpa thu chu a lo thleng leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aigupta ram, bâwih tânna ram ata ka hruai chhuah ni khân in thlahtute hnênah thuthlung ka siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mi tinin a unaupa, Hebrai mi, a hnêna hralh tawh, kum ruk a rawng lo bâwl tawh chu a kum sarihna tâwpah chuan a chhuah tûr a ni,” tiin. In thlahtute erawh chuan min ngaithla lo va, an beng an dawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnah nangnin, in lo inlamlêt a, mi tinin a ṭhenawmpa hnêna zalênna thu puangin ka mit hmuhah thil dik chu in lo ti ta a; ka hming vuah inah chuan ka hmaah thuthlung in lo siam ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mahse, in inlamlêt leh a, ka hming in tibawrhbângin, an duh ang taka in chhuah tawh hnu, in chhiahhlawhnu leh in chhiahhlawhpa chu in hruai kîr leh a, in thu hnuaiah rawngbâwltuah leh chhiahhlawhah te in dah leh a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Mi tinin mahni unau leh mahni ṭhenawm hnêna zalênna thu puang tûrin ka thu in ngaithla lo va; ngai rawh u, keiin in hnênah zalênna thu ka puang e,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: ‘Khandaih te, hripui te, ṭâm tein a ni ang; leia lal ramte zawng zawng zîngah vawrh lân vawrh lân tûrin ka siam ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ka thuthlung bawhchhiate, ka hmaa bâwngno zai phel kâra kal tlang meuhva thu tiama hlen lotu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda hotute leh Jerusalem hotute, mi tilrehte, puithiamte, mipui zawng zawng, bâwngno zai phel kâra kalte chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />an hmêlmate leh an nunna zawngtute kutah ka pe ang. An ruangte chu chunglêng savate leh leia ramsate chaw atân mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Zedekia leh a hote chu an hmêlmate leh an nunna zawngtute leh Babulon lal sipai rual, nangmahni kalsan tawhte kutah ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, hemi khawpuia lo kîr leh tûrin thu ka pe ang a,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, ‘Tichuan, an bei ang a, an la ang a, meiin an hâl ang; tin, luahtu awm lovin Juda khawpuite chu ka tiṭiau vek ang,’” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal laia Lalpa hnên ata Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Rekaba chhûngte hnênah kalin va bia la, Lalpa ina pindan pakhatah hruai lût la, uain in tûr pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Habazinia fapa, Jeremia fapa, Jaazania leh a unaute, a fapa zawng zawngte, Rekaba chhûngte zawng zawng nên ka hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, Pathian mi Igdalia fapa Hanana fate pindan, Lalpa inah chuan ka hruai lût a; chu pindan chu hotute pindan bul kawngka vêngtu Salluma fapa Maaseia pindan chunga awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Rekaba thlahte paho hmaah chuan berhbute, note uaina khat ka hûng a, an hnênah, “Uain hi in rawh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni erawh chuan, “Uain chu kan in tawp lo vang; kan thlahtu Rekaba fapa Jonadaba chuan, ‘Nangmahni leh in thlahte pawhin kumkhuain uain in in tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inte in sain, thlai chi in tuhin, grêp huante in siamin in nei tûr a ni hek lo; in dam chhûng nîahte chuan puan inahte in chêng zawk tûr a ni, in awmna ramah chuan in dam rei theih nân,’ tiin thu min pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, kan thlahtu Rekaba fapa Jonadaban awkaa thu min chah zawng zawng, kan dam chhûnga keimahni leh kan nupuite, kan fapate leh kan fanuten uain in loh tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kan chênna in sak loh tûr te, grêp huan emaw, lo emaw, thlai chi emaw neih loh tûr chenin kan zâwm a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />puan inahte chuan kan chêng zâwk a, kan thlahtu Jonadaba thupêk zawng zawng chu awihin kan zâwm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran ram a rawn beih lai khân keini chuan, ‘Hawh u, Kaldai sipai rualte leh Suria sipai rualte hlauh avângin Jerusalem-ah i kal ang u,’ kan ti a; tichuan, Jerusalem-ah hian kan lo chêng ta mai a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Judai rama mite leh Jerusalem-a mi chêngte hnênah va sawi la, “Ka thute ngaithla tûrin zirtîrna chu in dawngsawng lo vang maw?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekaba fapa Jonadaba thu, a fapate hnêna a pêk, uain in loh tûr chu an zâwm a, vawiin thlengin eng mah an in lo va, an thlahtu thupêk chu an zâwm êm êm a ni; kei erawh chuan zîng tak taka thovin in hnênah thu ka sawi a, mi ngaithla lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka rawngbâwltu zâwlneite chu zîng tak taka thovin in hnênah ka tîr a, “Mi tin, in awm dân sual aṭangin lo kîr vek ula, in thiltihte chu siam ṭha ula, pathian dangte chu an rawngbâwl tûrin zui suh ula, tin, nangni leh in thlahtute hnêna ram ka pêkah chuan in chêng ang,” tiin; mahse, in beng in dawh lo va, mi ngaithla hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rekaba fapa Jonadaba thlahte chuan an thlahtu thupêk an zâwm a, he mite erawh hi chuan mi ngaithla si lo va.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Israel Pathian, Sipaihote Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai rawh u, Juda leh Jerusalem-a chêng zawng zawngte chungah chuan, thil ṭha lo an chunga lo thleng tûr ka sawi chhuah tawhte kha ka rawn thlen ang; an hnênah thu ka sawi a, an ngaithla si lo va, anmahni ka auh leh min chhâng hek lo,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan Rekaba thlahte hnênah, “Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘In thlahtu Jonadaba thupêk in zawma, a thuchhuak zawng zawng in zawm a, a thupêk zawng zawng ang zêla in tih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Rekaba fapa Jonadaba chuan kumkhuain ka hmaa ding tûr mi a hmai ngai lo vang,” ’ tiin,” Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Juda lal Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal kum linaah, he thu hi Lalpa hnên ata Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lehkhabu zial la la, chutah chuan i hnêna ka thusawi zawng zawng, Israel chung thûte, Juda chung thûte, hnam zawng zawng chung thûte, i hnêna thu ka sawi ni ata, Josia hun lai ata vawiin thlenga thu chu ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda chhûngte chuan an chunga thil ṭha lo tih ka tum zawng zawng chu, an ngaihthlâkin mi tinin an awm dân sual an lamlêt thei mahna, an khawlohna leh an sualna ka ngaihdam theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan Neria fapa Baruka a ko va; tin, Baruka chuan Lalpa thu zawng zawng, a hnêna a lo sawi tawh chu Jeremia ṭawngka ata lehkhabu zialah chuan a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan Baruka hnênah, “Khuahkhirh ka ni a, Lalpa inah chuan ka kal thei lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chuvângin, nang kal la, Lalpa thu ka ṭawngka ata lehkhabu ziala i ziak kha chaw nghei nîah, Lalpa ina mipuite beng hriatah va chhiar chhuak rawh; an khawpui ata lo chhuak Juda-te zawng zawng beng hriatah pawh i chhiar chhuak bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tinin an awm dân sual an lamlêtin, Lalpa hmaah khawngaih an dîlna chu an thlen thei mahna, he mite chunga thinrimna leh thinurna Lalpan a puan tawh chu a nasa êm êm si a,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Neria fapa Baruka chuan zâwlnei Jeremia thupêk zawng zawng ang zêl chuan, Lalpa inah Lalpa thu lehkhabua mi chu a chhiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Juda lal Josia fapa Jehoiakima lal kum ngana, thla kuanaah chuan, Jerusalem-a mi zawng zawngte leh Judai khawpui ata Jerusalem-a lo kal zawng zawngte chuan chaw nghei thu an puang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Baruka chuan Lalpa Kawngka Thar luhnaah, hung chhûng chungnung zâwka ziaktu Saphana fapa Gemaria pindan, Lalpa ina miah chuan Jeremia thu lehkhabua mi chu, mi zawng zawng beng hriatah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Saphana fapa Gemaria fapa Mikaia chuan lehkhabua mi Lalpa thu zawng zawng chu a lo hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />lal inah a chhuk a, ziaktu pindanah chuan a lût a; tin, ngai teh, tah chuan hotu zawng zawng chu an lo ṭhu a - ziaktu Elisama te, Semaia fapa Delaia te, Akbora fapa Elnathana te, Saphana fapa Gemaria te, Hanania fapa Zedekia te leh hotu zawng zawngte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mikaia chuan mite beng hriata Barukan lehkhabua mi a chhiar thu a lo hriat zawng zawngte chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, hotu zawng zawngte chuan Kusia fapa Selemia fapa Nethania fapa, Jehudia chu Baruka hnênah an tîr a, a hnênah, “Mite beng hriata i lo chhiar lehkhabu chu kengin lo kal rawh,” ti tûrin. Tichuan, Neria fapa Baruka chu lehkhabu zial kengin an hnênah a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Ṭhu la, kan beng hriat ngeiah chhiar rawh le,” an ti a; tichuan, Baruka chuan an beng hriatah a chhiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, chûng thûte chu an hriat chuan hlauvin an inen hlawm a, Baruka hnênah chuan, “Hêng thu zawng zawng hi lal kan hrilh ngei ngei ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Baruka chu, “Hêng thu zawng zawng hi a ka ata engtiziaa ziak nge i nih min hrilh teh khai,” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Baruka chuan, “Hêng thu zawng zawng hi a ṭawngkain mi hrilh a, lehkhatuiin lehkhabuah chuan ka ziak mai a ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, hotute chuan Baruka hnênah, “Kal la, Jeremia nên chuan biru rawh u; tu mân in awmna hre suh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûngah lal hnênah an lût a; lehkhabu zial erawh chu ziaktu Elisama pindanah an dah a, a thu zawng zawngte chu ṭawngkain lal an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chuan lehkhabu zial chu la tûrin Jehudia a tîr a, ziaktu Elisama pindan aṭang chuan a rawn la a. Tin, Jehudia chuan lal leh lal bula ding hotu zawng zawngte beng hriatah a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thla kuana a ni a, lal chu a thlasik inah chuan a ṭhu a, a hmaah chuan meihawl thuka vâm a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Jehudia chuan thlep thum emaw, thlep li emaw a han chhiar chuan lal chuan a chemtein a zai bung a, thuk meiah chuan a zial bu pum kâng ral vek tûrin a theh lût zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, lal leh a rawngbâwltu, hêng thu zawng zawng ngaithlatu tu mahin an hlau lo va, an silhfên an pawt thlêr hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chu chang ni lovin, Elnathana leh Delaia leh Gemaria-te chuan lehkhabu zial chu hâl lo tûrin lal hnênah an ngên a; mahse, a ngaithla duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan lal fapa Jerameela leh Azriela fapa Seraia leh Abdeela fapa Selemia-te chu ziaktu Baruka leh zâwlnei Jeremia-te man tûrin thu a pe a; mahse, Lalpa chuan anni chu a thukru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, lehkhabu zial leh Jeremia ka ata Barukan a ziak zawng zawng thute lalin a hâl ral hnuah chuan, Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Lehkhabu zial dang la la, lehkhabu zial hmasaa thu zawng zawng, Juda lal Jehoiakiman a hâl ral tâkte chu ziak leh vek rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehoiakima chungchâng thûah chuan heti hian ti ang che: ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon lal a lo kal ngei ang a, he ram hi a tichhiain, heta ta mi leh sa a tiboral vek ang,” tia ziakna chu, “Engah nge chutiang thu i ziak?” tiin lehkhabu ziak chu i lo hâl ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, Juda lal Jehoiakima chung thûah chuan Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Davida ṭhutphahah chuan mi ṭhu tûr a nei lo vang; a ruang pawh chu chhûn ni saah leh zân vûr hnuaiah paih chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, an khawlohna avângin amah leh a thlahte leh a rawngbâwltute ka hrem ang; tin, anmahni leh Jerusalem-a chêngte leh Juda mite chungah chuan an chunga ka puan tawh, an ngaihthlâk loh thil ṭha lo zawng zawngte chu ka rawn thlen ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chuan lehkhabu zial dang a la a, ziaktu Baruka, Neria fapa chu a pe a, ani chuan chutah chuan Jeremia kâ ata lehkhabu ziak tawh zawng zawng, Juda lal Jehoiakiman meia a hâl ral tâk thute chu a ziak a; chumi bâkah a anpui thu tam tak a belh bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Josia fapa Zedekia, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran Judai ram lala a siam chu, Jehoiakima fapa Konia aiah a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mahse, amah leh a rawngbâwltute leh a rama mite chuan, Lalpa thu zâwlnei Jeremia kâa sawi chu an ngaithla lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lal Zedekia chuan Selemia fapa Jehukala leh Maaseia fapa puithiam Zephania chu zâwlnei Jeremia hnênah, “ Lalpa kan Pathian hnênah mi tawngṭaisak rawh,” ti tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chu mipuite zîngah a duh duhin a la lêng thei a, tân inah an la dah si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa sipai rualte chu Aigupta aṭangin an lo chhuak tawh a; tin, Kaldai-ho, Jerusalem hualtute chuan an chanchin an hriatin Jerusalem chu an kîrsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa thu chu zâwlnei Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Juda lal, mi râwn tûra tîrtu hnênah chuan, “Ngai rawh, Pharaoa sipai rual, nangmahni ṭanpui tûra lo kalte chu anmahni ram Aigupta-ah an kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaldaite erawh chu an lo kal ang a, he khawpui hi an bei ang a, an la ang a, meiin an hâl ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Kaldaite chuan min kalsan ngei ang, tiin mahni inbum suh u; an kal dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmahni beitu Kaldai sipai rual zawng zawng hi sawisa nek mah ula, an zînga mi hliam awm chhunte chauh pawhin mahni puan in aṭanga lo thovin, he khawpui hi meiin an hâl tho vang,’ tiin i sawi tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Pharaoa sipai rualte hlauva Kaldai sipai rualten Jerusalem an kalsan lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeremia chuan mite zînga a chanvo la tûrin, Benjamin rama lût tûrin Jerusalem a chhuahsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Benjamin Kawngka a thlen chuan vêngtu hotu, Hanania fapa Selemia fapa, a hming Irija a lo awm a; chu chuan, “Kaldaite hnênah i inpe a ni!” tiin zâwlnei Jeremia chu a lo man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan, “Dâwt a ni! Kaldaite hnênah ka inpe lo ve,” a ti a; mahse, a ngaithla lo va. Tichuan, Irija chuan Jeremia chu a man a, hotute hnênah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hotute chu Jeremia chungah an thinur êm êm a, an vua a, ziaktu Jonathana inah an tântîr a; chu chu tân in atân an hman a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chu lei hnuai ripa a luha, ni tam tak a awm hnuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal Zedekia chuan a ko chhuak a; tin, lal chuan a inah a rûk têin a zâwt a, a hnênah, “Lalpa hnên ata thu eng emaw tal a awm em?” a ti a. Tin, Jeremia chuan, “Awm e,” a ti a. A hnênah, “Babulon lal kutah mantîrin i awm ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Jeremian Lal Zedekia hnênah chuan, “Nangmah emaw, i rawngbâwltu emaw, hêng mite chungah hian eng thil nge ka tihsuala mi mantîr ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I hnêna, ‘Babulon lal chu nangmah leh he ram do tûrin a lo kal lo vang,’ tia thu sawitu i zâwlneite chu khawiah nge an awm tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw ka pu, lalber, ngaithla rawh, ka ngên a che; ka dîlna hi lo pawm ta che, ka ngên a che; ziaktu Jonathana inah chuan mi kîrtîr lul suh, chutah chuan ka thi dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lal Zedekia chuan thu a pe a; tin, Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a tântîr a, chhang siamtute kawtthlêr ata ni tin chhang hlâwm khat, khawpuia chhang a awm chhûng chu a pe a; chutiang chuan Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a awm reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Matana fapa Sephatia leh Pasura fapa Gedalia leh Selemia fapa Jukala leh Malkia fapa Pasura-te chuan, mipui zawng zawng hnêna Jeremian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Hemi khawpuia awm rengte chu khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui tein an thi ang a; Kaldaite hnêna inpete erawh chu an nung ang a; a nunna chu a inchhanhim ang a, a nung ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He khawpui hi Babulon lal sipai rualte kutah pêk a ni ngei ang a, a la ang,’ ” tia a sawi chu an ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hotute chuan lal hnênah, “He mi hi tihhlum ni rawh se, kan ngên a che; ani chuan an hnêna hetiang thute sawiin, he khawpuia râl tu mi la awmte leh mipui zawng zawngte thâ a tiṭhum zo si a. He mi hian mipuite ṭhatna a zawng lo va, an chhiatna a zawng zâwk a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lal Zedekia chuan, “Ngai rawh u, ani chu in kuta awm alâwm. Lal hi in duh loh zâwng ti thei a ni hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chu an hruai a, vêngtu hung chhûnga awm lal fapa Malkia lei hnuai ripah chuan an paih lût a. Jeremia chu hruiin an thlâk thla a, chumi lei hnuai ripah chuan chirhdiak chauh lo chu tui a awm lo va; Jeremia chu chirhdiakah chuan a tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Ethiopia mi, mi tilreh, lal ina awm ṭhîn Ebed-meleka chuan Jeremia chu lei hnuai ripah an dah tih a lo hria a; chutih lai chuan lal chu Benjamin Kawngkaah a ṭhu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ebed-meleka chu lal in ata a chhuak a, lal hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pu, lalber, hêng miten zâwlnei Jeremia lei hnuai ripa an paih thla hi thil sual nasa tak an ti a ni, rilṭâm avângin a awmna hmunah chuan a thi mai dâwn alâwm; khawpuiah chuan chhang a awm tawh lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan Ethiopia mi Ebed-meleka chu thu a pe a, “Heta ṭangin mi sawmthum hruai la, lei hnuai rip ata chu a thih hmain zâwlnei Jeremia chu la chhuak rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Ebed-meleka chuan mite chu a hruai a, lal tangka in hnuaiah chuan an lût a, kawr hlui paih te leh silhfên chhia te an la chhuak a, lei hnuai ripah chuan Jeremia hnênah hruiin an thlâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Ethiopia mi Ebed-meleka chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Hêng kawr hlui te leh silhfên chhia te hi i zakhnuaiah hrui hian hrên hnan rawh,” a ti a. Jeremia chuan chutiang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chu lei hnuai rip ata chu hruiin an khai chhuak ta a; tin, Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûngah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lal Zedekia chuan Jeremia chu a ko va, Lalpa ina luhna pathumnaah chuan a hnênah a hruai lût a; tin, lal chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Thil ka zâwt ang chia; ka lakah eng mah thup suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremia chuan Zedekia hnênah, “Ka hrilh che chuan mi tihlum ngei dâwn lâwm ni? Thu ka râwn che chuan mi ngaithla dawn si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lal Zedekia chuan Jeremia hnênah, “ Lalpa , he ka nunna siamtu hi a nuna a nun chhûng zawng ka tihlum tawp lo vang chia, i nunna zawngtute kutah chuan ka pe hek lo vang che,” tiin a rûk têin chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chuan Zedekia hnênah, “ Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Babulon lal hotute hnêna i inpêk chuan in nunna chu i vawng him ang a, hemi khawpui pawh hi a kâng lo vang, nang leh i chhûngte pawh in nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon lal hotute hnêna i inpek loh erawh chuan he khawpui hi Kaldai kutah pêk a ni ang a, an hâl ang a, an kut ata i chhuak tawp lo vang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, lal Zedekia chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Kaldai mite hnêna inpe tawh Juda-ten min mantîrin min nuihzatbûr mai ang tih ka hlau a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeremia erawh chuan, “An mantîr lo vang che; i hnêna ka sawi Lalpa aw hi âwih mai rawh. Tichuan, i tân a ṭha ang a, i nung bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inpêk i duh loh erawh chuan hei hi Lalpa thu mi kawhhmuh chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Ngai rawh, Juda lal ina hmeichhe la awm zawng zawngte chu Babulon lal hotute hnênah hruaiin an awm ang a, chûng hmeichhiate chuan, “I ṭhian ṭha ṭhaten an bum chia, an hneh ta che; i ke chu chirhdiaka a tân veleh an hawisan che,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I nupuite, i fanaute chu Kaldai mite hnênah an hruai vek ang a, an kut ata i chhuak lo vang a, Babulon lal kutah manin i awm zâwk ang a, nangmah avângin he khawpui hi a kâng ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Zedekia chuan Jeremia hnênah, “Hêng thute hi tu mân hre suh se; tichuan, i thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, hotuten ka biak che hi an hriata, i hnêna an lo kala, i hnêna, ‘Lal hnêna i sawi chu min hrilh rawh; kan lakah eng mah zêp suh la, kan tihlum lo vang che; nangma hnêna lal thu sawite pawh,’ an tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nang chuan an hnênah, ‘Jonathana ina mi kîrtîr lova, chuta va thi lo tûrin lal hnênah dîlna ka theh lût mai a ni,’ i ti dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hotu zawng zawng chu Jeremia hnêna lo kalin, an zâwt ta ngei a, lalin thu a pêk zawng zawng ang zêlin anni chu a hrilh a. Tichuan, an biak chu an bâng ta a; a thu chu hriat phâk a ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chu Jerusalem lâk ni thlengin vêngtu hung chhûngah a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Zedekia lal kum kuana, thla sâwmnaah chuan, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara leh a sipai zawng zawng chuan Jerusalem an bei a, an hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekia lal kum sâwm leh pakhatna, thla lina, chumi thla ni kuanaah chuan khawpui kulh chu an su tlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Jerusalem an lâk chuan Babulon lal hotute zawng zawng chu an lo lût a, kawngka laitaah chuan an ṭhu a: Nergal-sarezera te, Samgar-neboa te, Sarsekima te, Rabsaria te, Nergal-sarezera te, Rabmaga te leh Babulon lal hotu dang zawng zawng nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni a, Juda lal Zedekia leh râl tu mi zawng zawng chuan anni chu an hmuhin an tlânchhia a, khawpui ata zânah lal huan kawng lamah kulh bang pahnih kâr kawngkaah an tlân chhuak a, ani chu Araba kawng lamah a chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mahse, Kaldai-ho sipai rual chuan ani chu an ûm a, Jeriko phaizâwlah Zedekia chu an ûm phâk ta a; tin, an man hnu chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara hnênah, Hamath rama Ribla khuaah chuan an hruai a; tin, amah chuan a chung thu chu a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal chuan Ribla khuaah chuan ama mit hmuh ngeiah chuan Zedekia fapate chu a that a, Babulon lal chuan Juda mi ṭha zawng zawng a that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Zedekia mit a kher chhuahsak a, kawl a buntîr a, Babulon-ah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Kaldai-hote chuan lal in leh mi dang in zawng zawng an hâl a, Jerusalem kulh bangte pawh an tichhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana chuan, khawpuia mipui la awm leh a hnêna mahnia inpete leh mipui la awm chhunte chu Babulon-ah salah a hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mahse, vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana chuan Juda ram mi rethei, eng mah nei lote chu a hnutchhiah a, grêp huan leh lote a pe nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chuan Jeremia chungchâng thûah chuan vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ani hi hruai la, ṭha takin ti la, tina rêng rêng suh, i hnêna a sawi ang zêlin ti zâwk rawh,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradana chuan Nebusazbana te, Rabsaria te, Nergal-sarezera te, Rabmaga te leh Babulon lal sipai hotu deuh deuhte a chah vek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />anni chuan Jeremia chu vêngtu hung chhûng ata an ko chhuak a, Saphana fapa Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah a ina hâwn tûrin an kawltîr ta a; tichuan, mite zîngah chuan a khawsa ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu, vêngtu hung chhûnga khârkhipa a awm lai chuan Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ethiopia mi Ebed-meleka hnênah, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, a ṭhatna tûr ni lovin, he khawpui chhiatna tûr zâwkin ka thute ka rawn thlen ang a, chumi ni ngei chuan i hmaah hlen a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan nang erawh chu ka chhan chhuak ang che,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “I mi hlauhte kutah pêk i ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka chhan him ngei dâwn si chia, khandaihin i tlu lo vang a, i nun chu chhan him a ni ang, kei mi rin avângin,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,’ tiin va sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai leh Jerusalem sal zawng zawng, Babulon sala an hruaite zînga Jeremia khaidiat vuan chunga a hruai laia vêngtu hotu, Nebuzaradanan Rama aṭanga a chhuahtîr hnua Lalpa hnên ata Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu hotu chuan Jeremia chu a hruai a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathian chuan he hmuna thil ṭha lo lo thleng tûr hi a lo puang tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a rawn thlentîr ta ngei a, a sawi ang zêlin a ti ta a; Lalpa chungah thil in tisual a, a ṭawngka in âwih loh avângin he thil hi in chungah a lo thleng a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûnah chuan, ngai rawh, vawiin ni hian i kuta khaidiat bun chu ka phelhsak a che. Babulon-a ka hnêna lo kal i duh leh lo kal la, i duh loh leh lo kal lo mai rawh; en teh, ram zawng zawng i hmaa a awm hi, kal rem i tih leh ṭha i tihna apiangah kal ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A la kîr hmain ani chuan, “Juda khawpuite chunga awptua Babulon lalin a siam Saphana fapa Ahikama fapa, Gedalia hnênah kîr la, mite zîngah a hnênah awm rawh. A nih loh leh kal rem i tihna apiangah kal mai rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, vêngtu hotu chuan ei tûr leh thilpêk a pe a, a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chu Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah Mizpa khuaah a kal a, a hnênah a rama mi la awm chhunte zîngah chuan a awm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, sipai pâwl hotu zawng zawng ram laka awmte, anmahni leh an hote chuan, Babulon lalin Ahikama fapa Gedalia chu chumi rama mipate, hmeichhiate, naupangte leh mi rethei berte, Babulon sala hruai loh zawng zawng chu a kawltîr tih an lo hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mizpa khuaah Gedalia hnênah an lo kal a - Nethania fapa Ismaela te, Karea fa Johanana leh Jonathana te, Tanhumetha fapa Seraia te, Netophath khuaa mi Ephaia fapate leh Maakath khuaa mi fapa Jezania te leh an hote chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Saphana fapa Ahikama fapa, Gedalia chuan anmahni leh an hote hnênah, “Kaldaite rawng bâwl chu hlau suh u; ramah hian awm hle hle ula, Babulon lal rawng bâwl ula, in tân a ṭha mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei zawng Mizpa khuaah hian ka awm ang a, Kaldai mi ka hnêna lo kal tûrte hmaah chuan nangmahni aiawhin ka ding ang; nangni erawh chuan uain te, nipui thei te, hriak te la khâwm ula, in bêlah te dah ula, khawpui in lâk tâkahte chuan chêng rawh u,” tiin chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Juda mi zawng zawng, Moab rama chêngte, Amon mite zînga chêngte leh Edom rama chêngte leh ram danga awmte chuan, Babulon lalin Juda mi ṭhenkhat a hnutchhiaha, an chungah Saphana fapa Ahikama fapa, Gedalia a dah tih an hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda mi zawng zawng an hnawh darhna ram zawng zawng aṭangin an lo kîr a, Judai rama Mizpa khuaah Gedalia hnênah an lo thleng a, uain leh nipui thei an la khâwm ta ṭeuh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Karea fapa Johanana leh sipai pâwlte hotu, ram laka awm zawng zawng chu Mizpa khuaah Gedalia hnênah an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a hnênah, “Amon mite lal Baalisa chuan i nunna la tûrin Nethania fapa Ismaela a tîr tih i hria em?” an ti a. Ahikama fapa Gedalia erawh chuan a âwih lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Karea fapa Johanana chuan Mizpa khuaa Gedalia hnênah, “Mi kaltîr teh khai, Nethania fapa Ismaela chu ka va that mai ang e, tu mân an hre lo vang. Juda mi i hnêna awm khâwm zawng zawng an darh veka, Juda mi awm chhunte boralna ti tûrin engah nge i nunna a lâk ang?” tiin a rûk têin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahikama fapa Gedalia erawh chuan Karea fapa Johanana hnênah chuan, “He thil hi i ti tûr a ni lo; Ismaela i sawi dân hi a dik lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, thla sarihnaah chuan Elisama fapa Nethania fapa Ismaela, lal chia mi, lal khâwnbâwlte zînga pakhat chu, mi sâwm hruaiin Mizpa khuaah Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah a lo kal a; tin, Mizpa khuaah chuan chaw an ei ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Nethania fapa Ismaela chu a mi hruai sâwmte nên chuan an tho va, Saphana fapa Ahikama fapa, Babulon lalin ram awptua a siam Gedalia chu khandaihin an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a hnêna Juda mi awm zawng zawng, Mizpa khuaa Gedalia hnêna awmte leh Kaldai râl tu mi awm vete chu Ismaela chuan a that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Gedalia a thah hnu ni hnihnaah chuan heti hi a ni a, tu mân an hriat hmain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sekem aṭang te, Silo aṭang te, Samaria aṭang tein mi sawmriat, an khabe hmul mêta, an silhfênte thlêra, mahni inzaiin, chhang hlante leh rimtuite kengin Lalpa inah hlân tûrin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Nethania fapa Ismaela chu Mizpa khua aṭangin anmahni hmuak tûrin a chhuak a, kawng tluanin a ṭap zêl a; tin, heti hi a ni a, anmahni a han hmuh chuan an hnênah, “Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnênah lo kal rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, khawpui chhûng an han thlen chuan Nethania fapa Ismaela leh a mi hruaite chuan anni chu an that a, khuarkhurumah an paih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An zînga mi sâwm erawh chuan Ismaela hnênah, “Min that suh, ramah chuan buh te, buhban te, hriak te, khawizûte kan thukru ṭeuh si a,” an ti a. Tichuan, anmahni chu a zuah a, an unaute zîngah chuan a that tel ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, khuarkhurum, Ismaelan Gedalia ruala a mi thahte ruang a paihna chu, Lal Asan Israel lal Baasa a hlauh avânga a siam a ni. Nethania fapa Ismaela chuan chu chu ruangtein a tikhat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Ismaela chuan Mizpa khuaa mi nung awm chhun, lal fanute, Ahikama fapa Gedalia hnêna vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradanan a kawltîr, Mizpa khuaa la awm zawng zawng nên chuan salah a hruai ta vek a; Nethania fapa Ismaela chuan chûngte chu sala hruaiin Amon mite ram panin a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Karea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna awm sipai pâwl hotu zawng zawng chuan, Nethania fapa Ismaela thil ṭha lo tih zawng zawng chu an lo hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mi zawng zawng an hruai chhuak a, Nethania fapa Ismaela bei tûrin an kal a, tui tam tak awmna hmun Gibeon-ah chuan an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ismaela hnêna mi zawng zawng chu, Karea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna sipai pâwl hotu zawng zawng an hmuh chuan, an lâwm ta êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Ismaelan Mizpa khua aṭanga sala a hruai zawng zawng chu an hawi a, an kîr a, Karea fapa Johanana hnênah an kal ta duak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nethania fapa Ismaela erawh chu mi pariat nên Johanana lakah an tlân chhuak hrâm a, Amon mite hnênah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Karea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna sipai pâwl hotu zawng zawng chuan, Nethania fapa Ismaelan Ahikama fapa Gedalia a thah hnua, Mizpa khua aṭanga Nethania fapa Ismaela laka Johananan a chhan chhuah tawh, mi la awm chhun zawng zawng - indo mite, hmeichhiate, naupangte, mi tilrehte, Gibeon aṭanga a hruai lehte chu an hruai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an chhuak a, Kaldai-ho avânga Aigupta ramah tlân luh tumin Bethlehem khaw bula Geruth Chimham-ah chuan an châwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nethania fapa Ismaelan Ahikama fapa Gedalia, Babulon lalin chu ram awptua a siam chu a thah avângin, anni chu an hlau ta êm êm si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, sipai pâwl hotute leh Karea fapa Johanana leh Hosaia fapa Jezania leh mipui zawng zawng, a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin an lo hnai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zâwlnei Jeremia hnênah, “I hmaah kan dîlna pawm ni sela, hêng mi la awm chhun zawng zawng tân ngei hian i Pathian hnênah min ṭawngṭaisak tûrin kan ngên a che; min hmuh ang ngei hian mi tam tak zîng ata tlêm tê chauh hnutchhiahin kan awm ta si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathianin kan kalna tûr kawng leh kan tih tûr thil min kawhhmuh theihna tûrin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Jeremia chuan an hnênah, “In thu chu ka hria e. Ngai rawh u, in thu ang zêlin Lalpa in Pathian hnênah chuan ka dîl ang e; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan a chhânna che u apiang ka hrilh zêl ang che u, in lakah eng mah ka zêp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan Jeremia hnênah, “ Lalpa i Pathianin kan hnêna a tirhna che thu zawng zawng ang zêla kan tih loh chuan, kan lakah Lalpa chu thu hretu dik leh rinawm ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A chhia emaw, a ṭha emaw, kan tirhna che Lalpa kan Pathian ṭawngka chhuak chu kan âwih ngei ngei ang; Lalpa kan Pathian ṭawngka chhuak kan âwih chuan kan tân ṭhat theihna tûr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni sâwm hnuah Lalpa thu chu Jeremia hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Karea fapa Johanana leh a hnêna sipai pâwl hotu awm zawng zawng leh sipai zawng zawng, a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />an hnênah, “ Lalpa in Pathian, a hmaa in dîlna thlen tûra in mi tirhna khân heti hian a ti e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘He ramah hian in awm reng chuan ka tungding ang che u a, ka ṭhiat lo vang che u, ka phun ang che u a, ka pawt phawi lo vang che u, in chunga thil ṭha lo ka thlente chu ka sim tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babulon lal in hlauh ṭhina chu hlau tawh suh u, amah chu hlau suh u,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; a kut ata chhandam tûr leh chhan chhuak tûr che uin in hnênah ka awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, in chungah zah a ngaih theih nân zahngaihna ka phal ang che u a, in ram ngeiah ka kîrtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ‘He ramah hian kan awm lo vang,’ tia Lalpa in Pathian aw chu in âwih lohva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Hnai lo ve, Aigupta ramah kan kal zâwk ang a, tah chuan indona rêng rêng kan tawk lo vang a, tawtawrâwt ri pawh kan hre lo vang a, chaw tlâkchham a awm hek lo vang, tah chuan kan chêng zâwk ang,’ in tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />aw Juda awm chhunte u, Lalpa thu chu hre rawh u khai. Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aigupta rama lût tûr leh chuta chêng tûra in hawi lui a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />heti hi a lo ni ang a, khandaih, in hlauh ngeia khân Aigupta ramah chuan a nang ang che u a, ṭâm, in hlauh ṭhina pawh khân Aigupta ramah chuan a ûm zui zêl ang che u, tah chuan in thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta rama chêng tûra hawi luite zawng zawng chu chutiang chuan an awm ang a, khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri tein an thi ang, thil ṭha lo an chunga ka thlen tûr lakah chuan tu mah an chhuakin an him lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Jerusalem-a chêngte chunga ka thinurna ka leih ang bawkin, Aigupta ram in luh hunah chuan in chungah ka thinrimna ka leih bawk ang. Anchhe dawng leh mak tih huai huai, mi kamchhe tleuhna, sawi chhiat in ni ang a, he hmun hi in hmu leh tawh rêng rêng lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, Juda awm chhunte u, Lalpa chuan in chungchâng a sawi tawh hi, ‘Aigupta ramah chuan lût suh u!’ Vawiinah hian ka hriat chiantîr che u tih hre mawlh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In nunna chân phah tûrin in inbum a ni mai; Lalpa in Pathian hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa kan Pathian hnênah chuan min ṭawngṭaisak la, Lalpa kan Pathianin a tih apiang chu min hrilh la, kan ti zêl ang e,’ tiin mi tîr kha a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vawiinah hian in hnênah ka puang ta a nih hi; mahse, in hnêna a mi tirhna engah mah Lalpa in Pathian awka chu in âwih si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah zawng hre rawh u, chên in châkna hmun ngeiah chuan khandaih te, ṭâm te, hri tein in thi ngei dâwn a ni, tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Jeremian mipuite zawng zawng hnêna Lalpa an Pathian thu zawng zawng, Lalpa Pathianin sawi tûra an hnêna a tirhna thu, hêng thu zawng zawngte ngei hi a sawi tâwpah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hosaia fapa Azaria leh Karea fapa Johanana leh mi intivei zawng zawng chuan Jeremia chu an bia a, a hnênah, “Dâwt i sawi a ni! Lalpa kan Pathianin, ‘Aigupta rama chêng tûrin in kal tûr a ni lo,’ tia sawi tûrin a tîr hlei nêm che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaldaite kutah mantîra kan awma min thah theihna tûr leh, Babulon sala min hruai theihna tûrin, Neria fapa Baruka chuan min bei tûrin a tîr che a nih zâwk hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Karea fapa Johanana leh sipai pâwl hotu zawng leh mipui zawng zawng chuan, Judai rama chêng tûrin Lalpa ṭawngka chu an âwih ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Karea fapa Johanana leh sipai pâwl hotu zawng zawng chuan Juda awm chhun zawng zawng, Judai rama chêng tûra hnawh darha an awmna hnamte zîng ata lo kîr -
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mipate, hmeichhiate, naupangte, lal fanute leh mi tin, vêngtu hotu Nebuzaradanan Saphana fapa Ahikama fapa, Gedalia leh a hnêna an hnutchhiahte chu, zâwlnei Jeremia leh Neria fapa Baruka te pawh, an hruai ta vek zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Aigupta ram chu an thleng ta a, Lalpa ṭawngka chu an awih si lo va; tin, Tahpanes khua ngei chu an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Tahpanes-ah chuan Jeremia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Lung lian pui pui la la, Tahpanes-a Pharaoa in luhna bula leirawhchan siamnaa hlum chawh diaknaah chuan, Juda-te mit hmuh ngeiin phûm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, ka rawngbâwltu Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chu ka chah chhuak ang a, ani chuan hêng lung ka phûm rûk chungah hian a lalṭhutthlêng a hûng ang; ani chuan an chungah chuan a lal puan in a zâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a lo kal ang a, Aigupta ram chu a rawn nghaisa ang, thihna pual chu thihnaah, sal tânna pual chu sal tânnaah, khandaih pual chu khandaihah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta mite pathian inah te chuan mei a chhuah ang a, a kâng ang a, salah a hruai ang; berâmpuin puan a inbel angin Aigupta ram chu a inbel ang; chuta ṭangin râlmuangin a chhuak ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta rama Beth-semes lung ban sâng pui puite chu a tichim ang a, Aigupta pathian inte chu meiin a hâl ang,” a ti,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta rama Juda awm zawng zawng, Migdol khua te, Tahpanes khua te, Noph khua te leh Pathros rama chêngte chungchânga Jeremia hnêna thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Jerusalem leh Juda khawpuite zawng zawng chunga thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen zawng zawng chu in hmu tawh a; tin, ngai teh u, tûnah hian a lo ram ta mai a ni a, tu mah an chêng ta lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />anni pawhin, nangni pawhin, in thlahtute pawhin pathian dang an la hriat ngai hleih lohte rawng bâwl tûr leh an hnêna rimtui hâlin, mi tithinur tûra an suahsualna an tih tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuti pawhin in hnênah chuan ka rawngbâwltu zâwlneite zawng zawng, zîng tak taka thovin ka tîr a, an hnênah, “Aw, he thil tenawm, ka huat zâwng tak hi chu ti tawh suh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, an ngaithla chuang lo va, an suahsualna hawisana pathian dangte hnênah rimtui hâl loh tûr thu chu an bengkhawn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thinurna leh ka thinrimna chu Juda khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem kawtthlêrahte ka leihin a alh ta a, vawiina a awm ang hian a ram a, a ṭiau ta a nih hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah zawng Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Israel Pathian chuan, ‘In zîng ata a hmei a pa, nausênte leh hnute hne laite Juda zîng ata tu mah zuah lova râwt bo vek tûrin engati nge he thil ṭha lo tak hi in nunna chung ngeia in tih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In va chênna Aigupta ram pathiante hnênah rimtui hâlin khawvêl hnam zawng zawng zînga ânchhe dawng leh sawi chhiat in nih theihna tûr leh, râwt bo in nih theihna tûrin in kutkawih ngeiin mi tithinur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In thlahtute suahsualna te, Juda lalho suahsualna te, an mipuite suahsualna te, nangmahni ngei suahsualna te leh in nupuite suahsualna, Judai ram leh Jerusalem kawtthlêra an tih tâkte chu in theihnghilh ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vawiin thleng pawh hian an la inchhîr chuang lo va, in thlahtute leh nangmahni hmaa ka târ lan ka dân leh ka dân siamte chu in zawh lo va, in ṭih hek lo.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai rawh u, in chhiatna tûrin Juda zawng zawng râwt bo vek tûrin ka hmachhawn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Juda awm chhun, Aigupta rama chên tuma hawi luite chu ka man ang a, an chimit vek ang; Aigupta ramah chuan an tlu ang a, khandaih leh ṭâmtea tihboralin an awm ang; a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin khandaih leh ṭâmin an thi ang, ânchhe dawng leh mak tih huai huai leh mi kamchhe tleuhna leh sawi chhiat an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem ka hrem ang bawkin Aigupta rama chêngte chu khandaih te, ṭâm te leh hripuitein ka hrem dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Aigupta rama chêng tûra kal Juda awm chhunte chu Judai ram, an awm nâna kîr leh an châk êm êmna ramah chuan kîr tûrin, pakhat mah nungdamin an chhuak lo vang, a rûka tlân chhuakte chauh lo chu tu mah an kîr lo vang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawng, an nupuiten pathian dangte hnênah rimtui an hâl tih hriate leh, hmeichhia chuta dingte mipui tam tak, Aigupta rama chêng mipui zawng zawng chuan, Pathros-ah chuan Jeremia chu an chhâng a, heti hian an ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa hminga kan hnêna i thusawite kha zawng kan ngaihthlâksak lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keini leh min thlahtute, kan lalte leh kan hotuten Juda khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem kawtthlêrahte an lo tih tawh ṭhin ang khân, vân lalnu hnêna rimtui hâlte leh a hnêna in tûr thilhlan bun chhuah te, kan ṭawngka chhuak apiang ang zêl khân kan ti ngei ngei ang; chutih lai chuan kan hmuingîl a, ei leh bâr tûr a tam a, chhiatna rêng kan hmu hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vân lalnu hnêna thil hâl leh a hnêna in tûr thilhlan bun chhuahte kan bân chinah hian engkim kan tlachham ta zâwk a, khandaih leh ṭâmtea tihboralin kan awm ta a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhiate chuan, “Vân lalnu hnêna rimtui kan hâl lai leh, a hnêna in tûr thilhlan kan bun chhuah laite khân, kan pasalte remtih lohvin em ni a biak nân chhang kan siama, a hnênah in tûr thilhlante kan bun chhuah kha?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeremia chuan mipui zawng zawng - a hmei a pa, amah chhângtu zawng zawng hnên ngeiah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Juda khawpuiahte leh Jerusalem kawtthlêrahte, nangni leh in thlahtute, in lalte leh in hotute, leh rama mipuite rêng rêngin rimtui an hâlte chu Lalpan a hre rengin, a rilruah a khung lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In thil sual tih avâng leh in thil tenawm tihte avângin Lalpan a tuar peih ta lo a nih kha; chumi avâng chuan in ram chu tuna a awm ang hian ram chhia, mak tih huai huai, ânchhe dawng, luahtu awm lo a lo nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rimtui in hâl a, Lalpa chungah in sual a, Lalpa ṭawngka chhuakte chu in âwih lo va, a dân emaw, a dân siamte emaw, a thu hriattîrte emaw in zawm hek loh avângin, he thil ṭha lo hi tûna a awm ang hian in chungah a lo thleng a nih hi,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu lo pawh Jeremia chuan mipui zawng zawng leh hmeichhia zawng zawng hnênah, “Aigupta rama Juda zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Nangni leh in nupuite chuan, “Vân lalnu hnênah rimtui hâl leh in tûr thilhlan bun chhuahte chu, kan lo tiam tawh ang zêlin kan ti ngei ang,” tiin in kain in sawi tawh a, in kutin in puitlin tawh bawk a. In thutiamte chu tinghet ula, in thu tumte chu hlen law law rawh u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni Juda, Aigupta rama chêng zawng zawngte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u: ‘Ngai rawh u, “ Lalpa Pathian a nuna a nun chhûng chu,” tiin, Aigupta ram pum puia chêng, Juda mi tu kaah mah ka hming a ri tawh ngai lo vang, tiin ka hming ropui chhâlin chhia ka chham a ni, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, an ṭhatna tûr ni lovin, an chhiatna tûrin anmahni ka châng reng a ni. Tichuan, Juda mi, Aigupta rama awm zawng zawng chu khandaih te, ṭâmtea tihralin an awm ang, an boral vek hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, khandaih tihral bâng tlêm tê chu Aigupta ram ata chhuakin Judai ramah an lût ang; tin, Juda mi awm chhun zawng zawng, Aigupta rama chêng tûra kal tate chuan tu thu nge ding zâwk dâwn, ka thu nge an thu, an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, hei hi in tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang: ka thu hi in chungah thil ṭha lo lam atân a ding ngei dâwn tih in hriat theih nân, he hmunah hian ka hrem dâwn che u a ni,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai rawh u, Pharao-hophra, Aigupta lal chu a hmêlma, a nunna zawngtute kutah ka mantîr ang, Juda lal Zedekia, a hmêlma, a nunna zawngtu Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kuta ka pêk ang bawk khân,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Jehoiakima, Josia fapa kum linaah Jeremia ka ata hêng thute lehkhabua a ziak laia, Neria fapa Baruka hnêna zâwlnei Jeremia thusawi chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan, aw Baruk, i hnênah heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Nangin, “Ka chung a va pik ta êm! Lalpa chuan ka tuarnaah lungngaihna mi belhchhah ta si a. Ka rûm hi ka chauhpui a, hahdamna rêng ka hmu zo lo,” ’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hnênah chuan heti hian i sawi tûr a ni: ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, ka sak tawh chu ka ṭhiat leh ang a, ka phun tawh chu ka pawt chhuak leh ang, ram pum pui mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mahni tân thil ropui i zawng em ni? Zawng lo mai rawh; tîsa zawng zawng chungah thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Mahse, i nun zawng i kalna apiangah ka zuahsak hrâm ang che,” ’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnamte chungchânga zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aigupta thu: Euphrates lui kama Karkhemis khuaa awm, Juda lal Jehoiakima, Josia fapa kum linaa Nebukadnezzaran a nghaisak Aigupta lal Pharao-nekoa sipai rual chungchâng thu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Phaw bial te, phaw sâwl te peih ula, râl tâwn rawh u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakawr thuam ula, sakawr chuang mite u, chuang rawh u! Dâr lukhum khumin ding nghet ula, Fei tât hriamin thîr kawr ha rawh u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engtizia nge! An zâm ta, tukkhum an chhawn, An râl tu mite chu an tlâwm a; bak lêngin an tlânchhia, Hnung lam hawi lo lêkin, kil tinah râl a ṭi,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mi zuanzâng an tlân bo thei lo, Râl tu mi an chhuak chuang hek lo; Saw hmâr Euphrates lui kamah sâwn an pai a, an tlu zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile lui anga lo lian hi tu nge ni? Luipui tui fâwn vêl ang mai hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta chu Nile lui angin a lian a, Luipui tui fâwn vêl ang maiin; ‘Ka lian ang a, lei chung ka dâp ang, Khawpuite leh a luahtute ka tichhia ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw sakawrte u, tâwn zêl ula, Aw tawlailîrte u, che vak rawh u! Râl tu mite chuan hma tâwn se, Ethiopia mi leh Put mi, phaw chawitute, Lub mi thal ngul hmang thiamte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi ni chu a ni, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa ni chu, Phuba lâk ni, a hmêlmate chunga phuba a lâkna ni chu. Khandaih chuan a ei zo vang a, a hnê hlui ang, An thisen chu tlai takin a in ang; Sipaihote Lalpa chuan hmâr lam ramah Euphrates lui kamah inthawi nân mi tam tak a hlân ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw, Aigupta fanu thianghlim, Gilead-ah chho la, thing hnai hnawih mi han la rawh; Damdawi tam tak i hmang thlâwn ta; I tân damna rêng a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnamte chuan i mualphona chu an hria a, I ṭap chuan lei pum a khat e; Râl tu mi leh râl tu mi an insu a, Leiah an tlu dûn reng mai,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nebukadnezzara, Babulon lal a lo kala, Aigupta ram a rawn nghaisak tûrzia thu Lalpan zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna a sawi chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Aigupta ramah chuan hril ula, Migdol-ah puang rawh u; Noph-ah leh Tahpanes-ah chuan puang ula; ‘Ding nghetin inrâlring rawh u, I vêla mi khandaihin a ei zo tawh si a,’ tiin sawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engati nge i mi chakte hnâwl bo an nih? An ding zo lo, Lalpan a paih thlâk vângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi tam takte chu a petektîr a, A ni, an insu tlu rem rum a, ‘Hnehchhiahna khandaih tlânsanin Hawh u, i kîr ang u, kan pianna ramah, Kan mite hnênah chuan,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Aigupta lal Pharaoa hi thâwm chang lian mai, A hun tak chu a pumpelh a,’ tiin, Tah chuan an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘A nuna ka nun chhûng hi chuan,’ Tih hi Lalber, a hming Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni e, ‘Tlângte zînga Tabor tlâng angin, Tuipui bula Karmel tlâng angin a lo kal ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw nang, fanu, Aigupta rama chêng, Sal tâng tûrin insiam mai rawh; Noph khua chu a ṭiau dâwn si a, Chêng tûr awm lovin a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aigupta chu bâwnglâ nalh tak a ni; Mahse, hmâr ata ei chhetu tûr lo thawkin a lo kal e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An zînga sipai rawih laite chu bâwngtuai châwm thau ang mai an ni. Tukkhum an chhawn a, an tlânchhia, ding lovin, An chungah an chhiatna ni a thleng ta a ni, an hremna hun tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rûlpui tleng ang maiin thâwm a nei a, A hmêlmate chu a rualin an lo kal a, Thing kittute angin hrei nên an rawn bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ram ngawpui fan chhuah zawh loh chu An rawn ṭhiat ang, Khau puang aiin an tam zâwk si a, Chhiar sên rual an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aigupta fanu chu a mualpho vang, Hmâr lama mi kutah mantîrin a awm ang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, No khuaa Amona leh Pharaoa, Aigupta leh a pathiante, a lalte, Pharaoa ngei leh amah ringtute chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An nunna zawngtute kutah leh Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara leh a rawngbâwltute kutah chuan ka mantîr ang. Chumi hnuah chuan luahin a awm ang, hmasâng nite ang bawkin,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Aw Jakob, ka rawngbâwltu, hlau suh la, Aw Israel, zâm hek suh, Ngai rawh, hla tak ata ka chhan chhuak dâwn si chia, I thlahte pawh an sal tânna ram ata chu. Tin, Jakoba chu a lo kîr ang a, Muang takin a awm hle hle ang a, Tu mân an tihlau tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Jakob, ka rawngbâwltu, hlau suh, Ka awmpui che hi,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “Ka hnawh darhna che hnam zawng zawng chu ka titâwp ang a, Nang erawh chu ka titâwp hlen lo vang che. Dik takin ka hrem ang chia, Hrem loh chuan ka chhuah lo vang che.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharaoan Gaza a suasam hmaa, Philistia mite chungchânga zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “A kuang khatin a luang liam ang; Ram chu a chîm ang a, a chhûnga awm zawng zawng nên, Khawpui leh a chhûnga chêngte pawh chu; Mite an ṭap ang a, rama mi zawng zawng an chiau vawng vawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sakawr chak phei khâwng ri-ah, A indo tawlailîr ri dur durah, A tawlailîr nghawr thâwmah te, Pate an zâm a, an fate hawi lo lêkin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia mi zawng zawng rawkna nî, Tura leh Sidon ata ṭanpuitu awm chhunte sah chhumna nî avângin, Lalpa chuan tuipui kam Kaptor-a la awm chhun, Philistia mite chu a tichhe dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza mite lû a lo kâwng ta, Askelon chu a chimit ta a, A ram phaia la chêng chhunte chu; Eng chen nge i inzai dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa khandaih, i awm hle hle hma eng chen nge? I paiah inkhungin châwl la, awm hle hle rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpan tih tûr a pêk si che chuan, Engtin nge i awm hle hle theih ang? Askelon leh tuipui kam chunga che tûrin, A ruat miau si che chuan.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab chungchâng thu: Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Nebo chung a pik e! Tihṭiauvin a awm ta! Kiriathaim chu tihmualphovin a awm ta, lâk sawn a ni a. Misgap chu tihmualpho leh tihchhiatin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab hmingthanna a bo ta. Hesbon-ah a chhiatna tûr rêlin, ‘Hawh u, hnam a nihna ata i tibo vang u,’ an ti a. Aw Madmen khua, nang pawh tihreh dêr i ni ang a, Khandaihin a ûm dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Horonaim aṭanga au thâwm: ‘Rawkrâl leh tihchhiatna nasa tak mai chu!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab a boral e; A fanaute ṭap thâwm hriat tûr a awm e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Luhith chhovah ṭapin an chho va, Horonaim chhukah boralna au thâwm manganthlâk an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlân bo ula, in nun humhim rawh u, Thlalêr ram sabengtung angin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I kutkawih leh i sum leh pai i rin vângin, Nang pawh manin i awm dâwn a ni; Kemos chu sala hruai a ni ang a, A puithiamte leh a hotute nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaw tinah tichhetu a lo thleng ang, Khaw pakhat mahin a pumpelh lo vang; Phai ram pawh chu a boral ang, Phaizâwl pawh tihchhiat a ni ang, Lalpan a sawi tawh ang ngei khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thlawh bo theih nân Moab chu thla pe ula, A khuate chu a ram ang a, luahtu awm lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlahdah taka Lalpa hna thawktu chu ânchhe dawngin awm sela, Thisen chhuah tûra a khandaih hmang duh lotu chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tleirâwl lai ata Moab chu a nuamsa a; Ngâ ngul khawpin a tling reng a, Bêl danga ruah chhuah pawh a tâwk lo va, Sala hruaiin a awm ngai hek lo. A tui ngaia tui rengin, a rim pawh a dang chuang lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chuvâng chuan ngai rawh u, ni chu a lo thleng e, a bun chhuaktu tûr chu ka rawn tîr ang a; tin, annin an bun chhuak ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “A bêlte chu a tiruak ang a, a bûrte chu a tisawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel chhûngten an rin pui ber Bethel an zahpui angin, Moab chuan Kemos a zahpui tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“ ‘Pasalṭha leh râl tu mi huaisen kan ni e,’ Engtiziaa ti nge in nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab chu tihramin a awm a, A khawpui chu meikhuah a chang zo ta, A vâl rual ṭha zawng an tlu hlum zo,” Tih hi Lalber, a hming Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Moab chhiatna chu a lo thleng mêk a, A tuarna tûr a ṭuah ṭêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangni a vêla mi zawngten amah sûnin, A hming hria zawng zawng pawhin, ‘Tiang khauh leh tiang ropui a tliah tâk le!’ ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw nang fanu, Dibon-a chêng, i ropuina chhuksan la, Tuihâlin ṭhu rawh; Moab rawktu chuan a bei chia, I kulhte chu a tichhe ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Aroer-a chêngnu, kawng bulah ding la, en thlîthlai rawh, Tlânchhepa leh relhrunu zâwt la, ‘Eng nge ni ta le?’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moab tihmualpho a ni ta, a lo sawprawp ta si. Chiau vak vakin ṭap rawh u! Moab tihram a ni ta, Tih Arnon-ah puang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ram zâwl chungah rorêlna a lo thleng ta, Holon-ah te, Jahzah-ah te, Mephaath-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />leh Dibon-ah te, Nebo-ah te, Beth-diblathaim-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />leh Kiriathaim-ah te, Beth-gamul-ah te, Beth-meon-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />leh Kerioth-ah te, Bozra-ah te, Moab rama khua zawng zawng, a hla leh a hnaiahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ki chu râwt chhum a ni a, a bân chu tihtliah a ni ta,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Amah chu tirui rawh u, Lalpa chungah a intilian si a. Moab chu ama luakah a tâl ang a, nuihzatbûrin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel chu i tân nuihzatbûr a ni tawh lâwm ni kha? Rûk hmang zîngahte a tel em ni? Ama chungchâng i sawi apiangin i lû i thing si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Moab-a chêngte u, Khawpuite tlânsan ula, khâm kârah chêng rawh u, ṭhuro, pûk kotlânga bu khuar ṭhîn angin awm ru.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab chapona chu kan lo hre ta, a chapo nangei mai, A indahsânzia te, a chapozia te, a chaltlaizia te leh A thinlung induhzia te chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A thinurna chu eng mah a ni lo tih ka hria; A uanthuannate chuan eng mah a thawk kaw lo,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, Moab chungchângah ka chiau vak vak ang a, A ni, Moab pum pui tân ka ṭap ang; Kir-heres mite sûn an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jazer ṭah aia nasain ka ṭah ang che, Aw Sibma grêp kûng! I pêngte chu tuipui chungah an zâr duai a, Jazer tuipui pawh a thleng ta hial e. I nipui thei leh grêp rahte chu tichhetuin a bâwm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hlimna leh lâwmna a bo zo ve, Thei hmun leh Moab ram ata; Uain sâwr khura ka uain ka tikin ta a, Tu mân hlima auvin an chîl tawh lo vang, Au thâwm chu hlim thâwm a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Hesbon leh Eleale-ah an au va, Jahaz thleng thlengin aw an chhuah a, Zoar aṭanga Horonaim thleng, Eglath-selis thleng pawhin; Nimrim tuikhurte a ṭhing ṭhup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu lovah pawh, Moab bâwlhmun thil hlântu leh a pathiante tâna rimtui hâltu chu ka tibo vang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Tichuan, phênglâwng angin ka thinlung chu Moab tân a ri a, Kir-heres mite tân thil tum rîk angin ka thinlung a ri a; chuvângin, hnianghnâra thil a dawn tawhte kha a rîral zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Lu tinrêng ziah kâwn a ni a, khabe hmul tinrêng meh a ni; kut zawng zawng zai a ni a, kâwngahte saiip puan a awm hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab in chung zawng zawngah te, kawtthlêrah te, hmun tinah ṭahna a awm a; Moab chu bêl ṭangkai tawh lo angin ka tikeh zo ta a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“A va chhe tawh êm! An chiau nasatzia chu! Moab chu mualphovin a lehhawi tâk chu! Tichuan, Moab chu a vêla mite zawng zawng tân nuihzatbûr leh râpthlâk a lo ni ta.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh, mu angin a thlâwk dâwn, Moab chungah a thla a zâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kerioth chu lâk a ni a, a kulhte chu an ṭhâwng thut a; Chumi nia Moab pasalṭhate thinlung chu, Hmeichhe nau vei thinlung ang mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moab a boral ang, hnam a tling tawh lo vang; Lalpa a chungtlâk zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hlauhna, khuarkhurum leh thangte, Aw Moab luahtu, i chungah a thleng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Hlauhna tlânsantu chu khuarkhurumah a tla ang, Khuarkhuruma chhuak chu thangah a âwk ang. A hremna kum ka rawn thlen dâwn si, A chungah, Moab chung ngeiah chuan,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Hesbon hlimah tlânchheho chu chau dêrin an ding ang. Hesbon aṭangin mei a chhuak a, Sihon zîng aṭangin mei alh, Moab bek sam a kâng zo va, Sa mur murho chhîp samte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />I chung a pik e, aw Moab! Kemos mite an ral ta; I fapate sala hruaiin, i fanute salah an tâng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mahse, ni hnuhnûngahte chuan Moab awm dân chu ka lamlêt ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Heti chen hi Moab chung thu a ni e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amon fate thu. Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israelan fate a nei lo vem ni? Rokhâwmtu a nei na nge? Engati nge Gad chu Milkoman a luah tâka, A mite a khawpuiahte an chên tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai rawh u, nite a lo thleng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Indo thâwm ri ka hriattîr ang, Amon fate, Raba khuaah; Thil ram awm khâwm mai a lo ni ang a, A fanute chu meiin a kâng ang. Tichuan, Israel chuan amah neitu chu a nei thung ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Hesbon, chiau vak vak la, Ai chu an rawk zo tawh si; Raba fate u, ṭap rawh u, Ṭap ula, hungna chhûngahte tlân vêl rawh u. Milkoma chu sala hruaiin a awm dâwn si, A puithiam leh a mi liante nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engah nge i ruam ṭhate i chhuan, aw rinawm lonu? A neih ṭha ṭhate ringa, ‘Tu nge mi bei ang?’ ti ṭhîntu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai rawh, hlauhna i chungah ka rawn thlen dâwn, I vêla mi zawng zawng lak ata,” Tih hi Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian thuchhuak a ni: “Mi tin hnawh chhuah in ni vek ang; Tu mân tlânchheho chu an khâwm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi hnuah erawh chuan Amon fate awm dân ka lamlêttîr ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom thu. Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Teman-ah finna a awm tawh na nge? Remhre remhriatna a bo zo ta em ni? An finna a bo zo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Dedan-a chêngte u, tlânchhia ula, lehhawi ula, Pil bo daih rawh u! Esauva chhiatna a chungah ka rawn thlen dâwn e, Amah ka hrem hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Grêp lotute chu i hnênah an lo kalin, hmaih an nei dâwn lâwm ni? Zâna rûkrute chuan duh tâwk an ngah hma chu An rawk zêl dâwn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Esauva chu ka tisaruak ta a; A khuh rûk ṭhinte chu ka hawng ta, A biru thei tawh lo vang. A thlahte tihchhiat an ni a, A unaute, a ṭhenawmte nên, A ral thûm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I nau, pa nei lohote chu ngaihsak suh, Keiin ka hum ang, I hmeithaiten mi ring rawh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “No in lo tûrte pawhin an in tlat chuan, nang hrem loh tawpin i chhuak dâwn em ni? Hrem lohvin i chhuak lo vang, i in mawlh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mahni inchhâlin chhia ka chham ta si a, Bozra chu mak tih huai huai, sawi chhiat, tihram, ânchhe dawng a ni ang a, a khua zawng zawng pawh a ram hlen ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa hnên ata thupuan ka lo hre ta, Hnamte hnênah tirhkoh tirh a ni: “Inpun khâwm ula, amah bei ula, Indo puahchah rawh u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai rawh, hnamte zîngah ka titê ta si chia, Mihringte hmuhsitin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I intihrâpthlâkna kha i thinlung chapo bumna che a ni, Aw nang khâm lung kâra tlâng chhîpa chêng ṭhîn! Mu angin, sâng takah i bu chhep mah la, Chumi aṭang chuan ka la thla tho vang che,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tin, Edom chu mak tih huai huai a lo ni ang a, mi veivâk apiangin mak an ti ang a, a chhiat nasat vâng chuan an chek khum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomorra leh a vêla khawpuite tihchhiata a awm ang bawkin, tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, mihring fa tu mah chutah chuan an awm ngai tawh lo vang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ngai rawh u, Jordan ram ngaw aṭanga sakeibaknei, ran thlahna hmunah a lo chho vang a; a lak aṭangin anmahni ka tlân botîr nghâl ang a, a chunga thu nei tûrin ka duh apiang ka ruat ang. Keimah ang hi tu nge awm ni? Tuin nge hunbi mi thliahsak ang? Berâmpu tu nge ka hmaa ding tûr chu?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Edom chunga Lalpa thurâwn leh Teman mite chunga a thil ruat, tih a tum tâkte chu ngaithla rawh u: ran rual notête ngei chu hnuh bovin an awm ang a; an chênna chu a tiṭiau vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An tlûkchhiatna thâwmah chuan lei hi a khûr a; an ṭap thâwm chu Tuipui Senah pawh hriat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, mupui angin a lo thlâwk chho vang a, Bozra chungah chuan a thla a zâr ang; chumi ni chuan Edom mi huaisente thinlung pawh chu hmeichhe nau vei thinlung ang mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Damaska thu. “Hamath chu a zak ta, Arpad nên, Thu ṭha lo an hre ta si a, an rîral ta; Tuipui fâwn awm hle hle thei lo angin an buai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damaska a rawih zo ta; Tlânchhiat a tum a, khurhin a nang ta. Lungngaihna leh nâin a vuan ta, hmeichhe nau vei ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawpui hmingthang leh hlim chu a va ṭhing ta êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi nîah chuan a tlangvâl rualte chu kawtlaiah an tlu ang a, A râl tu mi zawng zawng an boral ang,” Tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tin, Damaska kulh bangah mei ka chhuah ang a, Benhadada lal inte chu a kâng zo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kedar leh Hazor ramte Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran a suasam thu. Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Tho ula, Kedar bei ula, khawchhak fate chu sawisa rawh u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An puan inte, an ran rualte an lâksak ang. An puanzârte, an bungbêl zawng zawngte, An sanghâwngseite chu an kal bopui ang; ‘Kil tinah hlauhawm a awm!’ Tiin miten an au khum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tlânchhia ula, vâk bo daih rawh u! Pil bo daih rawh u, aw Hazor-a chêngte u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chuan A phiar che u, in chungah tih tum a nei ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tho ula, thlamuang taka awm, Mahnia khawsa, kulh kawngkhâr pawh nei lo, Kalhna thîr tlâwn pawh nei lo hnam chu bei rawh u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“An sanghâwngseite chu râlin an la ang a, An sebâwng rual nâwlpui chu an kawi ang; Baksam ziat kâwnghote chu kil tinah ka tidarh ang, An chhiatna tûr chu kil tin aṭangin ka rawn thlen ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tin, Hazor chu sihal chên hmun a ni ang a, A ram kumkhua ang; Tah chuan tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, Mihring fate rêng rêng an khawsa tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia lal ṭan tirha Elam chungchânga Lalpa thu, zâwlnei Jeremia hnêna lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ngai rawh u, Elam thal ngul, an chakna bul ber chu, Ka titliak ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kâwlkil li ata thli palite ka rawn thlen ang, Elam chungah chuan; Ka tidarh ang, kâwlkil tinah chuan; Elam hnawh chhuah mite thlen lohna hnam rêng a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An hmêlma, an nun zawngtute hmaah chuan, Elam-ho chu ka tizâm zo vang. An chungah chhiatna ka rawn thlen ang, Ka thinur nasa tak mai chu,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. ‘Anmahni chu khandaih ka ûmtîr ang, Ka tihral vek hma loh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An lalte leh an hotute tiralin, Elam-ah chuan ka lalṭhutthlêng ka hûng ang,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />‘Mahse, ni hnuhnûngahte chuan heti hi a ni ang, Elam awm dân ka lamlêttîr ang,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni e.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon chungchâng, Kaldai mite ram chungchânga zâwlnei Jeremia kâa Lalpa thusawi chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hnam tin zîngah chuan hril ula, puang rawh u, Puanzâr khai ula, puang ula, thup suh u, ‘Babulon lâk a ni ta, Bela chu a mualpho ta, Merodaka chu a zâm zo ta, a limte chu a mualpho va, A milim chu a chhe zo ta.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmâr aṭangin ani chu hnam pakhatin a rawn bei a, chu chuan a ram chu a tiṭiau vang a, tah chuan tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang; an tlânchhia a, an bo zo ta, mi leh sate pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng nîahte leh chumi hunah chuan Israel fate chu an lo kal ang a, anmahni leh Juda fate nên; ṭap chungin an lo kal ang a, Lalpa an Pathian chu an zawng ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zion lam hawiin an pênna tûr an zâwt ang a, ‘Hawh u, chatuan thuthlung theihnghilh tawh loh tûrah chuan Lalpa chu rawn vuan rawh u khai,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite chu berâm bo an ni a; an vêngtute chuan an hruai bo va, tlângahte chuan an kal botîr a, tlângahte, mual dungahte an kal a, an huang an theihnghilh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmu apiangin an ei zêl a, an hmêlmate chuan, ‘Kan thiam loh a ni lo, Lalpa , dikna khurpui, an thlahtute nghahfâk Lalpa meuh chungah thil an tihsual vâng a ni,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon chhûng ata tlân chhuak ula, Kaldaite ram ata kal chhuak ula, kêl rual zînga kêlchalte angin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Babulon rawn bei tûrin hmâr ram ata hnam rual ropui tak pung khâwm chu ka chawk tho vang a, amah do tûrin an insingsa ang; chuta ṭang chuan lâk an ni ang. An thalte chu râl tuk thiam tak hlawhchham ngai lo ang an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Kaldai chu rawk a ni ang a, a rawktute chu an tlai êm êm ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Lâwm mah ula, hlim mah ula, Aw ka rochan rawktute u, Hnim no zînga bâwngla tla ngelh ngelh ang leh, Sakawrpa hrâm ngher ngher ang ni mah ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In nu chu a la zak êm êm ang a, A hringtu che u chu a la mualpho vang. Ngai rawh u, hnamte zînga hnuaihnung ber, Thlalêr ram, ram ro, ram ruak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thinurna avângin luahin a awm lo vang, A ṭiau vek zâwk ang; Babulon-a kal apiang chu a râp ang a, A chhiatna zawng zawng avâng chuan an chek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thal ngul kengtu zawng zawngte u, Babulon hual vêlin intlar ula, Kâp ula, thalte chu ren suh u, Lalpa chungah an sual ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A vêlin hawhaw ula; Amahin a inpe ta, A kulhte chu a tlu ta a, A bangte chu a chim ta, Lalpa phuba lâkna a ni si a; A chungah phuba la ula, A tih ang zêlin a chungah ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babulon ata chi thehtu râwt bo ula, Buh seng laia favah chawitu nên, Hnehchhiahna khandaih hlauvin, Mahni mite lam an pan ṭheuh vang a, Mahni ram ṭheuhvah an tlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel chu berâm darhsarh a ni a; sakeibakneiten an ûm bo va; Assuria lal chuan amah a ei zet a, a tâwpah Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chuan a ruhte a ṭhial sawm ta a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh u, Assuria lal ka hrem ang bawkin Babulon lal leh a ram chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Israel chu a tlatnaah ka hruai leh ang a, Karmel leh Basan-ah chuan a tla ang a, Ephraim tlângah leh Gilead-ah chuan amah chu a tlai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng nîahte leh chutih hunah chuan Israel khawlohnate chu an zawng ang a, hmuh tûr a awm lo vang; Juda thil tihsualte pawh hmuh tûr a awm hek lo vang; awm chhun atân ka zuahte chu ka ngaidam dâwn si a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Merathaim ram bei rawh u, A ram leh Pekod luahtute ngei chu: That ula, an kuangbâng chenin râwt bo vek ula, Thu ka pêk ang zêlin ti ang che u,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chu ramah chuan râl thâwm a awm, Chhiatna nasa tak thâwm nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawvêl pum pui tuboh chu a phelin, A va keh sawm nasa êm! Hnamte zîngah Babulon chu a va ram nasa ta êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Babulon, i tân thang ka kam e, Hre lovin i âwk ta a nih hi; Hmuh chhuah leh manin i awm ta, Lalpa i beih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a râlthuam bâwm a hawng ta, A thinurna hriamhreite chu a la chhuak ta, Lalpa , Sipaihote Lalpa chuan Kaldaite ramah tih tûr a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ramri tâwpkhâwk aṭangin rawn bei ula, A thil dah khâwmna inte chu hawng vek ula, Theh khâwm ula, tichhe vek rawh u, A eng mah rêng zuah lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A bâwngpatuaite chu tihlum vek ula, Talhin awm vek rawh se. An chung a va pik êm! An ni a lo thleng ta si, Anmahni hremna ni ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian phuba lâk, a biak in phuba lâkna ngei chu, Zion-a hril tûra Babulon aṭanga tlân chhuak leh tlân bote thâwm chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Babulon bei tûrin thal kah thiam, thal ngul hmangtu zawng zawng chu ko khâwm rawh u; a vêlin bûk khuar ula, tu mah chhuak suh se. A thiltih ang zêlin thungrûl rawh u, a tih tâk ang zawng zawng chu a chungah ti rawh u; Lalpa , Israel Mi Thianghlima chu a cho ngam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, a tlangvâlte chu a khawlaiahte an tlu ang a, râl tu mi zawng zawng chu chumi nîah chuan an boral ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngai rawh, nang mi chapo, ka do che a ni!” Lalpa , Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti. “I ni a lo thleng ta, i hremna tûr ni chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, mi chapo chu a petekin a tlu ang a, Tu mân an kai tho lo vang, Tin, a khawpuiahte chuan mei ka chhuah ang a, A vêla awm zawng zawngte chu a kâng fai vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel fate leh Juda fate chu hnehchhiahin an awm ta a; sala hruaitute zawng zawng chuan an vuan tlat a, an chhuah duh hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An tlantu erawh chu a chak a ni; a hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni. Ani chu an lamah a ṭang ang a, Babulon-a chêngte chu tibuaiin, khawvêlah muanna a thlen theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kaldai mite chungah khandaih a lêng e, Babulon-a chêngte, a hotute leh a mi fingte chungah pawh,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Mi dawtheite chungah khandaih, Mi â an lo chang ang! A râl tu mi chungah khandaih, An zâm zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An sakawrte leh tawlailîrte chungah khandaih, A chhûnga mi inpawlhsawp zawng zawng chungah pawh, Hmeichhia ang mai an lo ni ang. A ro thil chungah khandaih, Rawkin an awm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A tuite kangin a ro zo va. Milimte ram a ni si a, Milimte chu an âtchilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuvângin, thlalêr ram sakawlhte, chinghniate nên chutah chuan an chêng ang a, vanghâwngseite pawh chutah chuan an chêng ang; luahin a awm ngai tawh lo vang; chhuan zawng zawng thleng pawhin luahin a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pathianin Sodom leh Gomorra leh a khaw ṭhenawmte a tihchhiat ang hrim khân; tah chuan tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, mihring fa tu mahin an tlawh tawh lo vang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Ngai rawh u, hmâr lam ram ata mite an lo kal e. Lei hmun tâwp ata hnam ropui tak leh lal tam tak an lo thawk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thal ngul leh fei an keng a, Nunrâwng tak, zahngaihna rêng rêng nei lo an ni. An thâwm chu tuipui ri hum hum ang a ni a; Sakawr chungah te an chuang a, Mi tin râl tu mi anga inthuamin, Aw, Babulon fanu, an rawn bei dâwn che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />An thâwm hriain Babulon lal kut a zâwi ta; Hmeichhe nau vei lai natna ang, Natna nasa takin a vuan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, Jordan ram ngaw aṭanga sakeibaknei, ran thlahna hmuna lo chho angin a lo chho vang a; a lak aṭangin anmahni ka tlân botîr nghâl ang a; a chunga thunei tûrin ka duh apiang ka ruat ang. Keimah ang hi tu nge awm ni? Tuin nge hunbi mi thliahsak ang? Berâmpu tu nge ka hmaa ding tûr?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chuvângin, Babulon chungah Lalpa thurâwn, Kaldai mite chunga a thil ruat chu ngaithla rawh u. Ran rual note ngei chu hnuh bovin an awm ang a, ran thlahna hmuna mite a râp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babulon lâk thâwmah lei a nghîng a, a ṭap thâwm chu hnamte zîngah hriat a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, Babulon chungah leh Kaldai mite chungah, Tichhetu thlipui ka tîr dâwn e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sisêp zâptute ka tîr dâwn, Babulon chungah, Amah zâpin a ram an zâp fai ang, Chhiatna nîah chuan hualin an bei dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thal ngul hmangtuin thal ngul kuai lovin, Thîr kawr hain din pawh ding suh se, A tlangvâl rual pakhat pawh zuah lovin, A sipai zawng zawng nuai bo rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaldai ramah thahin an tlu ang a, A khawlaiahte chuan chhun tlang an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel leh Juda chu an Pathian, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan A hnuchhawn si lo va, An ram chu Israel Mi Thianghlima chunga Sualnain a khat na a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlân bo ula, Babulon khaw chhûng ata, Mi tinin mahni nun chhan him rawh se! A khawlohna boral phah suh u, Lalpa phuba lâk hun chu a ni si a. Ani chuan a thungrûl ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babulon chu Lalpa kuta rangkachak no, Lei pum tihruihna chu a ni a, Hnamten a uain chu an in a; Chuvângin, hnamte lung a mâwl zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon chu a tlu thut a, a boral ta. Amah chu ṭah vak vak rawh u, Tihdam theih âwm a nih chuan Thinghnai damdawi hnawih mi lâksak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babulon chu tihdam ka tum a, A dam chuang si lo, Amah kalsanin mahni ram ṭheuhvah i kal ang u, A thiam lohnain vân a tawng a, Vân dum thlenga chawi kân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka dikna a puang ta; Hawh u, Zion-a i puang ang u, Lalpa kan Pathian thiltih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thalte chu tât hriam ula, phâwte chelh rawh u, Media lalte rilru chu Lalpan a chawk tho ta. A thiltum chu Babulon tihchhiat thu a ni si, Chu chu Lalpa phuba lâkna a ni si a, A biak in phuba ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babulon kulh bulah indo puanzâr târ rawh u, Vênna tichakin, râlvêngtu dah rawh u, Lambunnate siam ula, Babulon mite chungchâng thûa Lalpan a sawi kha, a rêlin a tizo ta si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, nang tui tam hmuna chêng mi, Sum leh pai ngah êm êmtu, I tâwpna chu a thleng ta, I nunna hrui a chat ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan mahni inchhâlin chhia a chham ta: “Khau ang maiin mihringin ka tikhat ngei ngei ang che. Nasa takin an hawhaw khum ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thiltihtheihnain lei a siam a, A finnain khawvêl a din a, A remhriatnain vân a tiparh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A aw a chhuah chuan, Vâna tui a ri hum hum a: “Kâwlkil ata chhûm a chhohtîr a; Ruah sûr nân kâwl a phêttîr a; A ro bâwm ata thlî a tlehtîr a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tin an mâwl, hriatna lovin; Rangkachak chhertute chu an milem chherin a tizak a; A milim chhûn chu dâwt mai a ni si, Anmahniah thaw paw a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng mah lo mai an ni, bumna hna mai, Hrem an nih hunah an bo mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakoba chanvo zawng hetiang a ni lo, Thil zawng zawng bul a ni si: Israel hi a roluah hnam a ni a. A hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nang chu ka râl do hreipui leh hriamhrei i ni ṭhîn a: Nangmah hmangin hnamte chu ka tisawm a; Nangmah hmangin lalna ramte chu ka tibo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah hmangin sakawr leh a chung chuang ka tisawm a; Nangmah hmangin tawlailîr leh a chunga chuang ka tisawm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmah hmangin hmeichhia leh mipa ka tisawm a; Nangmah hmangin putar leh tleirâwl ka tisawm a; Nangmah hmangin nula leh tlangvâl ka tisawm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah hmangin berâmpu leh berâm rual ka tisawm a; Nangmah hmangin lo neitu leh bâwngpa tuak ka tisawm a; Nangmah hmangin ram awptute leh puitute ka tisawm ṭhîn a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangma mit hmuh ngeiah Zion chunga an thil ṭha lo tih zawng zawng chu, Babulon leh Kaldai mite chungah ka thungrûl ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ngai rawh, lei pum pui tichhetu, Aw, tichhetu tlâng lian, ka do che a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “I chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, Khâm sâng ata ka lum thla ang che, Tlâng kâng rêm tawhah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I hnên ata a kila lung tûr leh lungphum tûr Lâk chhuah a ni tawh lo vang; Kumkhuain i ṭiau zâwk ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi ramah indo puanzâr târ ula, Hnamte zîngah tawtawrâwt hâm rawh u! Amah do tûr hnamte buatsaih ula: Ararat te, Minni te, Askenaz ram te, Amah bei tûrin ko khâwm rawh u. Amah bei tûrin sipai hotu ruat ula, Khau puang ang maiin sakawrte pun khâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amah do tûr hnamte buatsaih ru, Media lalte, awptute, leh a puitute, A thuneihna ram zawng zawng nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu ram chu na tuarin a khûr a, Babulon ram, luahtu awm lova tiṭiau tûrin, Babulon chunga Lalpa thiltum chu a ding reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babulon râl tu mite chu an ralbâng ta, An kulhpuiah an tawm reng e; An pachanna a dai a, hmeichhia ang mai an lo ni ta; An chênna hmunte a kâng zo va, A daidanna thîr tlâwn a tliak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zualko tlân chuan mi dang pawh a tâwk a, Mi tirh chuan mi dang a tâwk bawk a, Babulon lal hnênah a khawpui chu Kil tinan an man ta tih hrilh tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lui kainate chu an man a, Phairuangte an hâl fai a, Indo mite pawh an zâm zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon fanu chu hruihzâwl rah bel lai ang a ni a, Rei lo teah buh chîl hun a chungah a lo thleng ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Mi ei zo ta, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran, Mi ṭhial sawm a, bêl ruak maiah mi siam ta; Rûlpui angin mi dawlh ta, Ka sa tui tuiin a pum a tikhat a, Mi paih chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei leh ka tisa chunga pâwngnêk thiltih hi, Babulon chungah awm rawh se,” Zion-a chêngten an ti ang; “Ka thisen chu Kaldai mite chungah awm rawh se!” Jerusalem-in a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Ngai rawh, i lamah ka ṭang ang a, I phuba ka lâksak ang che. A tuipui ka tikang ang a, A tuikhur pawh ka tirochâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Babulon chu chhe vawm khâwm mai, Sihal chênna hmun, Mak tih huai huai leh chek khum, Luahtu awm lo hmun a lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sakeibaknei vânglai angin an hûk dum dum ang a, Sakeibakneino angin an hrâm tuar tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An ruih lungpuam hunin ruai ka ṭhehsak ang a; Ka tirui ang, nikhaw hre lo dêrin, ṭhangharh lo tawp tûra an mut hlen theih nân,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka hruai thla ang, berâmno talh tûr angin, Berâmpate, kêlpate ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Sesak chu lâk a nih tâk chu! Lei pum pui chawimawi ṭhin chu manin a awm tâk hi! Hnamte zînga Babulon a ṭiau tâk chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Babulon chu tuipuiin a chîm ta; A fâwn nasa tak chuan a khuh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A khawpuite chu a ṭiau zo va, Ram ro thlalêr, mihring rêng chên lohna, Mihring fa tu ma tlawh loh ram a lo chang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babulon-a Bela chu ka hrem ang, A lem tawh hnu chu a kâ ata ka phawrh chhuak ang; Hnamte chu a hnênah an inhâwr khâwm tawh lo vang. A ni, Babulon kulhpui chu a chim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ka mite u, a chhûng ata lo chhuak ula, Lalpa thinur hlauhawm tak ata, Mi tin mahni inchhanhim rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In thinlung chau suh sela, Chu rama thuthang chu hlau hek suh u; Kum khatah thuthang a lo thleng ang a, Kum dangah thuthang a lo thleng leh dâwn si a, Lal leh lal inbeiin ramah pâwngnêkna a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai rawh u, nite a lo thleng e, Babulon milem chher chawpte chunga Ro ka rêla, a ram pum pui a zahna tûr ni chu; Tin, a chhûngah a mi thahte chu an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hmâr lam ata rûntute an lo thlena, Babulon chu an rawn tihchhiat hunah, Lei leh vân leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu hlimin an zai ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Babulon chuan Israel mi thahte a tlûktîr angin, Babulon-ah chuan ram tina mi thahte an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nangni khandaih pumpelhtute u, kal ula, ding mai mai suh u! Hla tak aṭangin Lalpa hre reng ula, In rilruah chuan Jerusalem lût rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Sawichhiatna thu kan hriat avângin kan zak a, Kan hmuihmai a lo buai zo ta, Lalpa ina hmun thianghlimahte chuan Awze mite an lo lût ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ngai rawh u, nîte a lo thleng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, “An milem chher chawpte chunga ro ka rêlna tûr leh, A ram pum pui chung mi hliamte rûmna ni tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babulon chu vân tawngin sâng mah se, A kulh sângte chu tinghet mah se, A chungah ka hnên ata tichhetute chu an lo thleng tho vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Babulon aṭanga ṭap thâwm leh Kaldai ram aṭanga chhiatna nasa tak thâwm chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Lalpan Babulon chu a rûn a, An thâwm nasa tak mai chu a tihrehsak a. An che vêl thâwm chu tui tam tak ri hum hum ang a ni, An hawhaw dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A chungah rûntu a lo thleng, Babulon ngei chungah, a mi chakte manin an awm a, An thal ngulte a tliak sawm ta; Lalpa chu thungrûltu Pathian a ni si a, A thungrûl ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“Tin, a hotute leh a mi fingte, A awptute leh a puitute Leh mi chakte chu ka tirui ang; An mu hlen ang a, an ṭhangharh lo vang,” Tih hi Lalber, a hming Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon lal kulh bang chhah takte chu a chim vek ang a, A kawngka sâng takte chu a kâng vek ang; A mite chuan a thlâwnin an thawk a, Hnamte chu mei atân mai an intihah a lo ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Juda lal Zedekia lal kum linaa Babulon-a a kal laia a hnêna kal ve Seraia, Maaseia fapa Neria fapa hnêna zâwlnei Jeremia thupêk chu. Seraia chu lal in chhûng hotu ber a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan Babulon chunga chhiatna lo thleng tûr zawng zawng, Babulon chungchânga hêng thuziak zawng zawng hi lehkhabuah a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, Jeremia chuan Seraia hnênah, “Babulon i thlen hunah chuan hêng thu zawng zawng hi chhiar ngei la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />‘Aw Lalpa , he hmun chungchângah hian tu mah, mi leh sa pawh, chên lohna tûra râwt bova awmin, kumkhuaa ṭiau zâwk tûrin thu i sawi tawh a,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni ang a, he lehkhabu hi i chhiar zawhah lung nên ṭâwn belhbawmin Euphrates luiah paih lût la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />‘Babulon chu hetiang mai hian a pil ang, a chunga chhiatna ka rawn thlen tûr avângin a tho leh tawh lo vang; an chau êm êm ang,’ tiin i sawi tûr a ni,” a ti a. Heti zawng hi Jeremia thu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekia chu a lal ṭan tirhin kum sawmhnih leh kum khat mi a ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh kum khat a lal a; a nu hming chu Hamutali a ni a, Libna khuaa Jeremia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Jehoiakima tih ang zêlin Lalpa mit hmuha thil sual chu a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa a thinur êm êm avângin Jerusalem leh Judai ramah chuan a hma ata a paih chhuahna khawpin thil a lo thleng ta a; tichuan, Zedekia chu Babulon lal chungah a hel ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ro a rêl kum kuanaah chuan heti hi a ni a, thla sâwmna, chumi thla ni sâwm nîah chuan, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara leh a sipai rual zawng zawng chu Jerusalem do tûrin an lo kal a, bûk an khuar hnan ta a; a vêlin kulhte an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Zedekia kum sâwm leh kum khatna thlengin khawpui chu hualin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thla lina, chumi thla ni kuanaah chuan khawpuia ṭâm chu a nasa ta hle mai a, ram mipuite tân ei tûr rêng rêng a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, khawpui kulh bang an tipawp a, indo mi zawng zawng chu an tlân bo va, lal huana bang pahnih inkâra kawngkaa chhuakin, zânah khawpui ata an tlân chhuak a (Kaldai mite chu khawpui vêlin an awm a ni a). Araba kawngah chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, Kaldai sipaite chuan lal chu an ûm a, Jeriko phaiah Zedekia chu an ûm phâk ta a, a sipai rual zawng zawng chu a hnên ata an darh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Zedekia chu an man a, Babulon lal hnênah Hamath rama Ribla khuaah an kalpui a; tin, anin a chung thu a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal chuan Zedekia fapate chu a mit hmuh ngeiah a that a; Ribla-ah chuan Juda hotu zawng zawng pawh a that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Zedekia chu a mit a kher chhuahsak a; Babulon lal chuan kawl a buntîr a, Babulon-ah a kalpui a, a thih ni thlengin tân inah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kum sâwm leh kum kuana, thla ngana, chumi thla ni sâwmnaah chuan lal vêngtu pâwl hotu, Babulon lal hmaa ding ṭhîn, Nebuzaradana chu Jerusalem-ah a lo lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in leh lal in a hâl a, Jerusalem-a in zawng zawng nên, in ropui tinrêngte chu meiin a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Kaldai sipai rual zawng zawng, lal vêngtu pâwl hotu hnêna awmte chuan Jerusalem kulhte chu a vêlin an tichim ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chuan mipui zînga rethei pâwl berte, khawpuia hnutchhiahte, Babulon lal hnêna inpe tawhte leh mi themthiam la awm chhun zawng zawng nên salah a hruai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahse, vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chuan rama mi rethei ber ṭhenkhatte chu, grêp huan enkawltu leh vêngtu atân a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ina dâr bante leh Lalpa ina dâr tuizêm leh a nghahchhante chu Kaldai mite chuan an tikeh sawm a, dâr zawng zawng chu Babulon-ah an la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bêl te pawh, vutlawh te, khâwnvâr tihmihna te, maihûn te, thîrfian te, dâr bungbêl zawng zawng an hman ṭhinte chu an la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note pawh, meivâp dahnate, maihûnte, bêlte, khâwnvâr dahnate, thîrfiante leh berhbute, rangkachaka siam chu rangkachakin, tangkaruaa siam chu tangkaruain vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan a la vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ban pahnih, dâra siam bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih, tuizêm nghahchhan, Lal Solomonan Lalpa in atâna a siam chu, hêng bungbêl zawng zawng dâr hi teh rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, bante chu, ban pakhat sân lam chu, tawng sâwm leh tawng riat a ni a, tawng sâwm leh tawng hnihin a vêl zo chauh a ni; a chhah lam chu zung za bêng a ni a, a kawrawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a chungah chuan dâr lû bâwk a awm a, a lû bâwk sân lam chu tawng nga a ni a, a lû bâwk vêl mai chuan dâr hlîra chei mawi leh pawmgranet a ni a; ban pahnih pawh chuan hetiang bawk hian pawmgranet a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a pangah chuan pawmgranet sawmkua leh paruk a awm a, a vêla a cheimawina pawmgranet zawng zawng chu za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan puithiam lal Seraia leh puithiam pahnihna, Zephania leh kawngkhâr vêngtu pathumte chu a man a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tin, indo mite chunga hotua ruat leh mi pasarih, lal hmêl hmu ṭhîn, khawpuia awmte leh sipai hotu ziaktu, rama mite hming vawngtu leh ram mipui zînga mi sawmruk, khawpuia lo awmte chu khawpui ata a hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Nebuzaradana, vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan anmahni a hruai a, Babulon lal hnênah chuan Ribla-ah a rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal chuan Hamath rama Ribla-ah chuan anmahni a nghaisa a, a tihlum ta hlawm a. Chutichuan, Juda hnam chu an ram ata sala hruai bovin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng hi Nebukadnezzaran mipui sala a hruaite chu an ni: kum sarihnaah chuan Juda sângthum leh sawmhnih leh pathum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebukadnezzara kum sâwm leh kum riatnaah chuan Jerusalem aṭangin mi zariat leh sawmthum leh pahnih salah a hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nebukadnezzara kum sawmhnih leh kum thumnaah chuan Nebuzaradana, vêngtu pâwl hotu chuan Juda mi zasarih leh sawmli leh panga salah a hruai a. An zavai chuan sângli leh zaruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Juda lal Jehoiakina kum sawmthum leh kum sarihna, a thla sâwm leh thla hnihna, chumi thla ni sawmhnih leh ni nga ni tak chuan heti hi a lo ni a, Babulon lal Evil-merodaka chuan a rorêl kum khatnaah chuan Juda lal Jehoiakina chu a lû a chawikânsak a, tân in ata chu a hruai chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a hnênah chuan ṭha takin a ṭawng a, Babulon-a a hnêna awm lalho ṭhutthlêng aia sângin a lalṭhutthlêng chu a hûnsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, a tân in silhfênte chu a thlâktîr a, a dam chhûng ni zawng zawng chuan a hmaah a eiin a bâr ṭhîn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a châwm nân chuan a dam chhûng ni zawng zawng, a thih ni thlengin, a ni tin chanvo chu Babulon lalin a pe ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
